window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3901,"title":"Chapter 3901: Hardships","paragraphs":["Chapter 3901: Hardships","Editor: Henyee Translations","After taking the photos, Dan Yi didn’t leave immediately. Instead, she said a few unwilling words to the men who had dragged Ye Jian and the other two out. As she spoke, she glanced at the three Chinese female soldiers. The words she said seemed to be squeezed out of her teeth. They were sinister and distorted.","The men nodded to show that they understood.","When she left, Dan Yi glared at the three Chinese female soldiers with deep hatred in her eyes. Then, she held her camera tightly and left.","Her departure caused Liu Le’s tense body to collapse instantly. She felt that she had escaped another calamity.","No one cared about the female soldier’s tears. Since the photos had been taken, the men quickly covered their heads once more and dragged them back to the dungeon.","As the iron door closed, Liu Le collapsed weakly on the ground as if all her energy had been sucked out. Her heavy breathing could be heard from inside the dungeon.","Ye Jian moved closer to her and used her body to comfort Liu Le silently. She wanted to tell her not to be afraid and that everything would pass. Zhou Yijin also moved closer to Liu Le, squeezing her body to comfort her.","Perhaps her comrades’ consolation was effective. Liu Le, who was trembling all over, finally relaxed. Gradually, her body stopped moving. Even the gasping sounds of the company subsided.","Her calmness allowed Ye Jian’s tense heart to relax temporarily. Her fingers were writing on the back of Liu Le’s hand. Ye Jian was afraid that she wouldn’t know what she was writing, so Ye Jian wrote very slowly. She wrote comforting words on the back of Liu Le’s hand so that she could relax even more.","[I will protect you. Don’t be afraid.]","After writing this sentence, Ye Jian wrote another sentence. [Our men are outside. We’ll definitely return to the military unit safely.]","Ye Jian spent ten minutes writing these words. Liu Le didn’t manage to guess every single word, but she managed to guess more than half of it. It was enough to dispel more than half of the fear in her heart.","Ten minutes later, a few men brought water and bread over. They didn’t hand the food to Ye Jian and the other two, though. They just took off the balaclavas and forced the food down their throats. The men’s voices were rough as they said, “Eat.”","Ye Jian didn’t know how long she had been hungry for. She didn’t reject the water and bread that was stuffed into her mouth. When she bit into the bread, there was gritty sand and mud inside. Even so, she ate it bite by bite.","Ye Jian didn’t waste the bread and water that were filled with sand and mud. However, Zhou Yijin and Liu Le couldn’t do it. After Zhou Yijin’s mouth was stuffed with a mouthful of bread, her face turned green instantly. Liu Le started vomiting.","Hearing the sound of vomiting, Ye Jian, whose mouth was stuffed with bread, only managed to say the word ‘eat’. Before she could say anything else, she was punched in the stomach. The Burmese man who stuffed the bread into her mouth threatened her in awkward Mandarin, “Don’t talk. Shut up! If not, I’ll starve you to death!”","He exerted all his strength in his punch. Ye Jian’s abdomen was instantly in pain. It was so painful that Ye Jian’s back arched. She didn’t say anything else. She couldn’t speak anymore. The other party forcefully stuffed the entire bread into her mouth. It was difficult for her to even chew it. How could she speak?","The beating Ye Jian received made Zhou Yijin furious. She knew that she was the one who implicated Ye Jian. When she saw this, even if she didn’t want to eat the bread, she forced her nausea down and swallowed the bread."]},{"number":3902,"title":"Chapter 3902: Resolute","paragraphs":["Chapter 3902: Resolute","Editor: Henyee Translations","Every time she swallowed, Zhou Yijin felt as though her throat was being cut by a knife.","Ever since she was born, she had never eaten anything that had mud and sand on it. She had never eaten food that had fallen to the ground in her entire life. Today, not only did she swallow the stale bread, but she also swallowed the water that wasn’t clean at all. They had purposely added mud to the water.","At first, Liu Le couldn’t swallow even a mouthful of bread. However, Ye Jian’s beating made her frightened and furious. Her fighting spirit was stimulated. With tears all over her face, she bit the bread that had been stepped on and swallowed it without chewing.","She ate a little and vomited it out.","Ye Jian saw that Liu Le’s face was pale from vomiting, but she still finished her bread forcefully. She had been worried that Liu Le wouldn’t be able to hold on for long. Looking at her now, Ye Jian felt at ease.","No matter how delicate or frightened Liu Le was, she was still a Chinese soldier. Chinese soldiers had an unyielding spirit. How could Liu Le be defeated so easily?","Of course not!","Ye Jian didn’t waste a single drop of water in the cup as these people laughed wildly. They were laughing now. But when the time was right, they would cry!","Moreover, Ye Jian had to thank these people for not adding their urine to the water!","After eating the bread and drinking water, these people didn’t put the balaclavas on the female soldiers anymore. They didn’t stuff their mouths either. They got up and left the dungeon. Without the balaclavas, the female soldiers could see each other. They could comfort and encourage each other through difficulties.","Among the three of them, Ye Jian was the youngest. However, Ye Jian had experienced so many things. In addition, she was here to save them, so she naturally became the pillar of support for them. Looking at the two of them, Ye Jian had a warm and firm smile in her eyes.","When Zhou Yijin and Liu Le saw her smile, it was like the sunlight piercing through the darkness and bringing light. The two of them laughed at the same time.","“Trust me, everything will pass,” Ye Jian said softly. She wasn’t speaking Mandarin but the dialect of the Southern Province. It sounded a little like Mandarin. Liu Le’s hometown was close to the Southern Province, so she could understand it.","Zhou Yijin graduated from the Southern Province University. She knew how to speak the Southern Province dialect, so she understood what Ye Jian said the moment she opened her mouth.","Liu Le, who understood what she meant, burst into tears. Her cheeks were hurting from getting her mouth stuffed with food. Besides eating once a day, her mouth was always stuffed with a piece of cloth that came out of nowhere. Even her chin was hurting now.","Her tears fell like rain. She wanted to laugh again. However, the moment she opened her mouth, the pain in her chin caused her expression to twist. Hence, her delicate facial features became a little funny. Zhou Yijin, who was calmer, couldn’t help but laugh when she saw this.","Hearing her laugh, Liu Le’s tears stopped. She wanted to smile too. Her chin hurt, so she couldn’t smile normally. Thus, Liu Le could only grit her teeth and smile weirdly.","Their smiles made the glint in Ye Jian’s eyes deepen. Being captives wasn’t scary. As long as their mental state wasn’t crippled, they would be able to escape. Just like how K7 was captured in the past. The pain he suffered was much worse than what they were suffering now."]},{"number":3903,"title":"Chapter 3903: He’s Here","paragraphs":["Chapter 3903: He’s Here","Editor: Henyee Translations","Insults and beatings happened every day. There was also physical torture and mental torture. However, K7 survived them all. In the end, his comrades saved him.","He believed that as long as he persevered, his comrades would come and save him.","Similarly, she hoped that Zhou Yijin and Liu Le would believe the words she wrote on their palms when she came in.","[Don’t be afraid. I’m here to save you. I will definitely bring you back.]","This was her promise. She would definitely fulfill it.","Previously, Liu Le didn’t believe that Ye Jian would be able to save them. But now, she believed it.","She looked at the pair of black eyes that were filled with determination and a smile. The world in her eyes was so vast and bright. It allowed her to see the sunlight and the hope of survival.","This glance was enough for her to believe in Ye Jian.","The three of them, who were encouraging each other, sat in the dungeon. Even if they didn’t say a word, just a look from each other was enough to give them warmth. The photo of the three of them being forced to kneel while being held at gunpoint had been printed and sent to Qin Maosheng.","Around 1:00 pm, the photo was sent to Qin Maosheng, who was only a mountain away from the village where Ye Jian and the rest were imprisoned. Qin Maosheng nodded in satisfaction when he received the photo. Not bad, it was taken according to his wishes.","To show his strength, Qin Maosheng invited Cobra, who was waiting for Xia Jinyuan and Luke.","Cobra was looking at the photo in his hands. He saw the three female soldiers in the photo. His gaze landed on the left side of the photo. There was a short-haired female soldier with a stubborn look in her eyes. He narrowed his eyes slightly.","This Chinese female soldier looked much calmer than the other two female soldiers. That kind of calmness... made him have the urge to cripple her. He wanted to tear apart her calm appearance and see if she was really calm deep down.","Usually, torturing someone with such a stubborn gaze would give him a greater sense of accomplishment.","Cobra, who loved to cripple other people’s wills, didn’t reject Qin Maosheng’s invitation to show off his ability. He also wanted to show off. He handed the photo in his hand back to Qin Maosheng and raised his eyebrows with a smile. “I feel very honored by your invitation, but I want to wait for my two subordinates to come back before going over.”","Qin Maosheng’s smile froze for a few seconds. Two subordinates? Were they the two people who attracted the attention of the Chinese armed police?","They returned to Myanmar from China so quickly?","Or was he wrong?","“Of course. We have a lot of time anyway.” To confirm if he was wrong, Qin Maosheng immediately probed and pretended to ask casually, “Two subordinates? Mr. Cobra, who are these subordinates?”","“Luke and Xia have already snuck back to Myanmar. I require your help to bring them back.”","Hearing this, Qin Maosheng’s pupils constricted a little. They actually escaped from the guns of the Chinese border defense armed police officers so quickly. Who exactly was Cobra? He couldn’t find much information on him!","Qin Maosheng quickly concealed his shock and laughed loudly. He immediately nodded and agreed to Cobra’s request. He liked to interact with such an adventurous fellow. He found him very interesting!","That was what Qin Maosheng thought. He liked Cobra too."]},{"number":3904,"title":"Chapter 3904: Smart","paragraphs":["Chapter 3904: Smart","Editor: Henyee Translations","Cobra was in other people’s territory now, so he wasn’t worried that he would encounter any danger on the way. He wasn’t worried that he would be killed by Qin Maosheng because he had gained the admiration of Commander Minlai.","A cunning fellow wouldn’t do anything that would make his backer hate him.","He clearly expressed his intention now. If Qin Maosheng really had the intention to cooperate with him, he would definitely send someone to bring Luke and Xia back. This was because the cunning and smart Qin Maosheng knew that since he couldn’t do something that backer hated, he might as well settle the matter with his partner properly and let his backer believe that he had the ability to earn more money.","Of course, this wasn’t the real reason why Cobra agreed to take a look at how the Chinese female soldiers were treated. He wanted to know how resourceful Qin Maosheng was. He was so arrogant that he dared to kidnap soldiers from a peaceful country.","Even Cobra didn’t dare to do it, but Qin Maosheng did. It was really interesting. It was so interesting that he wanted to see how much wealth this bold and arrogant fellow had.","However, Cobra believed that this fellow would lose everything in the near future.","Why?","No country could tolerate their soldiers being kidnapped and threatened by the mafia boss of a small country. If Qin Maosheng dared to do this, he would have to bear the consequences of angering a country.","What were the consequences of angering a country?","Cobra couldn’t help but smile. He had already thought of what kind of ending awaited Qin Maosheng.","Without thinking, he nodded and agreed to take a look at the situation with the other party. He also wanted to see Qin Maosheng’s last moments. In the future, he would be the one taking over Qin Maosheng’s business deals with Commander Minlai.","He believed that with Commander Minlai’s appetite, he would definitely be able to establish a long-term cooperation with him.","Qin Maosheng didn’t know what Cobra was thinking. He immediately sent a Jeep to bring back Xia Jinyuan and Luke, who were not far away from them.","Cobra was very satisfied with his straightforwardness. He waited for Luke and Xia, his two most capable subordinates, to come back with peace of mind.","Cobra’s calmness and Xia Jinyuan and Luke’s ability to end the battle quickly made Qin Maosheng afraid of Cobra. He didn’t dare to act rashly.","This was the effect Cobra wanted. He wanted to let the other party know that he was not someone who could be easily messed with. It would be for the best if Qin Maosheng maintained a sincere heart and cooperated with him happily.","If not, Cobra couldn’t guarantee that he wouldn’t send his bodyguards to secretly kill this man who refused to cooperate with him sincerely.","Qin Maosheng, who couldn’t make a move right now, contacted his subordinates guarding the three Chinese female soldiers from time to time to confirm that everything was normal.","Cobra listened to everything and nodded secretly at the other party’s meticulous arrangements.","This was a very vigilant partner. It would save him a lot of trouble. He liked to cooperate with people who wouldn’t trouble him because the transaction would be safe and efficient.","If the Chinese didn’t do anything to Qin Maosheng this time, Cobra was indeed very willing to cooperate with him. If Qin Maosheng was wiped out by the Chinese, Cobra wouldn’t feel sorry for him.","His old friend once said, “The winner is the king, and the loser is the bandit.” If Qin Maosheng was really killed by the Chinese, Cobra wouldn’t lose anything."]},{"number":3905,"title":"Chapter 3905: Staring At The Abyss","paragraphs":["Chapter 3905: Staring At The Abyss","Editor: Henyee Translations","While waiting for Xia Jinyuan and Luke to come back, Cobra asked his men to pay attention to their surroundings. He didn’t want to attract the attention of the Chinese armed forces before he left.","The bodyguards were instructed to pay close attention to their surroundings. From time to time, they would find a high ground and secretly observe the entire village with binoculars and the nearby mountains. When V8 and the rest saw this, they didn’t dare to move rashly. They maintained their current posture and didn’t move. Even if insects crawled into their clothes and bit them, they would maintain their original posture.","G3 and the rest had already known that Xia Jinyuan would take a car to reach the village where V8 was. They took a shortcut and rushed to the destination. They wanted to meet up with V8 as soon as possible.","At around 4:00 pm that day, a few photos of the Chinese female soldiers kneeling on the ground with their hands and feet tied appeared in Xu Yu’s hands. The photos were sandwiched in the newspaper. A child had handed them to the armed police officer who was guarding the checkpoint. In the end, they were passed to Xu Yu.","The photos were in Xu Yu’s hands. However, the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade didn’t see Qin Maosheng appearing in the village where the female soldiers were imprisoned. This made them suspect that their target might not come over.","If he didn’t come over, should they consider going to the village where Qin Maosheng was at and killing him directly?","The team leader of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade had just reported their current situation and his thoughts to the military, but the military rejected his suggestion.","“There’s no need to adjust our combat strategy. Qin Maosheng can’t appear for the time being because he has something to do. Wait patiently.” This was the reply from the military to the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade that was guarding the village where Ye Jian was imprisoned.","According to the report from the special forces, Qin Maosheng was still in the same village. He didn’t have any intention of going to the village where the female soldiers were locked up.","In addition, Commander Xia had already arrived at the military district and was sitting in the conference room with the leaders of the military district. He made adjustments to this mission again. The Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade was on standby and continued to observe the situation closely.","There were three juniors in his family who were in danger at the same time. Commander Xia, who was far away in the capital city, finished dealing with his matters and took the earliest Class One plane to Changshui Airport this morning. He arrived at the military area around 1:00 pm.","Then, he went to the border defense checkpoint with the leader of the military to meet Xu Yu. While the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade, who were guarding the village where the female soldiers were imprisoned, were reporting their situation to the higher-ups, Commander Xia, who was sitting in the conference room, was holding the photos of the Chinese female soldiers kneeling while being held at gunpoint.","When he saw the photos taken from the front, left, and right angles, his expression was so dark that the leaders of the military couldn’t help but hold their breaths. Their hearts were in their throats.","He threw the photos in his hands onto the conference table and slapped it heavily. Commander Xia’s gaze was cold as he said, “They’re lawless! They want to trample on the faces of our Chinese soldiers to show off. Who gave them the guts?”","Even though Commander Xia knew why Qin Maosheng kidnapped the Chinese female soldiers, the moment he saw the photos, the anger in his heart burned. He slammed the table angrily. The entire conference room was so quiet that even the sound of their breathing couldn’t be heard.","“How’s the firepower of the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade? How far are the two villages from each other? How many people are there? What’s the firepower? Do you have an accurate number?”","Commander Xia was the only one who broke the silence. Besides him, no one else dared to speak."]},{"number":3906,"title":"Chapter 3906: Let’s Fight","paragraphs":["Chapter 3906: Let’s Fight","Editor: Henyee Translations","The leader of the Yun Province Military District immediately reported, “The village where Qin Maosheng is currently at is his hiding place. It’s very close to a certain military unit in Myanmar that’s protecting him. This is also the main reason why we want to wait for Qin Maosheng to reach the village where the female soldiers are being held.”","They didn’t want to attract the close-range firepower support of a certain military unit in Myanmar. The village where the female soldiers were locked up was more than 100 kilometers away from the military unit that was protecting Qin Maosheng. If a certain military unit wanted to support Qin Maosheng, they wouldn’t be able to rush over in time. This would increase China’s chances of winning and prevent a firepower conflict with the Myanmar military unit to a large extent. This would also prevent any future conflicts between the two countries.","“Also, the village where the female soldiers are detained is a drug den. The firepower there isn’t as strong as the firepower in the village where Qin Maosheng is. If we take action there, our chances of winning will increase.”","After reporting the approximate numbers and firepower of the two villages, the leader of the Yun Province Military District exchanged glances with Xu Yu a few times.","They felt that... Commander Xia might do something big.","Commander Xia wanted to do something big to shock the criminals who wanted to harm the Chinese military.","Now, there were two special forces soldiers keeping an eye on the two villages. One of the two villages was Qin Maosheng’s hiding place while the other was a drug den. If one looked carefully, the firepower of the two villages should be on par.","In that case, it was unrealistic for the members of the two military units to attack the two villages separately. They could only concentrate on one village to increase the probability of winning for the soldiers.","It was alright if they didn’t attack the village where Qin Maosheng was hiding. Once the village where the drugs were kept was attacked, the village he was hiding in would also be exposed. An exposed hiding place would lose its purpose and become an abandoned village.","There were a total of 16 special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit, including Azure Bird and Q King. There were also 14 people from the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade. That meant that there were a total of 30 special forces soldiers. Besides Azure Bird who wasn’t carrying any lethal guns and ammunition, the other 29 special forces soldiers were all carrying lethal guns and ammunition...","30 people against almost 200 people... Commander Xia pursed his lips. He needed to ask the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade and the two groups of special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit.","Very soon, the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade and the special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit, who were split into two teams, spoke to Commander Xia directly. As Commander Xia asked his questions, the atmosphere in the conference room became more and more tense.","As expected, Commander Xia was really planning something big!","Xu Yu couldn’t help but clench his fists. If they could really do it, it would be equivalent to getting rid of a huge malignant tumor. They would be able to take revenge on behalf of the soldiers!","The special Forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit opened the map of the drug hideout sent by the Yun Province Military District. After a short and detailed communication, G3 said to his comrades, “Since everyone is confident, this bandit-killing battle will start!”","“Let’s do it! Damn it, they actually got Azure Bird and the rest to kneel to take photos of them. If we don’t teach them a lesson, I wonder how arrogant they’ll be!” T6 said with a fierce gaze. The rifle in his hand was ready to fight alongside him. He was waiting for the battle to start.","They were all wearing miscellaneous military uniforms now. After entering Myanmar, they lost their identities. If something really happened, even if the Myanmar side knew that it was done by the Chinese side, they wouldn’t be able to tell anyone."]},{"number":3907,"title":"Chapter 3907: Shared Blame","paragraphs":["Chapter 3907: Shared Blame","Editor: Henyee Translations","Kidnapping Chinese female soldiers with the support of their country’s military unit... If they revealed this, they would be denounced by other countries.","G3’s comrades had no objections. They did as they were told.","V8 and the rest didn’t have any objections either. Today, these drug dealers even dared to kidnap the Chinese soldiers. What would happen in the future? Would they be able to enter China and kidnap the Chinese citizens?","Those were the people they were protecting with their lives. How could they be threatened?","This time, they even dared to trample on the dignity of the Chinese soldiers. What about the future?","No, there was no need to wait for the future. The other party was already doing this now! The arrogant drug dealers had already trampled on the dignity of their country by threatening the Chinese side to agree to their conditions!","This was a battle for dignity and for the country’s strength.","They answered Commander Xia at the same time, “We can do it!”","The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade, who had already seen how the Chinese female soldiers were dragged out of the dungeon, had been furious from the start. After a short conversation with Commander Xia, the team made a request to see if they could communicate wirelessly with their comrades from the other unit. This would require the communication specialists from both sides.","Commander Xia agreed to the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade’s request. The two different wireless communication systems started to debug and build bridges.","Just as the specialists on both sides were busy establishing the same wireless communication, the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade started their deployment.","“There’s another group of brothers from the special forces. Commander Xia just said that their combat ability is top-notch in the country, and they’re comparable to the Western special forces. He has already told us that our firepower is very strong. We have 14 people on our side. We’ll guard this place and send four people to infiltrate the village and kill their machine gunners...”","The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade, who had been guarding here for more than ten hours, took on the mission. They were more familiar with the terrain of this area than the members of the Xueyu unit. They also knew where the heavy firearms were. Hence, it was most suitable for them to take on the mission.","The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit were on the periphery, ensuring the safety of the Cloud Leopard members.","Very soon, the electronic communication between the special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit and the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade was successfully made through the ‘relay station’. After adjusting, the soldiers from the two different units could hear each other.","This was also the first time everyone knew about each other’s existence.","The two sides didn’t communicate much. It was impossible for them to maintain a long conversation. Although anti-interference was established, it was better to be careful.","G3 and the rest were still walking along the shortcut to the village where Cobra was. As for V8 and the rest, they were waiting for Xia Jinyuan’s arrival.","Through the binoculars, they saw that the jeep that had driven out of the village had returned. V8, who received news from G3 that Q King would take a car back to the village, smiled.","“All our targets have appeared. How far are you from us?” V8 saw Xia Jinyuan getting out of the car through the binoculars and asked G3 and the rest. “If they plan to go to the village where the female soldiers are, they will probably arrange it today.”","Xia Jinyuan and Luke finally met up with Cobra. After knowing that the two of them were back, Cobra specially came out to welcome them. When he saw Luke jump down from the car, Cobra had already gone up to welcome him. He hugged him tightly.","“Good job, Luke! You didn’t disappoint me.” Cobra laughed loudly. Behind him, the sun rays were hidden in the clouds, and the sky looked dim and gray. He was smiling, but there was a hint of coldness on his thin face."]},{"number":3908,"title":"Chapter 3908: Compromise","paragraphs":["Chapter 3908: Compromise","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan jumped down from the car and walked over as well. Cobra’s gaze landed on Luke’s face. At this moment, the smile on his face was brighter than ever.","“Xia, the brother I admire the most, your safe return can finally make me feel at ease.” Compared to Luke, Cobra found himself trusting Xia Jinyuan more and more. He treated him as his brother.","If calling him ‘brother’ could get him a capable subordinate who was very loyal to him, Cobra felt that this was a good deal.","In fact, he didn’t need a ‘brother’. He needed more capable subordinates who were loyal to him.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t say much. However, when Cobra said that he was his brother, he tried his best to hide the excitement in his eyes. He quickly concealed it and only smiled faintly. He said calmly, “I’m very happy too.”","Glancing at Qin Maosheng’s subordinates, Xia Jinyuan said, “It looks like they’re quite well-behaved.”","It was a concise sentence. It seemed like he didn’t say anything of importance, but the smile in Cobra’s eyes got deeper. He understood what his capable subordinate wanted to say.","“If they don’t behave, my safety will be a problem. Now that you and Luke have returned safely, I’m safe too. We’re all safe now.”","Cobra patted the shoulder of the subordinate he admired very much. It could be seen that his trust in Xia Jinyuan had increased.","When Luke saw this, he kept smiling. He seemed to be happy that Xia Jinyuan had gained Cobra’s trust.","Qin Maosheng, who had been waiting for Xia Jinyuan and Luke to come back, had a dark expression on his face after his subordinates brought the two back. The two people who escaped back to Myanmar didn’t even have minor injuries. How did these two people escape from the police?","If the two subordinates who were randomly sent out were already so powerful, what about the subordinates who had always been by Cobra’s side? Wouldn’t they be even more powerful?","Qin Maosheng had a deeper fear of Cobra’s power. At the same time, he grew more defensive.","He had to prevent the other party from surpassing him and contacting Commander Minlai privately!","Qin Maosheng walked out of the wooden house with a gloomy look in his eyes. When he saw a few figures walking over in front of him, a warm smile immediately appeared on his face. He walked down the stairs of the wooden house in a few steps. Before he arrived, his voice was already clear. “Thank god you managed to safely return!”","He walked quickly and laughed as he spoke. The gloominess in the room disappeared when everyone saw his facial expression. Before Luke could say anything, Qin Maosheng opened his arms and hugged him.","Luke acted as if he didn’t know anything and cooperated with the other party. “Yes, I’m glad that my brother and I managed to escape successfully. We came back alive and got to see Mr. Cobra again. Mr. Qin, are you alright? After not seeing you for a few days, you seem... especially happy. Are you happy that we came back alive?”","“Hahaha, that’s right. I’m very happy that you came back alive. I know that my subordinates went to pick you and your brother up. I’ve already prepared champagne to celebrate our first successful cooperation.”","“That’s great. In order to come back earlier, I exhausted myself. I need some alcohol to stimulate me and give me the energy to continue standing and talking to you.”","Luke seemed to be better at socializing than Cobra."]},{"number":3909,"title":"Chapter 3909: Shocking News","paragraphs":["Chapter 3909: Shocking News","Editor: Henyee Translations","Cobra also wanted Luke to stand up for him. When he saw this, he didn’t stop him. Instead, he supported him.","He couldn’t help but tease Qin Maosheng, “Luke likes to drink and is good at drinking. If you only prepare a bottle of champagne, Luke will be very disappointed.”","“Hahaha, of course, I’ve prepared all sorts of drinks. I have everything you want to drink!” Qin Maosheng let go of Luke’s arm and turned his target to Xia Jinyuan. He was less enthusiastic about this man who was obviously from Asia.","This man’s facial features were too similar to a Chinese man. Qin Maosheng was not used to the cold aura on his body. He felt that he was looking at a cold sword that would land on his neck at any moment. He didn’t like the Asian man who gave him this feeling.","Xia Jinyuan saw through Qin Maosheng’s coldness toward him. When he saw him walking over, he took a step back and used his actions to tell the other party that they should not disgust each other.","Cobra liked Xia Jinyuan’s honest and unpretentious reaction. He even wanted to shield Xia Jinyuan. He said, “Let’s hurry up and celebrate. There are more important things to do, right?”","Important things to do?","Xia Jinyuan, who was standing beside Cobra, lowered his eyes. What other important things did they have to do?","Xia Jinyuan didn’t take Qin Maosheng’s words to heart. He tried his best to minimize contact with the rest of them and used the excuse that he needed to wash up as an excuse. He didn’t drink champagne with Luke to celebrate his safe return. He was always a loner, so they didn’t force him. They let him go readily and said with concern, “You can rest for a while before coming out again.”","Xia Jinyuan didn’t have a good rest. After he changed into his clean and tidy uniform, he knew what the ‘important thing’ was referring to.","“They kidnapped Chinese female soldiers! Oh my god, I’m really shocked by Qin Maosheng’s guts. He actually dares to kidnap Chinese soldiers! After seeing the capabilities of the Chinese border defense armed police officers and hearing that he kidnapped Chinese soldiers, I really admire his courage now.”","Luke, who smelled like alcohol, stuffed the entire champagne bottle into Xia Jinyuan’s hand. His tone and facial expression didn’t hide his shock at what Qin Maosheng did.","“Does he plan to fight with the entire Chinese military? Although our Mr. Cobra has kidnapped regular government forces before, he’d never attack the soldiers of non-war-torn countries. He’d only challenge the chaotic countries.","“Qin Maosheng actually did something that even Mr. Cobra wouldn’t do. Xia, I’m still shocked. It’s really too shocking.” Luke used compliments and his tone to express his shock.","Xia Jinyuan used his calm expression to face this shocking and sudden piece of news.","Chinese female soldiers had been kidnapped!","How dare a mafia boss kidnap Chinese female soldiers?","Did China already know?","Was there a rescue plan?","“Why did he kidnap the Chinese female soldiers?” Xia Jinyuan looked calm, but his heart was heavy. He asked calmly, “What does he want to do by kidnapping the Chinese female soldiers? Is he going against the entire Chinese armed forces? Or is it just to provoke the dignity of the country?”"]},{"number":3910,"title":"Chapter 3910: Cut In","paragraphs":["Chapter 3910: Cut In","Editor: Henyee Translations","Luke felt that Xia Jinyuan had asked about the crux of the matter. He couldn’t help but laugh.","“Hahaha, make an enemy of a country’s armed forces? Mr. Qin Maosheng doesn’t have the guts. He kidnapped those Chinese female soldiers because he wants to make a deal with the Chinese armed police. Hahaha, does it sound incomprehensible? That’s right, that’s how he thinks. That’s why he did it.","“Hahaha, my god, I still can’t believe what I heard. By kidnapping the soldiers of another country, he’s provoking the dignity of that country. The champagne is not bad. Let’s drink it and celebrate our safe return.”","Xia Jinyuan shook the bottle of champagne and raised his head. His sexy Adam’s apple and neck straightened, forming a cold and slightly curved arc. As his Adam’s apple moved, he drank a mouthful of champagne.","He needed some alcohol to calm his heart.","Xia Jinyuan took the champagne bottle and clinked it with the champagne bottle in Luke’s hand. Amidst the clear and crisp sound of glass, Luke chuckled and raised his head to take two sips. He put down the champagne and wiped the liquid from the corner of his mouth. Then, he said, “Poor fellow. I think his ending will be very tragic. Mr. Cobra didn’t want to remind him because...”","What was the reason?","Luke didn’t say it out loud. He leaned closer to Xia Jinyuan and said softly, “It’s because Mr. Cobra wants to work with Commander Minlai alone. Later, Mr. Cobra will tell you why he didn’t remind Qin Maosheng.”","Kidnapping Chinese female soldiers and using it as a threat to make a deal with the Chinese police... Who gave Qin Maosheng the guts to do this?","Xia Jinyuan held the champagne bottle tightly. The frost in his eyes gradually faded, making him look even more handsome and cold.","Luke touched Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder lightly and said in a low voice, “He even dares to kidnap female soldiers from the Chinese military. No wonder he’s able to have such great conversations with Mr. Cobra. As it turns out, he and Mr. Cobra are the same kind of people. He even dares to kidnap a regular government soldier. What do you think the Chinese will do when they find out? Will they send people to kill the bold Qin Maosheng directly? If the Chinese really send people over, won’t Mr. Cobra be in danger?”","His words made the corners of Xia Jinyuan’s eyes twitch a few times.","He didn’t know if the Chinese had sent people to save the female soldiers, but his comrades from the Xueyu unit had definitely arrived. It looked like he needed to adjust his plan.","He needed to save the female soldiers first!","53 hours had passed since Ye Jian’s kidnapping.","The laughter in the wooden house was no longer confined to the house. As the people who were laughing walked out, the laughter entered his ears clearly. Xia Jinyuan, who had put the bottle of champagne aside, looked up. His gaze landed on the two figures walking out side by side.","The taller one was Cobra, and the shorter one was Qin Maosheng. He was someone who dared to kidnap Chinese soldiers!","Xia Jinyuan’s gaze swept past Qin Maosheng’s face. When he retracted his gaze, he inadvertently met Qin Maosheng’s gaze. Their gazes met for a moment before he retracted it calmly.","“Your subordinate looks at me as if he wants to kill me.” Qin Maosheng was half-joking and half-serious. Then, he looked at Xia Jinyuan with an unfriendly gaze.","When Cobra heard this, he smiled and said to his subordinate who was in charge of translating, “Tell him that he’s thinking too much. Xia looks at everyone like this. He shouldn’t misunderstand.”","Cobra misunderstood. He thought that Xia Jinyuan’s killing intent toward Qin Maosheng was because of his scheme."]},{"number":3911,"title":"Chapter 3911: Should I Speak?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3911: Should I Speak?","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan, who knew that Chinese female soldiers had been kidnapped, had a killing intent toward Qin Maosheng. However, he ended up pleasing Cobra again. This was something Xia Jinyuan didn’t expect.","Qin Maosheng still had some small matters to settle. He agreed to leave at 6:00 pm sharp for the village where the Chinese female soldiers were. As soon as he left, Cobra started chatting with Xia Jinyuan.","“If he schemed against you, it means that he schemed against me. We don’t have to be too kind to a business partner who hasn’t started working with us.","“Did Luke tell you where we need to go tonight? I admire his courage. He actually dares to kidnap soldiers from a peaceful country. Now, I think that all the initiative is in China’s hands. Let’s put it this way. I told you before that I want to go to China to see an old friend. Now, I’ve changed my mind.","“I plan to go and see the kidnapped female soldiers with the bold Qin Maosheng first. I want to confirm if he really did it. If he really did it, what would the Chinese do?","“Pretend that they don’t know anything? Or secretly send soldiers to kill Qin Maosheng? If China chooses the former, I can continue to go to China. If China chooses the latter and kills Qin Maosheng, all our previous plans will be canceled and we’ll return immediately.","“Let’s accompany him to take a look tonight. We’ll leave this dangerous place tomorrow morning. As for China, we can go over and take a look the next time we have the chance.","“I heard that there’s a place called the ‘Great Wall’ in China. The scenery is very beautiful. I had planned to make a visit. If China chooses to destroy Qin Maosheng directly, I’ll have no choice but to give up on that idea.”","It was rare for Cobra to interact so much with Xia Jinyuan. However, Xia Jinyuan didn’t say much. There was only a slight change in his gaze when Cobra mentioned he wanted to confirm if Qin Maosheng had really kidnapped Chinese female soldiers.","As for the fact that he said that he wanted to see the scenery of the ‘Great Wall’, Xia Jinyuan was thinking that the country didn’t welcome him.","He replied calmly, “Understood.”","For more than a year, Xia Jinyuan had always been quiet. He didn’t seem to feel anything even though Cobra was showing that he trusted him. He just nodded calmly, indicating that he understood and would listen to the arrangements.","His silence was met with a heavy pat on his shoulder from Cobra. The smile on his thin face deepened.","Xia Jinyuan clenched his fists lightly. He really hoped that Qin Maosheng’s plan for tonight wouldn’t change. That way, he could go and see if the people kidnapped were really Chinese female soldiers.","Also...","It was five o’clock now. There was still an hour before they set off. He needed to inform his comrades who should be hiding nearby.","V8 saw Xia Jinyuan’s hand signal through the binoculars. He passed the binoculars to his comrades and said softly, “Q King asked me to go over and look for him. Keep an eye on him. I’ll go and see him. I’ll also tell him about our plan.”","Xia Jinyuan was able to move around freely, so it was easy for him to meet V8. Only when he took the initiative to ask for a meeting and pointed out the location could V8 and the rest meet him.","“Are you going to tell Q King that... Azure Bird is one of the kidnapped female soldiers?” V8, who was preparing to leave, pursed his lips after being reminded by his comrade.","Damn it, he almost forgot about this!","Should he say it or not?","V8 came back and contacted G3. “Should we tell him? Will it affect Q King?”"]},{"number":3912,"title":"Chapter 3912: Brothers","paragraphs":["Chapter 3912: Brothers","Editor: Henyee Translations","Should they tell Q King in advance... G3 pondered for a moment before replying, “Ask the higher-ups. If they say we can tell him, then tell him. If not... don’t tell him for the time being.","“But I think you can tell him.","“We still need to tell Q King through Azure Bird to not act alone. We can take the chance when the Chinese female soldiers are kidnapped to help him complete his previous plan. There’s no need for another combat.”","V8 contacted Major General Yang directly and got a reply that he could tell Xia Jinyuan directly. He said, “A general doesn’t obey orders outside. This has nothing to do with the two countries. As long as it’s beneficial to the entire operation, you can make your own decisions. You don’t have to ask your superiors for these things.”","There was no need to ask their superiors for advice on any decision.","The battlefield was their battlefield. They would do what was beneficial to the battlefield. The generals in charge of the country just needed to ensure that the entire decision hadn’t changed.","With Major General Yang’s nod, V8 had an idea.","The sun had already withdrawn its last rays of sunlight. The layers of clouds on the horizon were dyed with a layer of gold. The sun had already set, and only the last rays of light illuminated the ground.","Gradually, the golden edges of the clouds became lighter and lighter. Some birds rushed into the clouds from somewhere. After a few flaps of their wings, they turned into a black dot and disappeared. The sky gradually turned dark. The distant mountains seemed to be enveloped by a thin green veil. The surroundings were silent. Only the wind blew past the treetops, bringing with it a rustling sound.","V8 had already seen his captain. After not seeing him for a year, V8 was a little excited! He was even more excited than when he saw his girlfriend.","Damn, he almost forgot that he didn’t have a girlfriend!","A few birds chirped. They seemed to be flapping their wings happily on the branches. Xia Jinyuan’s footsteps moved slightly, and he walked into the mountain calmly. Someone on patrol noticed him and looked over. Xia Jinyuan hid half of his body in the forest, and his upper body was faintly visible among the leaves. He looked like he was settling an ‘urgent’ matter.","The person didn’t pay much attention and left quickly.","V8 was standing beside a tree where Xia Jinyuan could see him directly. They looked at each other and smiled.","Ever since Xia Jinyuan became the captain of the Xueyu unit, this was the second time he hadn’t seen his comrades for a year. The first time, his comrades didn’t miss the captain who had come out of nowhere. Now, after experiencing so many life-and-death battles together and not seeing Q King for a year, the comrades’ excitement was obvious. V8’s eyes were red.","“Captain...”","He maintained a certain distance and looked at him intently. His voice was hoarse.","Xia Jinyuan smiled. “Not bad. You didn’t forget me.”","“How would we dare to forget? All of us miss you. We’ve all been hoping that you’d come back soon. We’re all waiting for you to come back and train us.”","V8 grinned. His face, which was covered with camouflage paint, was wrinkled.","He wanted to have a good chat, but time didn’t allow it. Xia Jinyuan asked V8 to tell him how many comrades had arrived and if they were all here. He wanted to know what other arrangements the military had.","V8 retracted his intention of chatting and took the time to explain things to Xia Jinyuan. He pursed his lips and gave Xia Jinyuan a heads-up. “Captain, the first thing I want to say is a little big. Be mentally prepared. Take a deep breath first and stabilize yourself.”","Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows slightly and asked him, “Do you want to tell me that three female soldiers from China were kidnapped?”"]},{"number":3913,"title":"Chapter 3913: Informed","paragraphs":["Chapter 3913: Informed","Editor: Henyee Translations","V8 widened his eyes. “You know that Azure Bird was kidnapped?”","Azure Bird... was kidnapped?","If Xia Jinyuan remembered correctly, the only female soldier he knew and whose codename was ‘Azure Bird’ was his little fox.","That meant that one of the three female soldiers who was kidnapped was... his little fox, his lover.","Very soon, V8 noticed that something was wrong. His heart skipped a beat. He asked carefully, “Captain, you only knew that three female soldiers from China were kidnapped but you didn’t know that Azure Bird was one of them? How... did you know?”","“I know that three Chinese female soldiers were kidnapped, but I didn’t know that Azure Bird was among them. The big news you wanted to tell me is that Azure Bird was kidnapped, right?” Xia Jinyuan asked.","However, he didn’t expect V8 to tell him such a huge piece of news the moment he opened his mouth. It shocked him so much that his mind was still buzzing.","He didn’t want to tell his lover that he had already infiltrated the country. He even specially reminded Old Xia not to leak anything. In the end...","In the end, even though they were thousands of miles apart, he and his lover still came across each other.","It had to be said that... they were really fated!","V8 knew that he was a quick-witted person so he nodded slightly. “Azure Bird’s kidnapping is different from the other two female soldiers. She let herself get kidnapped on purpose to save the other two female soldiers. She also has another mission and needs to help the border defense team to kill Qin Maosheng, who dares to kidnap Chinese soldiers.”","Xia Jinyuan took a deep breath and exhaled slowly. He digested this sudden piece of news that caused his head to buzz. Then, he was filled with anticipation.","He was looking forward to meeting her later. He was looking forward to it...","He didn’t expect them to meet on such an occasion after a year. He didn’t expect this at all!","“In that case, I need to adjust my plan,” he said in a low voice.","V8 looked around and said, “The higher-ups have also made detailed arrangements. We all think that it’s feasible.”","He then told Xia Jinyuan about Commander Xia and Major General Yang’s combat deployment. After listening, Xia Jinyuan nodded lightly to show his approval.","Tonight, he would complete his plan according to the combat deployment mentioned. He said to V8, “There’s still 15 minutes left. I’ll go directly to the village where Azure Bird is. Inform G3 and the rest to take a detour and rush to the destination. I’ll drive a car alone later. You can take my car and leave together.”","It was best to leave with a car.","After V8 came back, he immediately informed G3 to change his route and go to the village where the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade and Azure Bird were.","At 6:00 pm, Qin Maosheng, who had finished his work, appeared on time. He took the same car as Cobra and headed to the village that was more than an hour away from him.","Xia Jinyuan easily got a truck for transportation. He was the last to drive away. He told Cobra that he was worried about Qin Maosheng. With this arrangement, he could keep an eye on him as he drove.","No matter how vigilant and suspicious Cobra was, he wouldn’t have thought that Xia Jinyuan wanted a car to bring his comrade into the village. Moreover, he felt that what Xia Jinyuan said made sense. He nodded in agreement after some consideration.","When Qin Maosheng learned about this, he looked at Xia Jinyuan with even more hostility.","Around 8:00 pm, 57 hours after Ye Jian’s kidnapping, the three female soldiers were dragged out of the dark dungeon again. The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade, who were hiding in the dark, tensed up.","What were these fellows trying to do?"]},{"number":3914,"title":"Chapter 3914: Lock Your Target","paragraphs":["Chapter 3914: Lock Your Target","Editor: Henyee Translations","The night-vision binoculars moved slightly with the three female soldiers. The scout, who was in the best position to observe the situation, suddenly tightened his grip. He saw four jeeps appear and immediately contacted his hidden comrades in a low voice. “Four jeeps and a truck have entered the village!”","“Roger that. Pay close attention to the movements in front!” The leader of the action team said in a low voice. He set up his night-vision rifle and used his scope to adjust the distance. He saw that the five vehicles that had entered the village had stopped.","The moment the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando saw Qin Maosheng getting out of the car, several members of the commando couldn’t help but tighten their grip on their rifles.","They had been waiting here for more than ten hours. Just when they thought that Qin Maosheng might not appear, a soldier guarding the other village told them that Qin Maosheng had left in a car...","The news made them both nervous and excited.","They finally got what they wanted!","Right on the heels of that, they saw a tall and skinny man wearing a long windbreaker walking out of another car. Qin Maosheng got out of the car in advance and walked to the man’s side. He invited the man to walk with him politely. There were four tall and big men guarding this man.","Who was he?","Source: novgo.co","Why did she appear at this time? Why was Qin Maosheng receiving him?","“Standing beside Qin Maosheng is a Western man. He’s more than 1.75 meters tall and is a little skinny. Behind him are four bodyguards, and the group is surrounded by four more bodyguards... Three of them are Western and one is Asian...”","The scout farthest away reported his observations secretly. Very soon, Xu Yu received the latest information from the frontlines. Commander Xia and Major General Yang also received the latest news from the frontlines.","Xu Yu and the Yun Province Military District didn’t know who the Western faces were, but Commander Xia and Major General Yang knew who the Asian man was.","“They’re suspects that the soldiers of another military unit are in charge of keeping an eye on...” Xu Yu told the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade who were fighting at the frontline. These were the exact words that Commander Xia told him. The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade immediately found the correct location and ignored these Westerners.","V8 and his six comrades climbed out of the truck when they were about to enter the entrance to a village. They used the night as a cover to avoid the checkpoint at the entrance to a village and slid down the mountain.","As they moved forward in the dark, their faces and hands were pricked by countless small thorns. Finally, they reached the outskirts of the village. They didn’t even dare to pant loudly. They kept suppressing their breathing. Their chests heaved up and down as they swallowed their saliva. Only then did they manage to control their rapid breathing.","Although they took the truck, they had to bypass the checkpoint and climb over the mountain. The entire journey was especially hurried, for fear that they would lag too far behind.","As soon as they finished adjusting their breathing, the seven of them immediately entered their deployment. They hunched their backs and avoided the people patrolling outside with guns. They went around to a place that was good for observation and hid secretly.","“G3, we’ve arrived at our final destination. We’ve arrived. How far away are you?” V8, who had found his location, quickly contacted the other group of comrades who had been following Q King.","G3, who was still rushing over, immediately replied to V8, “It’s a little far. T6 is working on getting a car now. The car will arrive in half an hour. If we can’t get a car, it’ll take at least one and a half hours.”"]},{"number":3915,"title":"Chapter 3915: Anticipation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3915: Anticipation","Editor: Henyee Translations","“You’re the backup. Be careful not to be targeted. I’m contacting our brothers now.” V8 was sweating profusely. He didn’t rush G3 and the rest.","G3 and the rest had been following behind Q King the entire time. They were moving at a fast speed. Compared to hiding and not moving, the seven of them were even more tired. Their stamina was exhausted.","“Okay, be careful!” T6, who was handling the car matter, replied softly, “Don’t worry about us. We won’t fumble the ball.”","V8 acknowledged in a low voice and immediately contacted the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade who were lurking nearby.","He knew that they were here, so when he was looking for an advantageous location to observe, he had to avoid the best location to prevent the two teams from bumping into each other.","“You’ll guard the southeast, and we’ll guard the northwest... There’s still a group of brothers who haven’t arrived. They’re our reinforcements...”","V8 contacted the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade and quickly reported their location. At this moment, G3 and the rest were the only ones that hadn’t arrived.","That didn’t matter. As long as the reinforcements were on the way, it was fine.","Source: novgo.co","In the dark, several pairs of eyes stared at the figure that walked into the village. Cobra and Qin Maosheng walked in front and chatted and laughed along the way. They looked very friendly.","Xia Jinyuan, who was a little behind, looked around. He walked in the dark and pursed his lips tightly. Where were the three Chinese female soldiers? Was his little fox alright? Were all his comrades following him?","If he saw the little fox later, how would he talk to her? Would she still be able to recognize him? Would she still be able to recognize his voice? Would she still be able to recognize him just by listening to his footsteps like before?","Xia Jinyuan pondered as he walked under the cover of the night sky. His handsome face and expression were extremely cold. His face was tense the entire time. It was so cold that there was no warmth at all. Luke, who was walking in front, couldn’t help but slow down his footsteps a few times and wait for him to approach.","“What? Did you find something?” Luke slowed down his footsteps again and asked, “Did you see something?”","Xia Jinyuan looked around. The dungeon where the female soldier was locked up was in the south. The lights were dim. Would she be brought to the dungeon by Qin Maosheng next?","Xia Jinyuan, who had been thinking about it, replied to Luke calmly, “It’s nothing.”","“Really? Why do I feel that you’re very serious?”","Luke, who was terrifyingly sharp, asked in disbelief.","“I’m serious because we’re in other people’s territory. If they want to deal with us, don’t you think it’ll be a very simple task for them?” Xia Jinyuan asked back.","Luke nodded thoughtfully. “That’s right. We should be more serious.”","Suddenly, loud insults came from the front. Xia Jinyuan’s eyelids fluttered a few times as he looked up.","Hearing the commotion, a sharp look flashed past Luke’s eyes. He said in a low voice, “Are they abusing the Chinese female soldiers?”","In the dark, Xia Jinyuan clenched his fists so tightly that they were about to make cracking sounds. Abuse... the Chinese female soldiers? He swore to make sure Qin Maosheng faced a tragedy tonight!","“Quick, let’s go and take a look!” With a similarly cold facial expression, Luke sped up and caught up with Cobra. He didn’t even give Xia Jinyuan a chance to catch up. He looked... very anxious.","Xia Jinyuan clenched and unclenched his fists. He then chased after them in huge strides. He heard Qin Maosheng saying that he was going to send a few more photos to China so that they would have no choice but to agree to his conditions. He even said that he wanted to get the goods back. However, he had never thought of returning the soldiers. He even said that he wanted to let China know that he was not someone to be trifled with."]},{"number":3916,"title":"Chapter 3916: So Close","paragraphs":["Chapter 3916: So Close","Editor: Henyee Translations","Qin Maosheng’s arrogant words made Xia Jinyuan’s gaze turn colder and colder. The look in his eyes seemed to be covered with a layer of frost. His gaze was as sharp as a longsword, emitting waves of viciousness.","Negotiating terms with China was already a pipe dream. Tonight, Xia Jinyuan would destroy all his dreams!","There were comrades from the Xueyu unit and the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade from the Yun Province Military District. Qin Maosheng wouldn’t be able to escape tonight!","While Cobra agreed with Qin Maosheng, he made up his mind to leave immediately after seeing the Chinese female soldiers. He didn’t plan to wait until the sun rose tomorrow.","He didn’t think that a partner who dared to look down on a country would be able to continue developing.","He could be arrogant and rampant, but he must have the heart to examine himself properly and know his capabilities.","Obviously, Qin Maosheng, a business partner who he admired and even thought that they could work together for a long time, had lost himself.","Cobra didn’t think highly of a person who had lost himself.","Source: novgo.co","No matter what, China was still a country. No matter how backward or poor they were, how could China allow their soldiers to be humiliated?","He needed to leave immediately!","This place was very dangerous!","The smile at the corner of Cobra’s mouth stiffened. He looked around and saw the mountains around him. The small villages were surrounded by mountains, and wooden houses were built according to the high and low terrain. Some of the wooden houses were even made with long grass. The few street lamps there were wrapped around the trees using wires.","The deeper they went, the tighter Cobra’s frown got. He didn’t quite understand... Why did the other party choose this place as the gathering point for all the drugs?","Was it because it was at the borders of several countries?","Someone jogged down the winding path at the foot of the mountain and soon arrived in front of Qin Maosheng. Cobra took the opportunity to fall a few steps behind and instructed his bodyguard in a low voice, “Look around. This place might not be very safe.”","Qin Maosheng’s disregard for the Chinese caused alarm bells to ring in Cobra’s heart. He started to realize that his situation was the same as the other party’s. It was not good.","The bodyguard replied respectfully, “Just now, Xia and Luke reminded us to pay attention to the surroundings and not be too far away from you, sir.”","Cobra turned around and looked at his side. This subordinate of his, whom he admired more and more, had already put his hand into his clothes. A smile flashed past Cobra’s sunken grayish-blue eyes. It looked like he could bring Xia out more often in the future.","Qin Maosheng’s subordinate had already finished reporting after running all the way to the wooden house on the mountain. Xia Jinyuan heard Qin Maosheng’s slightly gloomy voice as he said to Cobra, “My subordinate has already dragged them out. I’m thinking about how to teach them a lesson. I wonder if you have any suggestions?”","Suggestions?","Cobra felt that it was best if he didn’t give any suggestions and left this place quickly.","He smiled and said, “If you want to take your things back successfully, I think you need to ensure the safety of the three Chinese female soldiers first. You haven’t taken your things back. If something happens to the three Chinese female soldiers, I think...”","In order to let Qin Maosheng take his words seriously, Cobra paused deliberately. Even his expression changed to a serious one. “If something happens to the Chinese female soldiers, I think it’s unlikely that the Chinese will return the things to you.","“Of course, that’s just my thoughts. In my heart, goods are more important than people.”"]},{"number":3917,"title":"Chapter 3917: Meeting","paragraphs":["Chapter 3917: Meeting","Editor: Henyee Translations","What mattered was that the Chinese female soldiers were still alive before he left. He didn’t want to be targeted by the Chinese!","God, he had a feeling that this would be a bad negotiation!","At this moment, Xia Jinyuan was very grateful for Cobra’s selfishness. If not, he wouldn’t have made such a suggestion. It sounded like he was making this suggestion for Qin Maosheng’s sake, but in fact, it was all for his own safety. He didn’t want to be targeted by China.","Xia Jinyuan understood what Cobra was thinking but Qin Maosheng didn’t. He listened to Cobra’s suggestion because he felt that goods were more important than people!","Once again, Ye Jian and the other two women were dragged out of the dungeon. This time, they weren’t dragged into the wooden house. Instead, they were dragged under a huge tree. The location was different, but the treatment was the same. They were still forced to kneel by the people behind them who were holding guns.","Liu Le’s face was pale. She wasn’t as flustered as she was in the morning. Her hair was in a mess. She gritted her teeth tightly. Even though she was forced to kneel, her back was still straight.","Ye Jian was right. Even if they fell into the hands of these people, the morale of the Chinese soldiers must not be lost!","The three of them straightened their backs. Dan Yi, who had been delivering water and food to them, had a distorted facial expression. She could only watch. Besides watching, she couldn’t do anything to the Chinese female soldiers. If not, she would be chased out of the village and never be able to come back.","Source: novgo.co","She didn’t want to be chased out of the village. She needed to kill more Chinese soldiers. Hence, she had to bear with it.","“Are they waiting for someone?” Zhou Yijin asked Ye Jian softly. Their mouths were no longer stuffed with anything anymore. She realized that these people didn’t do anything else after dragging them out. She wondered if they were waiting for someone to come.","Ye Jian had already taken note of her surroundings. She imprinted the image into her mind so that it would be easier for her to take action later.","Hearing this, she replied in a softer voice, “Yes, they seem to be waiting for someone to come.”","Wait for who?","She hoped that it was Qin Maosheng.","Zhou Yijin swallowed her saliva slightly. Her fingers trembled uncontrollably. She wanted to say that they would do something to them after the person arrived, but she swallowed her words.","She mustn’t scare herself.","Since the other party wanted to complete a deal with China, just like what her sixth cousin-in-law said, China would stall for time. The women’s lives wouldn’t be in danger for the time being.","The Chinese side was indeed stalling for time. Just now, Qin Maosheng’s subordinate reported their request. The Chinese side wanted to confirm that the female soldiers were safe before negotiating.","Qin Maosheng felt that the Chinese side didn’t know what was good for them. Hence, he wanted to teach the Chinese female soldiers a lesson and force them to lower their heads. After the reminder from Cobra, he stopped thinking about it.","The group of people walked up the curved path. Very soon, Cobra saw the Chinese female soldiers wearing regular army uniforms kneeling under a tree with guns pressed against their heads. There were a few incandescent lamps hanging on the tree.","Xia Jinyuan, who had been lagging behind, started walking slowly and steadily. Similarly, he saw the Chinese female soldiers kneeling under the tree. Even though there was a certain distance between them, he recognized the person he had been thinking about day and night. The first thing he saw was Ye Jian.","Ye Jian didn’t see Xia Jinyuan. Her gaze was attracted to the short Burmese man in front. This was Qin Maosheng. She recognized him!","This was the goal she needed to solve tonight!","Very good, he had finally arrived.","She shifted her gaze to the side. Suddenly, her pupils constricted violently. Was she seeing things?","She closed her eyes forcefully and then opened them abruptly. It was still the same!"]},{"number":3918,"title":"Chapter 3918: The Most Bitter Love","paragraphs":["Chapter 3918: The Most Bitter Love","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian closed her eyes and opened them again. Her heart, which had stopped beating for a moment because of the appearance of the figure, started beating again.","In front of her, the shadows of the trees were dappled with light. The slender figure stood proudly in the half-dark like a pine tree. When she blinked and looked again, the slender figure was still there. It had not left or disappeared. It was still standing there quietly...","The familiar figure made her feel suffocated as he stood there. The sudden appearance of this figure shattered all the resolve in her heart.","In an instant, warm liquid filled her eyes. Her nose was suddenly blocked. She could only breathe through her mouth. Ye Jian blinked gently. She didn’t dare to let the tears in her eyes flow out. She was afraid that the moment they flowed out, that familiar figure would be just an illusion.","It wasn’t an illusion.","It really wasn’t an illusion.","The person she loved deeply was standing there in the half-darkness. Just like that, he stood there quietly while looking at her. It felt like a thousand years had passed.","Ye Jian didn’t dare to look at him anymore. She retracted her gaze after glancing at him hurriedly. She didn’t dare to let her tears fall. She controlled her tears and forced them back.","Source: novgo.co","They said that the love of a special forces soldier was the most bitter. At this moment, Ye Jian finally understood it deeply.","The most bitter love was when they met on the same piece of land but they couldn’t even make eye contact for a short period of time. That was because they had different missions on their shoulders and carried heavy responsibility. A short eye contact... had become an extravagant hope.","It was the most bitter love because their love couldn’t be out in the open. It had to be kept in a dark and cold corner. Yearning from morning to night caused them immense pain. Just like her and him now, they were so close but so far apart.","Ye Jian didn’t know if the lover she missed day and night saw her. She didn’t know if the lover who loved her was feeling the same as her. The moment she saw the other party, she was so excited that her heart was like a swing. It fell and rose and fell again...","It didn’t matter even if he didn’t see her. It was enough that she saw him.","She knew where he was. She knew that he was safe now. Even if he didn’t see her, it didn’t matter to her. Just by looking at him for a short period of time, she was satisfied.","It had been a year since they last met. Was Captain Xia alright?","‘I’m relieved that you’re fine.’","Ye Jian retracted her gaze. Even Zhou Yijin, who was closest to her, didn’t realize that in just a few seconds, Ye Jian’s emotions had changed from raging waves to being still like the surface of a lake.","The tears that he forced back didn’t come out. They only moistened the corners of her eyes slightly. However, Xia Jinyuan noticed it and clenched his fists so tightly that his nails were about to sink into his palm...","He saw the person he had been missing day and night. He saw his lover whom he loved to the core and who had become one with his flesh and blood. However, he couldn’t look at her for long. He couldn’t look at her deeply.","Who was he now?","He was a criminal who couldn’t be exposed and was being chased by the border defense armed police officers.","And who was she?","She was a soldier who could stand upright under the sun and wear the olive-green military uniform. Even when facing many criminals, she didn’t lose the integrity of a Chinese soldier."]},{"number":3919,"title":"Chapter 3919: A Thousand Years","paragraphs":["Chapter 3919: A Thousand Years","Editor: Henyee Translations","How could a criminal and a Chinese soldier know each other? How could they look at each other for a long time? How could they cross this distance of less than ten meters and come close to one another?","They couldn’t.","Although they were very close to each other now, there was a huge distance between them. They couldn’t acknowledge each other, and they couldn’t get intimate.","Once again, Xia Jinyuan shifted his gaze away from his lover’s calm face. Xia Jinyuan’s heart ached so much that he was about to suffocate because of her kneeling. He slowly released his fists but clenched them tightly once more. This happened a few times. The action was slowly giving him strength and motivation.","Every time he released his clenched fists, he would feel as though the weight on his heart was slowly lifting. When the weight was completely off, he finally felt warmth return to his cold body.","As her boyfriend, he couldn’t do anything about her kneeling down in such a humiliating manner. He couldn’t even look at her.","He couldn’t support her or give her warmth... He was right in front of her. He was watching her suffer but he couldn’t do anything. His heart, which had finally recovered, tightened again. At that moment, Xia Jinyuan felt his heart bleeding.","His thin lips pursed even tighter. He forced himself to turn his head and look into the distance. It was pitch-black in the distance. He couldn’t see anything clearly. He didn’t have the heart to see what was in the distance.","Source: novgo.co","He could feel her gaze on him. He could feel the excitement in her gaze.","Just like him, she was so excited that her heart seemed to have jumped out of her chest. She wanted to fly to the side of the person she loved deeply.","He was still standing here, but his heart... had already flown away.","“They really look like Chinese female soldiers. God, does Qin Maosheng really think that he has lived for too long and wants to find some excitement?”","Luke’s low voice came from beside him. He had been sizing up the three female soldiers who were kneeling under the tree. After sizing them up carefully, Luke was really sure that they were Chinese female soldiers.","Xia Jinyuan pursed his thin lips and took a deep breath again. After confirming that he could speak calmly as usual, he said, “He’s looking for excitement, sure. But we can’t accompany him.”","“That’s right, you’re right. We can’t accompany him. It’s time for us to leave now. I have to remind Mr. Cobra. We should leave soon.” As Luke spoke, he glanced at the dark mountains that hid many dangers. He felt uneasy.","His intuition told him that this was not a very safe place. Even though this was the place that Qin Maosheng said was very safe, he still felt that it was not safe.","At this moment, Xia Jinyuan didn’t want to leave so quickly. He hadn’t said a word to the lover he missed deeply. He was unwilling to leave just like this.","“Luke, Mr. Cobra doesn’t like us interfering with his decisions,” he reminded Luke.","In return, Luke nodded lightly. That was right. Cobra didn’t like his subordinates interfering with his decision too much. He was chatting happily with Qin Maosheng now. If Luke suddenly rushed up and said that they should leave, Cobra might listen to him, but he might not be happy.","That was what Cobra was like. He knew him very well."]},{"number":3920,"title":"Chapter 3920: Greed","paragraphs":["Chapter 3920: Greed","Editor: Henyee Translations","Qin Maosheng wanted to invite Cobra to take a closer look at the female soldiers he kidnapped. Cobra smiled and rejected him. “They belong to you. I think I should keep my distance.”","He wanted to keep his distance so that the Chinese female soldiers wouldn’t remember him. That was what Cobra was thinking.","Hearing his rejection, Xia Jinyuan, who was disappointed, pursed his lips even tighter. He hoped that Cobra would be asked to go closer, but he also knew that the suspicious man wouldn’t go over.","His breathing was slow and long. His heart was still beating furiously because of her appearance. It was still hurting.","“I’m not interested in other people’s victories. What I’m really interested in is...” Cobra looked at the wooden house nearby. The smile on his thin face was deep. His short and soft light brown hair covered his grayish-blue eyes as the night breeze blew. It also covered the greed in his eyes. “I’m more interested in the goods I’m about to get.”","If Qin Maosheng was gone one day, all the goods that belonged to him would belong to Cobra. Just thinking about it made him excited.","Qin Maosheng, who didn’t know what Cobra was thinking, laughed loudly. “No problem. Although this is our first time reaching an agreement, to show my sincerity, I can let you look at the samples in advance. Please wait a moment. I still need to cooperate with a small request from China.”","The Chinese side needed to confirm if the female soldiers were safe. In that case, he would tell the Chinese side openly that their female soldiers were very safe now. However, it was uncertain if they would be safe in the future.","Source: novgo.co","Also...","Qin Maosheng glanced at his partners who were still standing in the same spot. A sinister smile flashed past his triangular eyes. He still needed to let Cobra know that he had the final say in Myanmar. Even if Cobra had direct contact with Commander Minlai, it wouldn’t be of much use.","In the past, there were people who wanted to go past him and contact Commander Minlai directly. What happened to them?","Of course, they were all killed by him.","He gave a fake smile and continued, “The Chinese are testing my strength and trying to see if I have the guts to go against them. I think I have to tell them that if I can even kidnap their female soldiers, is there anything I don’t dare to do?","“When dealing with dishonest people, we should let them know not to provoke people they shouldn’t provoke. Just like in the past, someone wanted to take my place. I used the knife in my hand to tell him that if he provokes me, the only outcome waiting for him is death.”","There was a deeper meaning in his words. Cobra didn’t say anything when he was threatened. He just raised his eyebrows slightly and made a ‘please’ gesture, indicating that Qin Maosheng could go ahead and do his work first. He would wait here.","Was Qin Maosheng threatening him?","Cobra wanted to see if Qin Maosheng would get another chance to threaten him in the future.","He hadn’t been threatened for a long time. It was a strange feeling. He wondered how long this arrogant fellow could live and if he would have the chance to threaten him again.","Cobra looked at Qin Maosheng’s back view as he left. There was a faint smile on his sickly pale face. The four bodyguards beside him were protecting him from four directions, ready to deal with danger at any time.","The cooperation between the two parties hadn’t really started, but they had already started scheming for their own benefits. Both of them knew this, but they still maintained their cooperation. They wouldn’t easily break the current relationship between the two of them.","Luke looked at the back view of Qin Maosheng as he left. Then, he looked at the Chinese female soldiers who had rifles pressed to the back of their heads. Pity flashed past his deep green eyes.","If that damned fellow did anything bad to them... Well, he would feel sorry for not being able to help them. He couldn’t even inform their country."]},{"number":3921,"title":"Chapter 3921: I Miss You Very Much","paragraphs":["Chapter 3921: I Miss You Very Much","Editor: Henyee Translations","Luke sighed softly about what would happen to the Chinese female soldiers next. Xia Jinyuan, who was standing beside him, looked at the Chinese female soldiers openly.","His gaze wasn’t as excited as before. It became deep and calm, as if he was sizing up strangers. No one would notice anything amiss.","An ordinary look became Xia Jinyuan’s greatest joy. He was so happy that he could look at his lover again. He also hoped that his lover would notice that he was looking at her and be able to respond.","The first time they looked at each other, he was already anticipating it. Whether or not he could say a word at a close distance became his greatest hope.","Perhaps she heard Xia Jinyuan’s prayer, or perhaps they had been in love for too long and their hearts were connected. When Xia Jinyuan’s gaze landed on her, Ye Jian raised her pupils slightly and looked at the short figure walking toward them. As if unintentionally, her gaze landed on his face.","Finally, the two lovers had their first eye contact in a foreign country. The moment their eyes met, their hearts seemed to be clenched by a pair of invisible hands. They were so nervous and excited.","They were suppressing too much longing in their hearts. They wanted to hug each other so badly, but they could only bear with it. They had to bear with it until their faces were calm and giving nothing away. They couldn’t let anyone realize that they knew each other.","This kind of endurance required extremely strong perseverance. That way, no one would notice that something was amiss. They would restrain the real impulse in their hearts and use a perfect disguise to make eye contact after a year of not seeing each other. Even if it was only for three seconds, to them, it was like forever.","Source: novgo.co","Xia Jinyuan, who was moving freely, took advantage of the half-darkness and the fact that Luke was paying attention to his surroundings. His lips moved very gently. He didn’t know if his lover knew what he said. He used his fastest speed to say the words he wanted to say the most after seeing her.","“I miss you very much...” He added ‘my little fox’ in his heart.","He could only mouth half a sentence. If he mouthed too much... he was afraid of being discovered.","Looking at each other, hugging, and saying sweet nothings... Those were all extravagant hopes.","He really wanted to stand in front of her and hug her. He wanted to tell her how much he missed her. He didn’t know if he could fulfill his wish tonight.","Ye Jian smiled in her heart. They were almost ten meters apart, and he was standing under the swaying shadows of the trees. She couldn’t even see his handsome face clearly. She recognized him because they were familiar with each other. Even if they were in a sea of people, she would be able to recognize him at a glance.","She didn’t know the words he mouthed, but she knew that he must be sharing the same feelings as her. He must be so excited that he needed to use his perseverance to control the love in his heart.","Their long reunion didn’t make them forget their responsibilities. After looking at each other for a few seconds, they shifted their gaze away at the same time and stopped looking at each other.","Ye Jian’s gaze landed on Qin Maosheng, who was getting closer and closer to her. His facial features were getting clearer. His dry lips were pursed tightly. There was obvious anger in his eyes.","She used her gaze to attract all of Qin Maosheng’s attention and ignored Zhou Yijin and Liu Le. Ye Jian hoped that she was successful in her attempt."]},{"number":3922,"title":"Chapter 3922: Distance","paragraphs":["Chapter 3922: Distance","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian, who wanted to protect the two female soldiers, took all the danger upon herself and tried her best to protect the two female soldiers.","“No matter what happens later, don’t make a sound. Do you understand?” As Qin Maosheng was less than three meters away from them, Ye Jian quickly reminded the other two, “Don’t let him notice you. Leave everything to me!”","Zhou Yijin’s heart trembled. The corners of her tightly pursed lips trembled violently.","In order to protect her and Liu Le, her sixth cousin-in-law was standing in front of them so that the fierce-looking man who was walking toward them would only notice her...","Liu Le started crying again. She understood what Ye Jian meant. That was why she couldn’t help but cry.","Qin Maosheng was already standing in front of the three Chinese female soldiers. He was staring at the female soldier who was glaring at him angrily. She was prettier than in the photos.","After looking at her for a while, Qin Maosheng, who had a cold facial expression, suddenly smiled and revealed his yellowish teeth. “I can see anger in your eyes and...” He took the gun from one of his subordinates and lifted Ye Jian’s chin with the gun barrel. “And you want to kill me, but you...”","He exerted more force and straightened Ye Jian’s slender neck. When he saw her gaze getting angrier, Qin Maosheng’s laughter became even colder. “Unfortunately, you can’t kill me. But I can kill you.”","Source: novgo.co","He quickly pulled the gun case of the rifle and loaded the bullets. At the same time, he slowly placed his finger on the trigger. With a sinister smile on his face, he revealed an even crueler smile. It was as if he would shoot now and end a fresh life.","Zhou Yijin, who was trembling all over, couldn’t hold it in anymore. She reprimanded loudly, “We’re Chinese soldiers. If you kill us, our country will not let you off!”","Without waiting for Qin Maosheng to speak, the Burmese man, who was holding a rifle to her head, slammed it into Zhou Yijin’s head and shouted in stiff Mandarin, “Shut up!”","Zhou Yijin was afraid that Ye Jian would get shot. When she saw the middle-aged man with a vicious facial expression glaring at her, she heaved a sigh of relief.","She couldn’t let her sixth cousin-in-law face all the danger alone. She had to do something. Her sixth cousin had specially sent a message to remind her that when he wasn’t around, his family had to take care of Ye Jian.","Her sister-in-law was here to protect her. Similarly, she needed to protect her too.","Zhou Yijin shut up and glared at Qin Maosheng fiercely. She didn’t know who this man was, but she knew that his identity wasn’t simple.","Qin Maosheng glanced at Zhou Yijin, then at Ye Jian and Liu Le. After glancing at the faces of the three Chinese female soldiers, the savage smile on his face had a hint of ulterior motives.","He continued to use the gun barrel to lift Ye Jian’s chin forcefully. He tilted his head and said to his subordinate beside him, “Go and invite Mr. Cobra over. Tell him that I want to give him a surprise.”","It was a pity for such a beautiful Chinese female soldier to get shot. It wasn’t a bad idea to have some fun before getting rid of her.","Qin Maosheng’s cruel smile made Ye Jian, who was angered by Zhou Yijin, feel uneasy. What she was most afraid of wasn’t poison, but... physical and mental violence. Just now, she realized what she was most afraid of was about to happen from Qin Maosheng’s cruel smile."]},{"number":3923,"title":"Chapter 3923: Captain Xia","paragraphs":["Chapter 3923: Captain Xia","Editor: Henyee Translations","She couldn’t wait any longer. If she waited any longer, Qin Maosheng would really do something worse than a beast. Since the target she had been waiting for had appeared, it was time for her to complete her mission.","Before Qin Maosheng acted, she must act to prevent any atrocities from happening.","Ye Jian, who was forced to raise her head, looked around from the corner of her eyes. The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade were hiding in the dark like giant beasts. Were they ready?","‘Captain Xia, we only met briefly tonight. When will we meet again?’","She didn’t even have the time to say a word to him. Would she have the chance to say ‘I miss you’ tonight?","Now that he had heard Yijin’s voice, was he even more worried?","He must be worried.","His girlfriend and cousin were kidnapped and forced to kneel. He must be worried and heartbroken.","Source: novgo.co","Xia Jinyuan, who was standing not far away, retracted his gaze and looked over again. His heart had already fallen into the abyss.","Yijin?","He actually heard Yijin’s voice!","V8 said that Azure Bird let herself be kidnapped to save two female soldiers. Was it because... Yijin was kidnapped that his little fox was willing to take the risk?","In the past, she had smiled and said to him, “Captain Xia, your family is under my protection too. I will protect your family with you.”","She had smiled brightly as she spoke. He remembered pinching her cute nose and saying, “I will protect your family with you too.”","They had promised each other to protect each other’s family. Now, his little fox was using her actions to protect his family!","No matter how much Xia Jinyuan controlled himself, his eyes were already misty.","Cobra saw the person beside Qin Maosheng walking toward him. He waved his hand and said calmly without turning his head, “Luke, Xia, go and remind my partner that it’s getting late.”","Damn it, he was really worried that this fellow would really shoot the Chinese female soldiers!","He didn’t ask the four bodyguards beside him to go over. Instead, he asked Luke and Xia Jinyuan to go over. It could be seen that he trusted his bodyguards the most.","“Yes, sir.” Luke, who was used to rushing to the front, nodded immediately and patted Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder. “I’ll talk to the guy. Pay attention to the surroundings.”","At first, Xia Jinyuan thought that he would need to put in a lot of effort to walk to Ye Jian’s side. He pursed his lips and nodded his stiff neck slightly. He stepped out with his slender and straight legs. He walked toward the tree where the three female soldiers were being held.","One step, two steps, three steps... Eight meters, six meters, five meters, three meters... They were getting closer and closer. They were so close that he could see her face clearly. They were so close that he could even see the faint traces of blood at the corner of her mouth. They were so close that... they could hear each other’s breathing.","Ye Jian’s heart was extremely tense. She really wanted to see him up close, but that was merely a thought she had. She didn’t really want to see him up close. She didn’t even want him to stand in front of her.","That was because Yijin was still around.","She was able to control her excitement, but what about Yijin?","Could Yijin restrain herself?","If she suddenly called him ‘Sixth Cousin’, wouldn’t Captain Xia’s identity be exposed instantly? Wouldn’t he be in danger?","‘Don’t come over, Captain Xia. Please, don’t come over.","‘It wasn’t easy for Yijin to persevere until today. If you come over, I can’t guarantee that Yijin won’t call out to you. Captain Xia, for your own safety, please... don’t come over.","‘Please... don’t... come...’"]},{"number":3924,"title":"Chapter 3924: Tears","paragraphs":["Chapter 3924: Tears","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian lowered her eyes while pleading in her heart. She didn’t dare to look forward. She could only occasionally glance in front before quickly retracting her gaze.","Qin Maosheng, who was full of brutality, heard the footsteps behind him and smiled at Zhou Yijin. Under the snowy light, his disgusting yellow teeth were like sharp beast teeth that could pounce on her in the next second.","He retracted his gun, and Ye Jian could see the slender figure more clearly. Captain Xia didn’t hear the pleas in her heart. He walked over calmly and steadily. His straight figure was like a bullet fired from the barrel of a gun.","He was so close that she could see his facial features clearly.","Ye Jian’s chin was hurting from the gun barrel. The corners of her lips trembled slightly. She glared at Qin Maosheng angrily and unwillingly.","She leaned against Zhou Yijin weakly, pretending that she was frightened.","Zhou Yijin thought that Ye Jian was really frightened. She glared at Qin Maosheng and used her body to support Ye Jian.","Luke had already placed his hand on the shoulder of Qin Maosheng’s subordinate who was walking toward them. He smiled and said, “Buddy, you can tell me what you want to say. Coincidentally, Mr. Cobra asked me to pass a message to your boss.”","He walked in front and didn’t pay much attention to the three Chinese female soldiers. Xia Jinyuan didn’t avoid them this time.","He was so close that Xia Jinyuan couldn’t control his gaze anymore. He lowered his eyes slightly and looked at his lover whose neck was straightened by the gun barrel. The fragile blood vessels under her skin could be seen. His fingertips trembled slightly.","It had been a year since they last met. His lover had gotten thinner, but her facial features had become more defined and beautiful. Her face was as bright as the morning sun, and her eyes were like the stars. He could even see his figure reflected in her cold black eyes. She used her ‘angry’ gaze to hide her true feelings and glared at him. She was just... staring blankly at him with longing in the depths of her eyes.","This was the only way they could look at each other openly and greedily.","They needed to disguise themselves before they could even look at each other...","His thin lips moved. Xia Jinyuan mouthed the words he wanted to say, “I missed you, my little fox.”","Ye Jian, who had her chin raised by the gun barrel, saw what he mouthed clearly. Her eyes trembled slightly as she slowly clenched her hands that were tied behind her back.","‘I missed you too, Captain Xia.’","In her heart, Ye Jian answered the person she loved deeply.","On the other hand, Zhou Yijin almost screamed.","Sixth Cousin!","She actually saw her sixth cousin!","After not seeing him for a year, she actually saw him in such a place!","That meant that her guess that his profession was very special was correct. She hadn’t really thought too much about it!","Sixth Cousin... Sixth Cousin-in-law. Zhou Yijin bit her lower lip so that she wouldn’t make a sound. Her entire body started trembling. She saw her sixth cousin here. Did her sixth cousin-in-law... see him? Did she see him?","She must have seen him. She noticed everything. It was impossible that Ye Jian didn’t see him.","Zhou Yijin got a little excited. At the same time, she felt her sixth cousin-in-law placing all her weight on her. Her breathing was rapid. She was stunned for a moment before she gradually understood something."]},{"number":3925,"title":"Chapter 3925: The More I Look At Him, The More I Love Him","paragraphs":["Chapter 3925: The More I Look At Him, The More I Love Him","Editor: Henyee Translations","She retracted her gaze and lowered her head, hiding her frightened face in the darkness. She couldn’t look over at her cousin anymore. If she did, she would expose herself.","The sight of Zhou Yijin lowering her head caused Ye Jian’s heart, which had been in her throat, to calm down. Although her breathing was still rapid, she had already loosened her fists behind her back.","Fortunately, Yijin didn’t call out to Captain Xia. She had just been paranoid.","Her gaze carefully landed on the man she loved deeply once again. As she leaned on Zhou Yijin, Ye Jian could look at her lover who had lost contact with her for a year.","He had lost weight. He had really lost a lot of weight. His cheeks had become more sunken. This made him look even more refined and cold.","He was more tanned too.","In the past, he couldn’t get tanned no matter what. He was even teased and envied by his comrades. Whenever he lined up with his comrades, it was obvious that his skin was many times fairer than his comrades. It made his dark-skinned comrades look even darker.","Captain Xia wasn’t as fair as before now. However, he was still very handsome. Ye Jian’s heart pounded furiously when she saw him.","Every time she looked at him, she would love him more. The more she looked at him, the more she loved him... Her body and mind sank. She didn’t want to leave his world.","He was tanned and skinny, but his spirit didn’t change at all.","He was like an ancient sword that had been unsheathed. He contained a frightening sharpness.","Just like now, he was standing beside the Western man without saying a word. Even if he didn’t say a word, people wouldn’t dare to underestimate him.","This was the man she loved deeply. He was an indomitable and fearless man who used his body to shelter her from the wind and rain!","Ye Jian sized up him carefully from the corner of her eyes and retracted her gaze in satisfaction. She didn’t have any other desires. Even if she could only look at him and couldn’t say a word, she would be satisfied.","The sound of his breathing fell into her ears. It was such an ethereal sound, and it filled up her empty heart. She had never let their long separation affect their feelings. But at this moment, her heart felt whole again.","Her heart was beating furiously because he was beside her.","Satisfied, Ye Jian retracted her gaze. Xia Jinyuan looked at Luke, who was already standing with Qin Maosheng. He took a step forward. The distance between him and Ye Jian was so close that he could reach out his hand.","He did this on purpose so that he could see her more clearly and let her see him more clearly.","As they got closer, their gazes became more cautious. The two of them stopped looking at each other. They just continued to listen to each other’s breathing.","At this moment, Xia Jinyuan relaxed for the first time in a year. His tense heart, which hadn’t been able to relax at all, finally had a short period of peace. The sound of her breathing was a harbor that could let him relax both physically and mentally.","Ye Jian was excited and worried because he was getting closer. Similarly, her comrades from the Xueyu unit were the same.","Especially... V8, who knew of their relationship. His heart was in his throat. His captain’s step just now made his heart feel like it was about to jump out of his throat..."]},{"number":3926,"title":"Chapter 3926: Too Frightening","paragraphs":["Chapter 3926: Too Frightening","Editor: Henyee Translations","He was too scary!","He was too scary!","V8 muttered in a low voice. He was talking to G3 alone. His voice was trembling as he said, “Captain and... Azure Bird met. F*ck, my heart is acting up.”","...","There was a short silence in the earpieces. After a while, G3’s voice, which sounded like sand rubbing against each other, was heard. “So be it. Why is your heart acting up? We’re all in the same place. Isn’t it normal to meet each other?”","“It’s normal for people to meet. The main point is that Q King saw Azure Bird being forced to kneel and her head is even pressed against a gun barrel. This is f*cking scary. I...” V8 swallowed his dry throat with difficulty before saying, “I’m afraid that Q King won’t be able to bear it and will beat up Qin Maosheng.”","“No, Q King won’t be so impulsive.” This time, G3 quickly answered V8.","Their captain was able to tolerate what ordinary people couldn’t and even did something ruthless like beating his girlfriend until she needed to be admitted to the hospital. Even though he was seeing Azure Bird being forced to kneel in front of him by a criminal, no matter how much he couldn’t bear to do it and even if his heart was filled with anger like a volcano, he would always remember his duty. He would never make an impulsive mistake.","Their captain would bear with it even if his heart was bleeding.","This was the captain they knew. He was the king of the Xueyu unit.","“Keep an eye on your surroundings. Don’t look at Cobra too much. Q King reminded us that this bastard is very sharp. Direct your hatred toward those small fries instead. Don’t pick on those retired soldiers from the Myanmar military unit. After all, these people have undergone training. Stare at the trees. The trees don’t know and won’t be able to feel your hatred.”","V8 gritted his teeth and replied to G3, “That’s what I’m doing now. I’m turning into a tortoise!”","“We’ve already driven our car over. We won’t drive it directly into the village. According to your position, we will abandon our car around five kilometers away. If we encounter the nails that Qin Maosheng set up nearby, we’ll have to pull them out before we can come over.”","G3 finished explaining the situation on their side and cut off the communication with V8. He looked up and said to his comrades who were swaying with the car, “Azure Bird is being forced to kneel by a group of bastards. Q King is right in front of her. We have to do what he can’t do now. Those bastards who made Azure Bird kneel can forget about escaping.","“There are around 200 people on the other side. Including our brother company, there are only around 30 of us. The higher-ups want us to teach these bastards a lesson. Let’s teach them a lesson.","“We’ve never worked with our brother company before, so we can’t gauge their capabilities. Previously, we had already agreed that we’d be external help and our brother company would be the attack team. Now that we’re switching it up, do you have any objections?”","T6 and the rest were furious when they heard that Azure Bird was forced to kneel again. They understood what G3 meant and replied in unison, “No objections!”","“Okay, let’s do it again. We’re all good at sneak attacks at night and like to launch killing moves from the back. Tonight will be the same as before. Let’s kill all the sentries first...”","When they heard that Azure Bird was forced to kneel, G3 and his seven comrades adjusted their tactics and reported to the higher-ups.","Commander Xia slammed his fist on the wooden table when he heard that. He glared furiously and gritted his teeth. “They’re going too far!” If they didn’t kill Qin Maosheng, he wouldn’t be able to vent his anger!","“The entire plan is up to you. The Yun Province Military District, the anti-drug unit, and the military have no right to interfere.","“Forcing our soldiers to kneel for the second time and humiliating our country... You have to kill him!","“Be careful. I’ll wait for your triumphant return!”"]},{"number":3927,"title":"Chapter 3927: Blood For Blood","paragraphs":["Chapter 3927: Blood For Blood","Editor: Henyee Translations","These were Commander Xia’s words. He said it word by word so that the Xueyu unit knew how determined he was.","With Commander Xia’s support, G3 and the rest had an easier time.","Very soon, V8 and his team received the readjusted tactics.","1. G3 and the seven others who were supposed to act as foreign aid would participate in the assassination.","2. Only seven brothers from the Clouded Leopard Commando Brigade would remain while the other seven would escort the two female soldiers away.","3. The rest of the plan remained unchanged.","The plan was to wait for the two members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade who had already infiltrated the village to retreat into the forest with the female soldiers before telling the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade.","They paid close attention to the movements in front. V8 and the rest, who were observing Xia Jinyuan, received the change in their combat plan in less than five minutes. At this moment, Qin Maosheng was still using the gun barrel to lift Ye Jian’s chin. He was deliberately using words to scare the Chinese female soldier.","Of the three female soldiers, only Liu Le didn’t know that there was another soldier from China standing opposite her. When she heard those threatening words, her face turned pale and her body swayed.","He said that he wanted to do something to them. He said that he wanted to kill them and let dozens of men take turns to do the deed with their dead bodies. He even said that he wanted to cut off their tongues first and then cut off their fingers and toes to send them to China. He also said that China had no intention of saving them. If Liu Le didn’t know that Ye Jian was sent to save her, her mentality would really collapse at this moment.","After threatening her for a few minutes, Qin Maosheng saw that only one female soldier was trembling in fear. His expression turned dark. He retracted the gun barrel that was pressed against Ye Jian’s chin and planned to scare the three female soldiers in another way.","Liu Le saw the man opening his mouth and spitting saliva on her face. The fierce-looking man retracted the gun barrel that was pressed against Ye Jian’s chin. Her pale lips were showing a faint trace of color. She was afraid that if she screamed, she would bite her lower lip so hard that a deep bite mark would appear.","She shivered and looked at the Western man who suddenly walked over. Then, she looked at the Asian man who was standing beside him. His facial features were as handsome as a deity, but in her eyes, he was like a demon. Liu Le couldn’t help but lean toward Ye Jian out of habit...","Unexpectedly, Ye Jian fell toward Zhou Yijin. Her frightened and weak appearance made Qin Maosheng laugh.","He pointed at Liu Le and pretended to be a charitable person. Laughing, he said to Luke in broken English, “She’s a Chinese female soldier. She’s beautiful. Here.”","After connecting the English words, Luke finally understood what he meant. He hurriedly shook his head and smiled. “I still like Western women. Eastern women are too skinny. Holding them makes me feel like I’m holding a gun. My little brother won’t raise his head at all.”","The translator told Qin Maosheng what he said in Burmese. In return, he laughed even louder. “Eastern women are softer. It’s like hugging soft cotton. You can give it a try.”","Hmph, he still wanted to live a good life. No matter how soft Asian women were, why did he have to find a Chinese female soldier? Luke was thinking this to himself. However, he still smiled slyly and said, “I’ve tried it once. Her chest was small and her butt was flat. She couldn’t pique my interest at all.","“Mr. Qin Maosheng, Mr. Cobra said that we should take a look at your goods first. We received a call just now. We have something on and need to go back immediately. Hence, Mr. Cobra said that he’s very sorry, but he needs to go back tonight.","“We need to hurry up and look at the goods now. Then, we’ll confirm the order and start our business.”"]},{"number":3928,"title":"Chapter 3928: Bear With It","paragraphs":["Chapter 3928: Bear With It","Editor: Henyee Translations","Qin Maosheng, who was laughing just now, pulled a long face. He could already feel that Cobra had rejected him again and again. This made him a little unhappy.","He took a huge step and reached out his hand. He grabbed Liu Le’s hair. Liu Le was in so much pain that she screamed in fright. He dragged Liu Le out by her hair. Qin Maosheng laughed even louder when he heard the female soldier screaming.","“Come on, how can you bear to reject such a beautiful Chinese woman? I’ll give her to you. Hahaha, she’s yours tonight!”","As he spoke loudly, the translator quickly passed the message to Luke in English. In return, a cold glint flashed past Luke’s deep eyes.","Looking at the Chinese female soldier who was screaming with her hands tied behind her back and her legs tied tightly, the smile on Luke’s face disappeared.","Liu Le’s screams stimulated Ye Jian, Xia Jinyuan, and the members of the Xueyu unit and the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade.","“Bastard!”","“Damn it! I can’t hold it in anymore!”","The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade cursed. They tightened their grip on their rifles. They really wanted to shoot the person who was bullying the Chinese female soldier.","They all wanted to, but they could only bear with it.","Before they saw Ye Jian taking action, they couldn’t act on their own!","“Bear with it a little longer, bear with it a little longer. It’s almost over... It will end very soon!” The leader of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade clenched the scope in his hand tightly. The cyan veins on the back of his hand were bulging because he was holding it too tightly.","Liu Le screamed and kicked her tied feet forcefully. She didn’t ask Ye Jian for help because she knew that if she did, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Ye Jian saw Liu Le, whose hair was pulled up forcefully. She saw that her facial features were distorted from the pain. Her eyes turned cold.","She couldn’t do anything now either. If she did, she would only harm Yijin and Liu Le.","“It hurts, it hurts... It hurts...”","Liu Le wanted to cover her head with her hands, but her hands were tied behind her back. She couldn’t. She screamed as Qin Maosheng dragged her up.","Zhou Yijin cursed in Chinese, “Bastard, beast! Let go of her!”","She screamed and scolded. She wanted to ask her sixth cousin for help and almost looked over a few times. Before she did it, she would turn and look at Qin Maosheng again.","Qin Maosheng didn’t know how to speak Chinese, but he had been working at the borders of Myanmar for a long time. He didn’t know how to speak Chinese, but he could more or less understand it.","He could tell that Zhou Yijin was scolding him. He was already unhappy that Cobra rejected him, so his expression turned dark. He pushed Liu Le to the side and raised his leg to kick Zhou Yijin’s chest. Then, he cursed, “Bitch.”","Zhou Yijin was kicked to the ground by him. The surrounding Burmese men started punching and kicking her. They started cursing her violently.","The veins on Xia Jinyuan’s forehead were about to pop.","V8 and the rest held their guns tightly again. ‘Q King, you have to bear with it! You must bear with it!’","Damn, they had to bear with it too!","They mustn’t be rash! They mustn’t be rash!","Luke moved his feet slightly and stopped abruptly. He glanced at the Chinese female soldiers who were thrown out by Qin Maosheng. Just now... Maybe if he had agreed, the two Chinese female soldiers wouldn’t have been hit.","China’s female soldiers had been kidnapped for a few days now. Why hadn’t the Chinese side taken any action?"]},{"number":3929,"title":"Chapter 3929: Arrogant","paragraphs":["Chapter 3929: Arrogant","Editor: Henyee Translations","Would a country’s reaction to external counter-attacks be so slow?","Were they going to let their female soldiers get scolded and beaten up by criminals from another country?","Luke sighed secretly. If a country could abandon their soldiers who were protecting their territory, he... felt sorry for the soldiers of this country.","It wasn’t worth it!","The country that they were proud of abandoned them when they were in danger. This kind of country would only fill people with despair.","Was China really such a country?","The female soldier was still being beaten up, and she was crying on the ground. Her voice filled his ears. The indecent smile on Luke’s face had disappeared. His facial expressions were solemn, and his eyes were filled with pity. He lowered his eyes slightly and looked at the female soldier who was being beaten up.","Even though Zhou Yijin was in so much pain that her stomach cramped up, she bit her lower lip tightly to prevent herself from screaming. She was in so much pain that she could only make muffled sounds from her throat.","She had been enduring it. She wouldn’t let her screams increase the pleasure of these people beating her up.","Ye Jian endured it. She had to endure it. Even Captain Xia had warned her with his gaze that she had to endure it now. If she couldn’t bear it, she would be the one getting beaten up in the next second.","If she was injured after rescuing two female soldiers, all her plans would be delayed.","Cobra frowned when he saw this. He finally moved his footsteps and walked toward the furious Qin Maosheng.","This was a smart but arrogant fellow. Previously, he thought that the two of them could work together for a long time. But now, it seemed like he made the wrong decision.","He really shouldn’t have met such an arrogant fellow!","He didn’t get close. Standing in the shadows that couldn’t be illuminated by the simple street lamps, Cobra said calmly, “Mr. Qin Maosheng, I want to know how long it’ll take for you to end everything. If you’re tight on time, please send a subordinate to bring me over to take a look at the goods, okay?”","Cobra didn’t have much patience left. He had thought that Qin Maosheng was a good partner who could ensure his long-term supply. Who knew that although the other party was powerful enough, he was too arrogant?","The consequences of being too arrogant were usually tragic. He should keep a distance from him.","Cobra was a vigilant fellow who would eliminate anything that went wrong. It was because of his vigilance that Xia Jinyuan’s mission was so difficult. He took every step carefully, afraid that he would make a mistake.","Now, he just wanted to leave immediately. He also wanted Qin Maosheng to continue thinking that their cooperation would continue. He wanted the other party to send him off happily.","Qin Maosheng had already turned around and was facing Cobra, who was talking to him. The translator beside him quickly translated it into Burmese so that Qin Maosheng would immediately know what Cobra said.","Cobra looked at Qin Maosheng who had turned around but hadn’t given out the order to stop beating up the Chinese female soldier. There was a hint of gloominess on his thin and pale face. “You have your own things to deal with. As for me, I have my own things to deal with too. Your time and mine are very precious. Please don’t waste our precious time, okay?”","He didn’t want to participate in the conflict between this arrogant fellow and China. He just wanted to leave this place immediately!","He wanted to leave immediately!","He didn’t want to waste a second!","Even if this fellow was very strict with the village, he didn’t want to stay for another second!"]},{"number":3930,"title":"Chapter 3930: Knife Cut","paragraphs":["Chapter 3930: Knife Cut","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan and Luke heard Cobra’s words and looked at each other tacitly. Luke shrugged and patted the dust off his body. He looked at the Chinese female soldier who was being beaten until she was gritting her teeth and didn’t say anything. Pouting, he asked Xia Jinyuan to return to Cobra with him.","Chinese female soldiers... Not bad. He hoped that they would be able to survive.","Xia Jinyuan turned around and walked back to Cobra. Every step he took, his heart felt like it was being cut by a knife. Every step he took, his feet felt like they were walking on sharp glass shards. It hurt. His heart, his entire body... Every part of his body hurt.","He could only turn around and leave. He couldn’t even look at the women. He still had his mission to complete. He still had things to do. ‘I’m sorry, my lover. I’m sorry, I’m sorry...’","At that moment, Xia Jinyuan’s handsome face was still indifferent, but every step he took was dripping blood. Tears slowly flowed out of his eyes and disappeared into the corners of his mouth.","Her tears were salty and bitter, just like what he was feeling now.","Qin Maosheng could hear the displeasure in Cobra’s voice. He smiled and said loudly, “I’m sorry, Mr. Cobra. I’ve wasted your precious time. Give me three more minutes. I’ll take the photos myself. I’ll then invite you to take a look at the goods I prepared for you immediately.","“Give me the camera. Hurry!”","The camera had always been in the hands of the Burmese woman, Dan Yi. Qin Maosheng said that he wanted to take the photos personally. She wanted to squeeze over and pass the camera to him, but a Burmese man beside her took the camera away and handed it to him respectfully.","Dan Yi, who had a perverted hatred toward the Chinese soldiers, was overjoyed when she saw the Chinese female soldier getting beaten up. She secretly glared at the man who made her lose her chance of interacting with her boss. Then, she continued staring excitedly at the Chinese female soldier who was still being beaten up.","‘Hit them. Hit them. Hit them hard. It’s best if you can kill all three of them. Don’t let them return to China alive!’","Dust was kicked up by the punches and kicks. The snow-white street lamps shone on the dust. Qin Maosheng looked at Zhou Yijin who was still being kicked and took a photo with a click.","Qin Maosheng took a photo of Zhou Yijin. Then, he took a photo of Liu Le, who was lying on the ground. Her body was curled up, and there were two streaks of tears on her face.","Xia Jinyuan, who was standing beside Cobra, witnessed everything. His handsome face, which was hidden in the shadows, looked indifferent, but in fact, his jaw was clenched extremely tightly. He was in extreme pain. He didn’t let his gaze move away. He stared coldly at all the atrocities and remembered the faces of the people beating up the female soldier.","He would remember these people!","Ye Jian was the only one who wasn’t beaten up. Her angry gaze landed on Qin Maosheng’s face. She only glanced at her lover who was already standing in the shadows through the corners of her eyes.","If it was her turn to be beaten up, she would ask him to remain as cold and indifferent as he was now. He must not... show any signs of abnormality.","The Western man whose gaze was as sinister as a venomous snake, who always hid in the dark without revealing his true face easily, was Xia Jinyuan’s mission. The others had nothing to do with his mission.","‘Captain Xia, please maintain your indifference!’","Ye Jian suddenly retracted her gaze when her shoulder was kicked. Her gaze followed the kick and moved away from the man she loved deeply. Finally, it landed on the face of the person who kicked her.","Qin Maosheng stood with a camera in his hand. He looked down at the furious female soldier. After looking at her for a few seconds, he gritted his teeth and gave a sinister smile."]},{"number":3931,"title":"Chapter 3931: Stepping On Her Face","paragraphs":["Chapter 3931: Stepping On Her Face","Editor: Henyee Translations","This Chinese female soldier’s facial expression showed that she was too stubborn. He didn’t like it!","Qin Maosheng saw Ye Jian lying on the ground without admitting defeat. He propped his upper body up with his elbow and smiled sinisterly. Raising his leg, he kicked Ye Jian’s shoulder again. Then, he made a gesture that made Xia Jinyuan almost break his fingers from clenching his fist too tightly","He stood in front of Ye Jian, who was struggling to support her upper body. He raised his leg and stepped on Ye Jian’s face with the sole of his shoe. Spitting on the ground, he said in a sinister tone, “Do you want to sit up? Have you asked me for my permission?”","The moment the hard rubber sole with a strange smell stepped on her face, Ye Jian wasn’t thinking about how she would be treated next. She was thinking about... the man who loved her deeply. Could he restrain himself like just now?","She was kicked until she fell sideways. Her face was facing the crowd in front of her. Her vision was so narrow that it was blurry. She could see the calves of countless people, including the man she loved deeply. She saw him standing in front of her without moving. The wind blew past his pants. She could clearly see that his calves were extremely tense. She could even see his legs trembling slightly...","Ye Jian didn’t struggle. She could struggle, but she didn’t want to.","She didn’t want him to see her struggling. She didn’t want him to feel sorry for her. She didn’t want him to be impulsive because of her either.","She didn’t want the Captain Xia she loved to be in danger because of her. He was already in danger. V8 told him that Cobra was a drug dealer and an extremist. Captain Xia was walking on a thin layer of ice every day.","He was already in so much danger. Every step he took had to be done cautiously. How could she bear to let his efforts of more than a year go to waste because of her? How could she bear to see him be pushed into eternal damnation because of her?","This short humiliation was worth it in exchange for his safety!","Hence, rather than struggle, it was better to obey and avoid more humiliation.","Ye Jian didn’t move. She allowed the hard sole of Qin Maosheng’s shoe to step on her face. She allowed the bastard who stepped on her to laugh wildly. There was only one thought in her mind. She had to use her own method to protect her lover!","‘My lover, please continue to bear with it. For my sake, please stand at the same spot and continue to maintain your indifference. Just watch coldly like a stranger.","‘Please, you must hear the wish in my heart!’","Click... Click...","The camera’s flash was so intense that people couldn’t help but squint. Qin Maosheng raised his camera and took a photo of him stepping on Ye Jian’s cheek.","V8 and the rest were seeing this as well. They were gritting their teeth so hard that their mouths were about to bleed.","Damn it, that bastard!","How dare he humiliate their Azure Bird!","He was courting death! He was courting death!","At this moment, the Xueyu unit’s comrades’ endurance was reaching its limit. They were enduring so much that the veins on their foreheads were bulging. They were enduring so much that their right hand, which wasn’t holding their guns, was grabbing the grass, soil, and rocks beside them tightly. They tried their best to control themselves so that they could continue to endure it.","“G3, he... kicked Azure Bird down. He raised his foot and stepped on Azure Bird’s face. Qin Maosheng... He stepped on Ye Jian’s face! I’m already bleeding internally. Hurry up and come over!”","The last sentence, ‘Hurry up and come over’, was forced out through gritted teeth.","It was too hard to bear with it. He almost couldn’t bear it anymore."]},{"number":3932,"title":"Chapter 3932: Vomiting Blood","paragraphs":["Chapter 3932: Vomiting Blood","Editor: Henyee Translations","G3 wasn’t present, but when he heard this, he clenched his fists and shouted in a low voice, “Damn it, you have to bear with it even if you can’t! Even Q King can bear with it. You have to bear with it too!”","His girlfriend’s face was stepped on by a criminal. The person who suffered the most was Q King. He was enduring it more than anyone else!","If he could endure it, everyone else had to endure it!","Everyone had to bear with it!","When a comrade from the Xueyu unit saw this scene, he couldn’t take it anymore and bit his arm.","He bit forcefully. A sound came out of his throat. It was muffled like thunder. The eyes of V8 and the rest had turned red.","It was too painful and unbearable.","‘Sons of b*tches, I will use your blood to repay tonight’s debt!’","Although the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade were not Ye Jian’s comrades, they were all Chinese soldiers. When they saw this moment, they were all furious. They really wanted to rush up and shoot with the guns in their hands.","The people closest to Ye Jian were the two members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade who entered the village after Ye Jian got off the boat. They were the closest to the female soldiers, but they could only watch and not do anything.","If they moved, they might be able to vent their anger for a moment. However, if their entire plan was ruined, no one would be able to leave alive.","Now, they could only bear with it. They could only bear with it until their hearts bled.","“Brothers, this is a crucial moment. Calm down. Let them be arrogant now. It’ll be our turn later!” The leader of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade gritted his teeth and said in the public channel. He was saying this to comfort himself so that he could calm down.","V8 gritted his teeth when he heard this. He said to his comrade beside him, “Brother, you’re right. At the critical moment, we must bear with it. There’s someone else who’s suffering more than us. If he can bear it, we have to bear it. We can’t drag him down.”","Qin Maosheng had already appeared. The female soldier in charge of the decapitation strike, Ye Jian, would definitely take action. They would infiltrate the vicinity of the dungeon again and cooperate with Ye Jian to rescue the two female soldiers first. Then, they would work together to assassinate Qin Maosheng.","Looking at Ye Jian, who was being stepped on by Qin Maosheng, all the soldiers hiding in the dark didn’t look away. They widened their eyes. They wanted to remember this scene and make Qin Maosheng, who humiliated the Chinese soldiers, pay the price!","No one knew how much pain Xia Jinyuan was in.","His handsome face was indifferent as he stood beside Cobra. He looked at the humiliated Ye Jian with the eyes of a stranger. He didn’t even dare to clench his fists to control himself. This was so that the sensitive Cobra and Luke wouldn’t notice his abnormality.","On the surface, he had disguised himself perfectly. But the blood in his heart was surging like a storm. The organ in his chest seemed to have gone on strike. Blood kept spurting out. A rusty smell surged into his throat. Xia Jinyuan looked at Qin Maosheng who was laughing arrogantly and swallowed the blood that had rushed into his mouth.","His mouth was filled with blood. He tilted his head and raised his wrist casually. He used his sleeve to wipe the blood at the corner of his mouth. His handsome face turned a little pale."]},{"number":3933,"title":"Chapter 3933: The Price Of Cruelty","paragraphs":["Chapter 3933: The Price Of Cruelty","Editor: Henyee Translations","The comrades from the Xueyu unit were right. The person who was suffering the most was Xia Jinyuan, who loved Ye Jian deeply.","His little fox, the lover he loved deeply, was now suffering humiliation. And he... once said that he would protect her. But what could he do now?","He couldn’t do anything!","He couldn’t do anything!","He could only watch. Everyone around them could only watch!","He could only watch from the side!","He had to bear with it. Even if all his comrades hiding in the dark, including his comrades in the company, couldn’t bear it, he had to bear it.","His little fox had already told him with her lack of resistance that she wouldn’t move, so he couldn’t move either!","For her sake and for his own sake, he couldn’t do anything. Even if she suffered unprecedented pain, he needed to stand tall like a mountain and not move.","But he was human too!","He was a man with blood, flesh, and emotions!","The person he loved deeply was suffering in front of him. He promised to protect her but he couldn’t do anything. Was he useful?","He was useless!","He was useless!","He was f*cking useless!","As the man of a woman, he was f*cking useless!","However, he wasn’t just a man with blood, flesh, and emotions. He was a soldier too!","Duty, faith, protection, loyalty, steadfastness, fearlessness, making sacrifices... He was a soldier who needed to put love aside and be responsible for the military uniform he wore.","He was a man and a soldier. When love and duty conflicted, he had no choice but to choose duty.","‘I’m sorry, I’m sorry. My comrade, my lover, in the face of love and duty, I choose duty.","‘Sorry, sorry...’","Blood rushed into his mouth, but he swallowed it. Even if his heart was burned to ashes, he could only watch coldly. Even if his soul seemed to be dead, he had to continue holding on!","Xia Jinyuan’s face was as pale as gold. He swallowed the last mouthful of blood that rushed into his mouth. His body, which was as tall as a pine and as straight as a gun, stood still. He never moved.","Ye Jian smiled. She smiled in her heart.","This was the man she loved deeply. No matter how hard it was, she was willing to do it.","Even if the love of a special forces soldier couldn’t be exposed for the rest of her life, she would take good care of it. Even if it was heartbreaking, she would accept it without any regrets.","The reason why Xia Jinyuan was able to attract Ye Jian was that he was always good at distinguishing things. He knew what he should and shouldn’t do. He could even tell Ye Jian what she should and shouldn’t do.","Ye Jian could accept it even if he did it in a very cruel way.","Why?","Because he was different from her!","Every mission they carried out was to reunite alive. If they wanted to reunite alive, they must pay the price for ‘coming back alive’.","Just like now, both of them were paying the price for ‘coming back alive and reuniting’.","Although it was so cruel, the two of them still managed to do it.","Ye Jian felt that it was worth it to pay a huge and cruel price for a short reunion!","Ye Jian, who thought that her actions now were worth it, remained still even when Qin Maosheng purposely crushed her face with the sole of his shoe. Now, it was a storm. After the storm, there would be a rainbow.","And she would definitely see the rainbow."]},{"number":3934,"title":"Chapter 3934: Stomp Back Hard","paragraphs":["Chapter 3934: Stomp Back Hard","Editor: Henyee Translations","Actually, even after living two lives, Ye Jian’s face had never been stepped on by anyone.","At this moment, the emotions in her heart weren’t as overwhelming as her comrades. Xia Jinyuan’s restraint was the motivation for her to accept it calmly. Hence, she wasn’t too angry.","More importantly, she would personally take revenge on the person who stepped on her face!","He was stepping on her face now, and she would do the same to him later!","There was still a faint fishy smell in his mouth. Xia Jinyuan placed his hands in his wide trouser pockets. He clenched his fists so tightly that his knuckles turned greenish-white. There were many deep nail arcs on his palms. If he used too much strength, the nail arcs left on his palms would turn greenish-purple.","The helpless self-blame was like a cross gallows, and he was the man who was nailed to the gallows, suffering a fate worse than death.","Finally, Xia Jinyuan retracted his cold gaze. He didn’t want to look at her anymore. If he looked at her again, he was afraid that his willpower would collapse instantly.","The blood in his mouth gradually faded. Xia Jinyuan turned to look at Luke and said calmly, “Luke, I...”","His low voice disappeared into the night wind. He looked at Luke’s forbearing expression and slowly scanned his face. Then, he saw Luke’s tightly clenched fists. After staring at his fists for a few seconds, Xia Jinyuan’s gaze slowly returned to Luke’s forbearing face.","He noticed that there was something unusual about Luke...","Suddenly, he felt that Cobra, who was standing in front of him, was about to turn his body and look in their direction. Xia Jinyuan moved his footsteps and stood in front of Luke, blocking his vision of the female soldier and Cobra’s line of vision.","“The two of you will guard outside later. If anything happens, rush in directly.” Cobra took advantage of Qin Maosheng’s smugness when humiliating the Chinese female soldiers and instructed the two of them in a low voice, “Don’t give him a chance to separate you.”","Luke slowly released his hands and nodded. “Yes, sir.”","Cobra glanced at Xia Jinyuan again and nodded slightly. Then, he retracted his gaze and continued watching Qin Maosheng’s intentional performance.","‘Perform, clown. I believe that you don’t have many chances to perform anymore.","‘Poor clown. I hope you cherish your last moments.’","On the other side, Qin Maosheng, who had finished his performance, retracted his leg and deliberately used the sole of his shoe to crush Ye Jian’s face a few times. He only retracted his leg when he was so happy that he threw his head back and laughed.","A dirty shoe print was left on Ye Jian’s face. There was a bloody wound on her face. The blood mixed with the mud and condensed into a lump that stained her face.","“Send the photos to the Chinese side and tell them that if they don’t cooperate with me, I don’t need the goods back. These three Chinese female soldiers will be used as payment. My subordinates can take turns to play with them!”","He threw the camera in his hand to the subordinate beside him. The subordinate who took the camera passed it to another person. The other person passed the camera to Dan Yi, who was in charge of developing the photos.","Dan Yi, who took the camera, finally smiled. She didn’t laugh. She just laughed loudly in her inner thoughts. Chinese soldiers.... ‘Hahaha, did you see it? Brother, did you see it?","‘The Chinese soldiers who killed you were beaten up. Did you see it?’","Dan Yi, who couldn’t laugh, looked even more hideous than Qin Maosheng. She even kicked Zhou Yijin’s back twice when no one was looking."]},{"number":3935,"title":"Chapter 3935: Get It Back For You","paragraphs":["Chapter 3935: Get It Back For You","Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhou Yijin didn’t know who hit her. She bit her lower lip so hard that blood started seeping out. It was so painful, but she didn’t make a sound.","Ye Jian, who had already sat up, raised her shoulder and used it to wipe the bloodstained mud at the corner of her mouth. Her cold gaze landed on Dan Yi, who was secretly attacking Zhou Yijin.","This woman would become her second target tonight.","Whether she could speak to Captain Xia tonight was secondary. She just wanted to get rid of Qin Maosheng first and then... get rid of this Burmese woman who hated the Chinese soldiers to the core and didn’t hide the killing intent in her eyes!","A bodyguard with a cell phone in his hand walked to Qin Maosheng’s side and handed the cell phone over respectfully.","It was a call from Commander Minlai. He planned to come over tonight and have a good talk with Cobra personally. He wanted Cobra to wait for him.","His call indirectly prevented Qin Maosheng from beating up the Chinese female soldiers. Qin Maosheng looked at Cobra, who was standing not far away. A sinister glint flashed past his triangular eyes. He said to Commander Minlai, “I understand, Commander. Cobra and I will wait for you tonight.”","Since Commander Minlai said that he wanted to talk to Cobra personally, it meant that he knew that Cobra had always been here and had not left. Qin Maosheng didn’t have a chance to lie even if he wanted to.","The kicks and punches finally ended. The three Chinese female soldiers were dragged back to the dungeon again. Xia Jinyuan, who was standing beside Cobra, exhaled softly. It was finally... over.","‘Yijin, are you alright?","‘Wait a little longer. Very soon, some soldiers will come and save you. Very soon, everything will be over.","‘My little fox, you’re really strong. You’re so strong that it exceeded my expectations. After not seeing you for a year, you’ve already become a qualified soldier. I’ll definitely take revenge for what you suffered today!’","As Ye Jian and the other three female soldiers were dragged away, Qin Maosheng smiled again with a cold expression. He invited Cobra to the wooden house as if nothing had happened.","Naturally, Cobra wanted to reject him. However, Qin Maosheng mentioned that Commander Minlai was planning to come over. He could only wait even if he wanted to leave immediately.","Thus, Cobra could only wait.","“Commander Minlai will arrive in around two hours. We’ll look at the goods while waiting for Commander Minlai to come personally. Mr. Cobra, it looks like Commander Minlai is very sincere in wanting to cooperate with you. I can already see that we’ll have many cooperations in the future.”","Qin Maosheng, who had a cold look in his eyes, laughed as he spoke. He didn’t seem to mind how much Commander Minlai valued Cobra.","To express his gratitude, Cobra bowed slightly and asked politely, “I’m very honored to be recognized by Commander Minlai. I want to know if the commander is coming from his military unit? From the distance, it’s impossible to reach in about two hours, right?”","“The commander has his own helicopter. In order to see you, the commander will take a helicopter over after he’s done with his things.”","Qin Maosheng’s voice was much lighter. The translator was nervous. He translated the Burmese words into English and changed the cold tone to something that sounded more like respect. That way, Cobra wouldn’t feel as uncomfortable.","Although the translator was humble, Cobra could hear the displeasure in Qin Maosheng’s tone. He smiled and nodded. He said to the translator, “Tell him that we’ll definitely have many opportunities to cooperate. We can earn a lot of money together. Also, ask him if he can bring me to his warehouse to take a look.”","Even the translator found the request difficult. How was that possible?"]},{"number":3936,"title":"Chapter 3936: Stupid","paragraphs":["Chapter 3936: Stupid","Editor: Henyee Translations","After listening to the translation, Qin Maosheng raised his thick eyebrows. Cobra wanted to go to his warehouse to look at the goods?","“Mr. Cobra, my warehouse is here. However, besides my men, the other people who have gone to my warehouse are all dead. Do you still want to go?”","“Hahaha, no, no. I don’t want to go to the warehouse anymore.” Cobra laughed and said humorously, “I still want to live for a long time. If I see your warehouse, I’ll be finished. What a pity.","“You will feel that it’s a pity too, because you’ll lose a partner who will bring you huge wealth.”","After some time, Qin Maosheng burst into laughter too. He ordered his subordinates to fetch the goods and send them to his usual resting place.","Smiling, Cobra narrowed his eyes when he saw Qin Maosheng instructing one of his subordinates to fetch the goods. He was waiting for Commander Minlai to come over. He wanted to know the location of Qin Maosheng’s drug stockpile.","Hence, he could understand.","No one was stupid enough to reveal their trump card. However, he still wanted to know where this fellow’s warehouse was.","Cobra understood the reasoning but couldn’t accept it, so he winked at one of the bodyguards. The bodyguard nodded slightly, indicating that he understood his order.","Cobra didn’t know where he would be invited to. Cobra and Qin Maosheng chatted and laughed as they continued walking up the mountain. He didn’t seem to care if it was dangerous to follow a hungry wolf blindly. They chatted and laughed along the way as if they were good friends for many years. Cobra didn’t feel any pressure.","They needed to wait for Commander Minlai to come together. Qin Maosheng didn’t dare to do anything to anger Commander Minlai. Hence, no matter where he went, Cobra would be safe.","Of course, Qin Maosheng didn’t dare to do anything to Cobra. He was able to gain the recognition of Commander Minlai because he was very tactful.","Now, no matter how afraid he was of Cobra, he had to smile and chat the entire time. “I take up most of the goods from the Golden Triangle. The rest will be split equally among Thailand, Laos, and Vietnam. I can fulfill your orders however much you ask for and whenever you want it. I can also ensure that the purity of my goods is the highest, and there’s no doubt about the safety.”","Qin Maosheng’s confident voice floated over from the front. Xia Jinyuan, who was observing his surroundings and looking for a good hiding spot, glanced at a bodyguard who suddenly turned and left. His eyes were a little dark.","Cobra’s bodyguards must be secretly tracking the others to find out where all the drugs were hidden.","He glanced at the back of Qin Maosheng’s head again. Waves surged in his dark eyes. Killing intent was apparent in them.","Since Azure Bird’s mission was Qin Maosheng and she had the cooperation of his comrades from the Xueyu unit, they wouldn’t let him leave alive tonight. The drugs stored in the village would also be burned to ashes.","Now, they just needed to wait for Azure Bird to fire her first gun in combat.","Also, he needed to settle everything before Commander Minlai came. He needed to pass the news to his comrades.","His comrades and the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade had secretly infiltrated this foreign territory. Although they weren’t afraid of Commander Minlai finding out, if they fought in front of him, the problem wouldn’t be as simple as rescuing the kidnapped female soldiers.","‘Little fox, it’s up to you to spread the news.’","He hoped that he would be able to meet her when the battle started. He hoped that he could hug her and tell her that she was really amazing. She was the most powerful female soldier in his heart.","Xia Jinyuan’s palm was bruised by his fingernails. He quickened his pace and followed the people walking toward the wooden house on the mountain. The killing intent in his eyes had already disappeared."]},{"number":3937,"title":"Chapter 3937: Operation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3937: Operation","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian, who had to take the first step of starting a combat, was dragged back to the dungeon. This time, Yijin’s injuries were the most serious. She whispered to Ye Jian, “Sixth Cousin-in-law, I think my ribs are broken.”","Those men had used so much strength to kick her. Now, even saying a sentence caused her chest to hurt.","Ye Jian quickly untied herself. She twisted her hands into a strange arc. There seemed to be the sound of bones rubbing against each other. The rope was so tight that her wrists were burning with pain. But Ye Jian didn’t stop.","She whispered to Zhou Yijin in a gentle voice so that Zhou Yijin wouldn’t be able to hear that Ye Jian was in pain, “Don’t overexert yourself. Give me two more minutes.”","She would be able to release herself from the rope that had tied her up for more than ten hours soon. It would be done soon.","On the other hand, Liu Le was sobbing softly. She hunched over and moved slowly to Zhou Yijin’s side. She sobbed guiltily. “Yijin, I implicated you. I’m sorry, I’m sorry. I implicated you...”","Her entire body was in so much pain that her bones were hurting. When Zhou Yijin heard that Liu Le was about to faint from crying, she grinned and smiled optimistically. “You didn’t. Liu Le, don’t think too much. Also, don’t lean on me. I’m injured now. Come closer...”","Zhou Yijin, who was still in the mood to joke around, gasped in pain as she spoke. “You didn’t choose a good position. I’m still in pain.”","“I’m sorry, I’m sorry...” Liu Le apologized even more guiltily. She hurriedly moved her body away, and her tears flowed even more furiously.","What should she do next?","Tears welled up in Liu Le’s eyes.","Could Ye Jian save them?","It had been so long, but there was still no movement. Was she unable to save them?","Tears streamed down Liu Le’s face. She got even more frightened. The confidence that she had painstakingly built up crumbled again tonight. She started to doubt if she could return to the military unit alive.","Just as Liu Le was letting her imagination run wild, Ye Jian finally relaxed herself. When the rope fell from her wrists, Ye Jian disregarded her severely numbed shoulders and quickly untied her legs.","The agility of her hands was still a little lacking. Just now, when she forcefully twisted and untied the rope, her wrists were injured by the rough rope. However, it didn’t affect Ye Jian’s speed of untying the rope around her legs. Soon, her legs were freed.","Ye Jian threw the rope aside and stood up. She walked over and helped Liu Le up. Then, she said to Zhou Yijin, who was wide-eyed in the dark because Ye Jian could suddenly move normally, “We’ll definitely be able to leave tonight. We’ll all be able to leave safely.”","Liu Le, who had lost her confidence, was dumbfounded. She sat there in a daze until she could move her hands and legs. She couldn’t come back to her senses.","Zhou Yijin’s eyes were already filled with tears. She knew that her sixth cousin-in-law would definitely have a way. She knew that since her sixth cousin-in-law was here, she would definitely be able to leave alive.","“After you leave with the soldiers who come to save you, don’t panic. Just follow them.”","Ye Jian didn’t know that the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade had already infiltrated the vicinity. However, according to the original plan, as long as she saw Qin Maosheng appear, the entire rescue plan would start. In that case, the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade should be approaching the dungeon.","She needed to hurry up and make a move too!","After taking care of the people outside the dungeon, they would secretly save the female soldiers. Right on the heels of that, Ye Jian would sneak into the darkness and take the opportunity to kill Qin Maosheng. With that, the entire plan would end."]},{"number":3938,"title":"Chapter 3938: Take Care","paragraphs":["Chapter 3938: Take Care","Editor: Henyee Translations","Whether she could meet Captain Xia, who was here too, was still unknown.","Ignoring the bitterness in her heart, Ye Jian untied the rope for Zhou Yijin and asked her to lie down gently. She then instructed Zhou Yijin to take a deep breath to see if the pain would get worse.","Partial pain was the most obvious symptom of a broken rib. At the same time, she would cough. Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief. Yijin hadn’t coughed so far, and she didn’t feel any pain when she took deep breaths.","“It’s probably just a soft tissue bruise. There are no broken ribs,” Ye Jian said in a low voice with a relaxed smile.","Zhou Yijin even tried to turn her body. After confirming that there was no obvious pain, she heaved a sigh of relief. “It looks like the benefits of long-term dancing training are evident. My bones are more flexible than ordinary people.”","Liu Le, who had regained her senses from wondering how Ye Jian could move normally, couldn’t help but laugh as she cried. It seemed to be true. Besides bruises, her bones were fine.","The two of them smiled. The smile in Ye Jian’s eyes got deeper.","There was a bitterness in Zhou Yijin’s smile that Liu Le didn’t have. She raised her hand and touched Ye Jian’s face carefully. She rubbed it a few times. Zhou Yijin then pounced into Ye Jian’s arms as tears fell from her eyes.","It was alright if she got beaten up, but what about her sixth cousin-in-law?","That bastard had stepped on her sixth cousin-in-law’s face and taken photos of her.","That was the biggest humiliation.","“I’m sorry, Sixth Cousin-in-law. I’m sorry... I shouldn’t have sent you a message. If I hadn’t done that, you wouldn’t have needed to suffer with us.”","She didn’t dare to sob too loudly. She was afraid that they would attract the attention of the guards outside. Her shoulders twitched, and her tears came streaming down. They instantly wet Ye Jian’s chest.","Ye Jian’s soft and firm voice came from above her head. “You asked me for help, which means that you believe me. Even if you hadn’t sent me a message, I would’ve still come to save you if I found out through other means.","“Stop crying. If you continue crying, you’ll drench my clothes.. Also, don’t you find it dirty? I haven’t changed my clothes for a few days. Don’t you smell the sourness?”","In the end, Ye Jian made a joke. Zhou Yijin wanted to laugh, but she wanted to cry even more. She buried her entire face in Ye Jian’s shoulder and said in a low voice, “That’s good. I haven’t washed my face for a few days. I can wash my face if your clothes are wet.”","“Let’s go out and wash our faces with clean water. Let’s not wash our faces with tears... Washing our faces with tears is...” There was a slight rustling sound outside as if something was dragged away. Ye Jian’s gaze turned sharp before she could say the word ‘dirty’. She held Zhou Yijin’s shoulders and let her leave her arms. She placed a finger to her mouth and made a shushing gesture. Then, Ye Jian quickly rolled a few times to hide at the edge of the door to the dungeon.","Someone was gently prying open the iron chain. Ye Jian slowly leaned over and looked outside. When she retracted her gaze, there was a bright light in her eyes. This person was definitely not from Qin Maosheng’s side. Since that was the case, then the soldiers who were here to save them must be here!","Although she had a guess, Ye Jian still asked in a low voice, “Who is it?”","“Cloud Leopard...”","The dark figure spoke in a low voice as he gently pried open the iron lock. Just as he was about to pull out the iron chain, the team member in charge of keeping watch outside said hurriedly, “Someone’s here!”"]},{"number":3939,"title":"Chapter 3939: Assassination","paragraphs":["Chapter 3939: Assassination","Editor: Henyee Translations","The member of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade who was prying the lock quickly repeated to Ye Jian that someone was coming. Just as he was about to lock the iron lock again, Ye Jian, who was leaning over to look outside, saw who was walking over in the dark. She stopped him secretly and said, “There’s no need to lock it. Only a woman is coming.”","“Be careful!” The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade hid themselves. Ye Jian reached out her hand and gently took off the iron chain. At the same time, she pulled the corner of the iron door with both hands. Danyi... was one of the targets she needed to kill tonight!","Since she came knocking on her door, there was no reason for Ye Jian to let her leave alive.","Ye Jian leaned against the corner of the wall and stood up slowly. She hid in a corner and waited for Danyi to come over.","Danyi, who was in charge of delivering water and food to the Chinese female soldiers, appeared at the entrance of the dungeon again. She looked at the door of the dungeon that wasn’t guarded and then at the iron chain that was placed casually at the side. She didn’t think too much and heaved a sigh of relief.","She even found a reason to send water to the female soldiers so that the guard would open the door for her. Now, she didn’t even need to say anything and she could enter.","She tightened her grip on the dagger in her hand. Killing intent flashed in her eyes. She pushed open the iron door and walked in.","She would never know that she had stepped on a path of no return. A black shadow suddenly flashed past from the side. Before she could react, her right hand that was holding the dagger was grabbed. She felt as if something cold had suddenly entered her chest... It was very cold and painful.","She opened her mouth and wanted to say something. However, right when she thought that she should call for help, her mouth was blocked too. A dark figure suddenly rushed out and covered her mouth. She was pushed to the side.","She started kicking her legs. Even her eyes were wide open.","It hurt. Her chest hurt.","The fear in her widened eyes was amplified. In the end, her gaze was fixed on a black shadow whose face couldn’t be seen clearly. She heard the black shadow’s low and cold voice. “Danyi, you said that our truck hit you and we needed to send you to the hospital. Now, take a guess if I’ll accompany you to the hospital?”","This voice...","She could tell who it was!","She could tell who it was!","It was the voice of the Chinese female soldier!","She could tell who it was!","“Urgh... urgh...” Dan Yi started struggling even harder. However, after a moment of fierceness, she stopped moving. Her chest was in too much pain. The dagger that should have stabbed into the body of the Chinese female soldier... was now stabbed into her body.","As it turned out, it was so painful to be stabbed by a knife.","Did that mean that she was killed by the Chinese soldiers like her brother?","Was her life coming to an end?","Dan Yi’s face was no longer as happy as when she saw the Chinese female soldiers getting beaten up. She was only shocked that her life was about to disappear.","She breathed heavily through her nose. She shook her head weakly and begged for mercy.","No, no, she didn’t want to end like this.","She didn’t want to die. She didn’t want to die...","Ye Jian released the hand that was covering her mouth. Her dark eyes were cold. “Do you want me to send you to the hospital?”","Yes, yes, she wanted to go to the hospital. Hurry up, hurry up and send her to the hospital. She didn’t want to die. She didn’t want to die at all.","Dan Yi didn’t expect death to come so suddenly. She was so shocked that tears kept flowing out of her eyes. She even raised her hand, wanting to pull Ye Jian and beg her to send her to the hospital.","Ye Jian looked at her raised hands with a smile. Lowering her body, she whispered into Dan Yi’s ear, “Do you think I’ll send someone who wants to kill Chinese soldiers to the hospital?”"]},{"number":3940,"title":"Chapter 3940: Relieved","paragraphs":["Chapter 3940: Relieved","Editor: Henyee Translations","The cold voice reached Dan Yi’s ears. The shock on her face piled up even more. She didn’t want to die... She wanted to go to the hospital. Please, she wanted to be sent to the hospital.","As long as she was sent to the hospital, she would be obedient in the future. She wouldn’t dare to think about killing the Chinese soldiers every day. Please... Dan Yi begged with her eyes. Large tears kept flowing out of her eyes. Her strong desire to survive made her humble.","Ye Jian was unmoved by her begging. The corners of her dry lips curled up slightly. She smiled faintly and said, “Don’t think too much. Dan Yi, you can only wait for death to come and take your soul.”","“Please... Please... Please... Please...” Dan Yi begged for mercy. Blood kept flowing out of her mouth. The horror on her face got worse.","It was useless. Her pleas couldn’t move Ye Jian at all.","If she didn’t get rid of Dan Yi today, some Chinese soldiers might really die in her hands in the future.","She wouldn’t be so kind as to spare Dan Yi’s life.","To be kind to your enemies was to be cruel to yourself!","Dan Yi widened her eyes and finally stopped breathing. Blood was still flowing out of her mouth, and her body was still twitching slightly...","She didn’t understand why she lost her life in the end. She didn’t understand why the person who was supposed to be tied up could kill her.","Ye Jian didn’t answer her question. She just wanted to kill an enemy that could harm the Chinese soldiers. After that, she would naturally leave.","At this moment, the two members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade who were in charge of rescuing the female soldiers had also sneaked into the dungeon. One of them held a gun and guarded the entrance of the dungeon while the other entered the dungeon to untie the female soldiers.","The soldier who came in looked at the figure lying on the ground. The smell of blood seeped into his nostrils. He glanced at the three Chinese female soldiers standing together.","How... did they deal with this Burmese woman?","Why didn’t they hear anything outside?","Puzzlement flashed past his mind. He took out his combat dagger and prepared to untie the three female soldiers.","Soon, he noticed another problem.","He could vaguely see that the three female soldiers could move their hands and legs. All of them looked like they had been untied.","After taking care of Dan Yi, Ye Jian immediately returned to Zhou Yijin’s side and pulled up the two women who were still sitting on the ground. “We’ll leave this place immediately. You can leave with the soldiers who came to save us. It’s all over. Go back and have a good sleep. When you wake up, treat it as a bad dream.”","The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Unit couldn’t help but whisper, “Are they all untied?”","“Yes, they’re both free.” Ye Jian held the cold hands of the two female soldiers. She asked the soldier calmly, “Give me a gun. You’re in charge of moving forward. I’ll be in charge of bringing up the rear!”","The member of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade, who had been going along with Ye Jian’s momentum the entire time, handed over a pistol and suppressed the questions in his heart. He whispered, “Retreat!”","The moment they said ‘retreat’, the Chinese soldier guarding outside didn’t relax. Instead, he held his gun tightly and got ready for combat.","Retreat was the hardest and most dangerous. If they were not careful, they would be discovered. They would only feel at ease when they entered the mountain.","Two male soldiers with guns walked in front. Zhou Yijin and Liu Le were in the middle. Ye Jian was at the back.","The people who left, including Zhou Yijin and Liu Le, didn’t even look at Dan Yi, who was lying on the ground. They hurriedly left the dungeon.","Ye Jian brought up the rear and dragged Dan Yi to a corner of the wall. Then, she closed the door, tied the iron chain, and locked it again. Then, she quickly followed the rest of the group."]},{"number":3941,"title":"Chapter 3941: Serves You Right","paragraphs":["Chapter 3941: Serves You Right","Editor: Henyee Translations","Zhou Yijin and Liu Le didn’t know that a woman had died in front of them even after they left the dungeon. The main reason was that they didn’t see how Ye Jian did it. They only knew that someone had come in. Then, Ye Jian, who was hiding in the dark, rushed over like a ferocious beast. They didn’t know what she did, but the person fell to the ground. Her voice was so weak that they only understood the words ‘save me’.","Save her?","They should be the ones needing saving.","Liu Le and Zhou Yijin heard the words ‘save me’. Although they didn’t see what Ye Jian did to that woman, they had the same answer in their hearts. However, this answer made them avoid it subconsciously and not think too much about it.","There was still some distance between the dungeon and the mountain. Although the entire escape route had been planned, they had to pass through several wooden houses. Some of the wooden houses had their lights on while others were pitch-black. They didn’t know if there were people inside.","They still needed to avoid the sentry posts and patrol. If they were too slow, they might be discovered. If they were too fast, they might make a sound. The members of the Cloud Leopard team, who were hiding in the dark, heaved a sigh of relief. They said to the two female soldiers who were following closely behind them. Their breathing was so fast that they could be heard clearly. “Don’t be afraid. We’re here. Follow behind us and don’t make a sound, understand?","“There will be people waiting for you after you enter the mountain. Don’t be afraid. It’s all over.”","Ye Jian said to the two of them, “We’ll return overnight. Everything ended the moment we left the dungeon. There’s nothing to be afraid of anymore.”","Hearing Ye Jian’s calm and gentle voice, Zhou Yijin held Liu Le’s hand tightly and nodded heavily while panting heavily.","She had always thought that she was very bold. She wouldn’t even frown or blink when something huge happened in the past. Now, she knew that she was too frivolous in the past.","It wasn’t that she was bold, but she had never encountered anything that could make her frown or blink!","Now that she had encountered such a situation, her brows were still tightly furrowed. She couldn’t even blink. It wasn’t that she was bold. It was just that... she was so afraid that if she blinked, danger would come!","After this experience, she would never say that she was bold again. She was too far away from being bold and fearless!","Liu Le’s hands were shaking. Even though Zhou Yijin was holding her hand, she was still shaking. She was too scared. Her hands were cold, but her palms were full of cold sweat.","It was the same for her and Zhou Yijin.","“Let’s go!” Ye Jian’s calm voice came from behind. Liu Le quickly turned his head and looked at the female soldier behind him. At this moment, Liu Le finally understood how brave Ye Jian was. She purposely got kidnapped just to save them.","Her courage was something that she would never be able to reach in her entire life.","The five of them used the night as a cover and retreated into the mountains. Qin Maosheng’s village was heavily guarded. Besides the open sentries, there were also covert sentries. If the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade hadn’t been watching over the village for a few days and saw the covert sentries changing shifts, they wouldn’t have known that there were so many covert sentries.","From time to time, the scout hiding on a tree would provide his comrades with information about the situation around the retreat line, whether there were any patrols, which covert sentries they needed to avoid, and everything else... He would report to his comrades in a timely manner. With the help of the scout, the entire evacuation mission was relatively smoother.","At this moment, Qin Maosheng didn’t have the time to care about the three Chinese female soldiers. He was showing the high-purity goods to Cobra.","Cobra’s bodyguard had also returned. He nodded at Cobra as soon as he entered, indicating that he already knew where the drug samples placed on the table came from."]},{"number":3942,"title":"Chapter 3942: Preparing For War","paragraphs":["Chapter 3942: Preparing For War","Editor: Henyee Translations","No one realized that the three Chinese female soldiers had escaped from the dungeon. No one knew that one of their people had been killed by a Chinese female soldier.","Xia Jinyuan, who was standing outside, calculated the time in his heart. Based on the little fox’s actions, she must have already started the entire plan. She was the fuse for the two plans. As long as she started, the soldiers of the Xueyu Unit and the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade would immediately start moving. As for him...","Xia Jinyuan stopped in his tracks and glanced at the wooden house with the lights on. His plan was about to start.","At 9:10 pm, half an hour since their retreat, the five of them finally entered the pitch-black mountain.","The reconnaissance person of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade saw his comrades enter the mountain. He told all his comrades who were waiting, “They’ve successfully retreated to the mountain...”","The tense Chinese soldiers finally relaxed. They blinked and lowered their heads to wipe the sweat off their faces. At this moment, there was a faint smile in their eyes.","The most dangerous part of the mission was to rescue the female soldiers. The next step was to hurry and return to China quickly. This way, they would be able to complete the entire mission.","The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade entered the public channel. As they panted heavily, they wiped the sweat that was about to seep into their eyes and smiled as they told their comrades, “We’ve entered the mountain safely. We’ll wait for the rendezvous. Over.”","The team members looked at the female soldiers who almost fell to the ground after entering the mountain. Another female soldier was holding them, one on each side. As he spoke, he gave Ye Jian an ‘OK’ sign that meant that they were temporarily safe.","It was pitch-black. Ye Jian didn’t have any night-traveling equipment, so she didn’t see his hand signal. She only knew that after Zhou Yijin and Liu Le entered the mountain, all their energy seemed to have been sucked dry. She needed to hold them properly. If not, the two of them would fall together.","“Take a break before leaving.” Ye Jian held their hands tightly and comforted them. This was their first time experiencing a life-or-death race. It was normal for them to be nervous.","Moreover, they were already very good. They had to persevere all the way for a smooth evacuation.","Zhou Yijin was grabbing Ye Jian’s arm tightly. This was the only way she could find the strength to support herself. She was so nervous that her throat hurt. She didn’t speak and only nodded in reply to Ye Jian.","Rest, she needed to rest. Her legs were so weak that she couldn’t use any strength. If she was asked to leave, she wouldn’t be able to take a step.","The leader of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade put down the binoculars in his hand and replied to his comrades, “Roger that. We’ll meet up in ten minutes!”","V8’s voice came from the earpieces. “Brother, please pass the communication device to the female soldier who saved the two female soldiers. We need to talk to her alone.”","After receiving the news, a member of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade quickly took off his wireless communication equipment and handed it to Ye Jian. He said, “There’s another company carrying out a mission. They need to talk to you alone.","“The higher-ups arranged for us to send the two female soldiers up before coming back to help you complete it. The more people we have, the more power we have. That way, you’ll be able to leave more smoothly.”","Ye Jian, who received the communication equipment, was a little surprised when she heard that there was another company carrying out a mission.","Why were there two military units carrying out missions at the same place?","This didn’t make sense.","Also, they said that they wanted to talk to her alone. Why did they need to talk to her alone?"]},{"number":3943,"title":"Chapter 3943: Surprise","paragraphs":["Chapter 3943: Surprise","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian, who was full of questions, quickly put on the wireless communication equipment. Just as she put in the earpieces, she heard a hello from the other end.","Even though it was just a low hello, Ye Jian could tell that it was V8’s voice.","That meant that... the other company was the comrades of the Xueyu unit!","Were they here to help Captain Xia?","It must be!","If not, why would they be here?","Ye Jian’s eyes suddenly lit up. V8 said through the earpieces, “Cloud Leopard brothers, escort the two female soldiers away. Leave the rest to us. Just now, the higher-ups gave an order. The team will leave seven people behind as reinforcements. The rest will escort the female soldiers back to the country.”","Since the two female soldiers were saved, the Xueyu unit would be in charge of the assassination mission. Assassination. Hehe, the comrades from the Xueyu unit were good at it.","That fellow who dared to step on Ye Jian’s face would get his retribution tonight!","The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade received the order a step later than the Xueyu unit. The leader of the action team followed the order and left two scouts and five assaulters behind. The other members left immediately when the two female soldiers arrived.","Zhou Yijin didn’t have any time to bid farewell to Ye Jian. She only had time to hold Ye Jian’s hand tightly and whisper in a tense voice, “Sixth Cousin-in-law, I’ll wait for you and Sixth Cousin to come back!”","“Don’t worry, I’ll go back with your sixth cousin.” Ye Jian nodded lightly. There was a smile in her eyes as she continued, “See you in the capital city.”","Ye Jian would make sure she went back alive. She would return safely after completing her combat mission like in the past and reunite with her classmates, friends, family, and comrades.","“Yes!” After getting Ye Jian’s promise, Zhou Yijin wiped the tears from the corner of her eyes. She endured the pain of being beaten up tonight and gritted her teeth. Turning around, she held Liu Le’s hand along with two members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade. They entered the depths of the forest.","If she stayed, she wouldn’t be able to help Sixth Cousin-in-law at all. If she left, she would be able to let Sixth Cousin-in-law do her things in peace.","‘Sixth Cousin-in-law, I’ll wait for you and Sixth Cousin to come back safely to the capital city!’","After leaving, Liu Le turned around and looked at Ye Jian who wasn’t leaving with them. She was very worried. “Why isn’t Ye Jian leaving with us? If we leave without her, what if something happens to her? Those fellows will definitely not let her off.”","“We have other comrades around. Don’t worry. Hurry up and leave. Be careful of your steps!” The member of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade, who was in charge of clearing the path in front, brushed away the tree branches blocking the way and explained to Liu Le so that she could feel at ease.","Hearing that there were still people here, Liu Le felt more at ease.","Ye Jian was already on the phone with V8. With the wireless communication equipment, Ye Jian learned about the situation after she was kidnapped. With a serious expression, she moved behind a wooden house and whispered, “I understand. I’ll cooperate with Q King’s plan fully.”","V8 didn’t explain Xia Jinyuan’s plan in detail. He only told her that after they finished off Qin Maosheng, they would escort her away. At that time, the chaos created wouldn’t be targeted at Qin Maosheng. It would be targeted at the Western men around Xia Jinyuan. However, they had to let the Western men misunderstand that all the chaos was caused by Qin Maosheng kidnapping the Chinese female soldiers.","Their goal was to let their captain gain the trust of the Western man so that he could complete his mission and return to his country as soon as possible.","Ye Jian hoped that the man she loved would return to the country as soon as possible. Now that she was asked to cooperate with Xia Jinyuan to complete the mission, Ye Jian didn’t say anything more.","She was willing to do anything for him."]},{"number":3944,"title":"Chapter 3944: Determination","paragraphs":["Chapter 3944: Determination","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Azure Bird, the wooden house you’re going to now... Q King is there too. You might be able to meet him later.” V8 reminded Ye Jian through the earpieces. He said, “You were stepped on just now. He might have suffered internal bleeding. Don’t be too agitated when you meet him later.”","His girlfriend was right in front of him, but he could only watch as she was bullied. V8 was afraid that Ye Jian would have a grudge against him. As a good comrade, he couldn’t help but speak up for Xia Jinyuan. “I believe he was the one in the most misery when he watched you suffer.","“Azure Bird, can you...” ‘Can you forgive his resignation?’","V8 wanted to say that but he realized that he couldn’t. Forgive Q King’s resignation... Who would understand Azure Bird’s helplessness?","That was what he was thinking. However, he heard Ye Jian’s gentle voice. “We’re different from other people. We won’t fuss over such small matters.","“In the past, he beat me until I was hospitalized. If we settle the scores one by one, there’s really no way to calculate everything. We’re different. I’ve always known that. I know that he couldn’t save me earlier, and I didn’t want him to do it either. Fortunately, I endured everything. I’m very happy.”","Ye Jian replied with a smile as she hid in the dark. These were her true thoughts.","V8 laughed softly.","That was right. He almost forgot that Q King and Azure Bird were different. Their love was different. Their way of interacting was different. All the differences formed an understanding of each other.","They knew their responsibilities and knew each other’s responsibilities. They understood each other so well. How could they be unhappy because of this?","He was thinking too much.","V8 felt as though his eyes were misty. He cursed in a low voice. He was afraid of embarrassing himself, so he quickly used his sleeve to wipe his eyes secretly.","A man could bleed but not cry. Why would he cry?","“I was talking too much. Pretend I didn’t say anything,” V8 wiped his tears and replied to Ye Jian. When he spoke again, his tone was light-hearted. “Next, it’s time for us to get rid of these bastards. Azure Bird, we will fight together again after a year. I wish you victory.”","“I wish you success.” Ye Jian smiled and turned around, entering the darkness calmly.","How could she blame this on the man she loved?","She wasn’t that stupid.","There was a debtor for every grievance. Qin Maosheng had to be blamed for this.","This was the first time in her two lives that someone had stepped on her face. She had to get back at him!","The silence of the Myanmar village at night made people afraid to approach. Men with guns walked back and forth in their sentry posts, paying close attention to the surroundings. The covert sentries were watching the area they were in charge of with burning eyes. If there was anything amiss, they would immediately inform the sentries.","The two kinds of sentry posts, one in the light and one in the dark, cooperated with each other and helped Qin Maosheng to solve many potential dangers. It also made him feel that he was the safest here.","Under V8’s instructions, Ye Jian walked toward the wooden house built on the mountain. Qin Maosheng was in one of the wooden houses. If she couldn’t kill him secretly with her dagger, she would use the silenced pistol in her hand to kill him.","This time, she didn’t use a sniper rifle. The appearance of a long-range sniper rifle would make people think that there was a large team around. It wouldn’t be good for the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade who were escorting the two female soldiers."]},{"number":3945,"title":"Chapter 3945: Combat","paragraphs":["Chapter 3945: Combat","Editor: Henyee Translations","Also, the sound of a long-range sniper shot was too loud. It would alert everyone instantly. The sound of a close-range shot was very small. If Qin Maosheng was killed alone, his subordinates wouldn’t notice it so quickly. It would also give Ye Jian enough time to retreat.","However, there was also a problem with shooting at a close distance. If she was too close, the firepower would be concentrated on her if she was discovered. Hence, it was best to infiltrate and assassinate him with a dagger.","Ye Jian avoided the covert sentries and went under the roof of the wooden house. She went from the secret outpost to the bushes behind the wooden house.","She went around to the back of the covert sentries and silently climbed in through the window of the wooden house. About three minutes later, she left the wooden house quietly with a faint smell of blood on her body.","Someone was lying on the ground in the wooden house. Blood was flowing to the ground, leaving trails like a snake. Beside him was a damaged walkie-talkie.","After exiting the wooden house, Ye Jian panted heavily. There was a faint smell of blood in the air. She pulled her earpieces and reported the latest situation she found. “The inside of the wooden house is made of cement. It’s at least 15 cm thick and is definitely bulletproof. I suspect that the wooden houses in the entire village are like that. They look no different from ordinary wooden houses on the outside but inside, they’re made of cement walls.”","She recalled that the wooden house she was dragged into didn’t have any cement walls. That meant that even though Qin Maosheng kidnapped them, he was still on guard.","Ye Jian looked around. After confirming that she was safe for the time being, she said, “This village might not be an ordinary village. I suspect that there are no villagers in this village. They’re all Qin Maosheng’s people.”","As soon as she finished speaking, V8’s voice followed. “There’s no need to doubt it. This is the truth. The entire village grows poppy for a living, but from planting to harvesting, the people doing it are all subordinates of Qin Maosheng. This is also the village where he’s raising the retired soldiers of the Myanmar military unit. Azure Bird, most of the people here are retired soldiers from Myanmar.”","So that was how it was!","During the day, when she was dragged to the wooden house to get her photos taken, she thought that the Burmese man guarding the house was a retired soldier from Myanmar. She didn’t think too much about it, but it turned out to be true.","“Everyone, be careful. There might be more than one person in some wooden houses. I don’t dare to flip into the houses casually either.” Ye Jian exhaled lightly. She wasn’t even holding her pistol in her hand. She held her dagger horizontally as she stared ahead. Her footsteps were soft as she retreated toward the trees to hide.","She saw a few people with guns coming down from the mountain. Then, they turned a corner and walked toward another small path.","“Reconnaissance officer, is there anyone in front?” Ye Jian asked the scout from the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade who had been guiding her. With the help of a scout, she could speed up her infiltration.","“That’s all. The four people who went past just now went down the mountain path on your left. You’re still 500 meters away from your destination...”","The scout from the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade reminded Ye Jian through the earpieces and asked her to pay attention to her surroundings. At the same time, the special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit had already infiltrated the village. They took out their daggers and started their assassination.","They knew clearly how many covert sentries and open sentries there were in the village. At this moment, it was as though they were pulling out carrots one by one. The entire process was done in stealth.","“I’ll go and finish off the machine gunners. The two of you, go to Azure Bird’s side...” V8, who was squatting under a tree, said to his two comrades behind him, “If you meet any survivors, kill them. One kill means one less firepower.”","The two comrades from the Xueyu unit made an ‘OK’ gesture. They separated from V8 and quickly moved toward Ye Jian."]},{"number":3946,"title":"Chapter 3946: Glowing","paragraphs":["Chapter 3946: Glowing","Editor: Henyee Translations","G3 and the other three had already abandoned their vehicles and snuck into the village on foot. They were very close to the village now. The seven people escorting the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade had left, so they were filling in the gap.","Although the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade were keeping an eye on the village, they didn’t notice the other company. Throughout the entire process, they had been communicating via wireless communication. At this moment, they could only hear from their earpieces that the other company’s soldiers had already started their mission.","“Clear, advance...”","“Clear, advance...”","“I killed two of them and took two rifles. They’re useless. I threw them away.”","“F*ck, did you unload the magazine?”","“Do you think I’m stupid?”","“No, brother, you’re so high and mighty in my heart. You’re not stupid at all!”","The earpieces were filled with the indecent words of the soldiers. No one could tell that they were carrying out a mission. They were as relaxed as playing a game.","Someone from the Cloud Leopard team turned off his earpieces and said to his comrades beside him, “Which military district are they from? Is it so easy for them? I’m lying still and my back is sweating. Why are they so relaxed as if nothing is going on?”","“I don’t know. The higher-ups didn’t say anything. Our captain doesn’t know either. I feel relaxed listening to their conversation.”","“Lower your voices. The two brothers who are picking up the female soldiers are almost here... We need to evacuate.”","The relaxed voices from the earpieces still came from time to time. Those words that were filled with bloodlust sounded different when they came out from their mouths. They sounded relaxed, as if they were casually playing a game.","However, they were all on the battlefield, so they knew that the company had categorized the six open sentries and 12 covert sentries into numbers. They were clearing them one by one according to the numbers. The entire process was filled with danger. The line between life and death was very thin.","Yet they were able to face life and death with such a relaxed side. That kind of magnanimity and fearlessness was worth learning from. At the same time, the Cloud Leopard team had to think about how they could do it to such an extent.","The female soldier who put herself in danger was the same. As a female soldier, she was so calm. What about them?","They needed to learn and reflect deeply.","At this moment, the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade fell silent. Their eyes, which were filled with perseverance, became more serious.","After dealing with the two covert sentries closest to her target’s wooden house, Ye Jian didn’t know that she had become a role model. She rubbed her sweaty palm on her body and wiped the sweat off. With light footsteps, she approached the wooden house where Qin Maosheng was like a cat.","The wooden houses in the village were the most common wooden houses in Myanmar villages. From the outside, they looked very dilapidated. Ye Jian gently pushed aside the grass in front of her and carefully raised her head to look in the direction of the wooden house.","She saw someone smoking. The red sparks flickered and disappeared quickly. There was a faint smell of smoke in the air.","Ye Jian, who was pressing on the grass with one hand, slowly retracted her hand and bent over to the side of the wooden house.","At the front, the dilapidated wooden door of the wooden house was tightly guarded. Both sides were guarded by men wielding guns. There were a few black shadows walking back and forth from time to time. It was not conducive for Ye Jian to shoot at a close distance. She couldn’t sneak in and complete the assassination with a dagger either.","Ye Jian started to approach the wooden house. Luke, who had finished smoking, returned to Xia Jinyuan’s side. He was a little quiet tonight and had already finished two cigarettes."]},{"number":3947,"title":"Chapter 3947: Awkward","paragraphs":["Chapter 3947: Awkward","Editor: Henyee Translations","After standing for less than a minute, he said to Xia Jinyuan, “They’ve been inside for almost an hour. Why isn’t it over? Did Mr. Cobra change his mind? Does he plan to work with Qin Maosheng again?","“Oh god, I don’t think he’s a good partner. He’s too arrogant. There are many risks in cooperating with him. Based on Mr. Cobra’s experience, it’s impossible for him to form a cooperative relationship with such a fellow!”","“But even if you disagree, it doesn’t mean Mr. Cobra will agree with you,” Xia Jinyuan replied to the agitated Luke. He then reminded him, “And Luke, you’re a little different tonight. Don’t let Mr. Cobra notice anything off with you.”","...","Luke fell silent. Ye Jian, who was crawling in front, maintained her crawling posture and didn’t move for a long time.","She heard Captain Xia’s voice. Just like what V8 said, she would meet Captain Xia.","Ye Jian crawled forward slightly again. Soon, she hid in a blind spot where no one would notice her. In front of her, there were two trees blocking her way. Behind her were bushes. Farther down was the high ridge of the field.","If she was really discovered, she would have to jump down from the ridge and hide in the field used to grow poppies.","After hiding, Ye Jian made the sound of a night bird.","Ye Jian slowly blew out the secret signal that belonged to the night training of the Xueyu unit.","Xia Jinyuan paused for a moment and said to Luke calmly, “I’m going to pee. You guard this place.”","“Okay.” Luke didn’t suspect anything. Coincidentally, he needed to calm down too. He didn’t look at where Xia Jinyuan went to ‘urinate’ and went off on his own.","He didn’t notice where Xia Jinyuan went, but the bodyguard guarding the wooden house, who had been following Cobra, glanced at him. He didn’t suspect anything. Who would suspect anything at a time like this? Moreover, Xia Jinyuan was Cobra’s trusted subordinate now. The bodyguard wouldn’t suspect him easily.","Ye Jian looked at the slender figure walking toward her and couldn’t help but grip the grass tightly. She used too much strength, and her fingers dug into the soft soil.","On Xia Jinyuan’s side, he thought that it was a comrade in the team. He didn’t expect it to be Ye Jian. Hence, he approached and loosened his belt naturally... Just as he was about to take out his member, Ye Jian’s voice came from under the tree.","“Do you really plan to do that?”","There was a huge question mark on his usually calm and composed face.","What?","It was not V8 and the rest?","Instead, it was the lover who he missed so much that his heart ached?","There was no pressure just now, and he did everything very naturally. In front of his lover, he loosened his belt a little and even pulled down the zipper of his pants...","No matter how thick Comrade Xia’s skin was, at this moment... he couldn’t help but feel awkward. His face started to turn red.","It wasn’t the male soldiers in the military unit. It was his woman...","Xia Jinyuan didn’t think that he was thick-skinned enough to release his member in front of his woman. However, he was already halfway through his actions. Moreover, he said that he was going to pee. The entire process needed to be done properly.","Hence, Lieutenant Colonel Xia, whose face was a little hot, pretended to be calm and moved to the side. He still completed the entire process.","Ye Jian was speechless. She saw that his actions had obviously frozen. She thought that he would stop this... awkward process. Who knew that he still needed to complete it?"]},{"number":3948,"title":"Chapter 3948: Awkward Together","paragraphs":["Chapter 3948: Awkward Together","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian was speechless. She saw that his actions had obviously frozen. She thought that he would stop this... awkward process. Who knew that he still needed to complete it?","What sort of encounter was this? He was the only one who could make this possible!","Before the sound of running water could be heard, Ye Jian buried her face in the grass that was emitting the rotten smell of dead leaves. At the same time, she stretched out her fingers and slowly... covered her ears.","It was useless to cover her ears, though. They were so close to each other so she could still hear everything. It was just that... it sounded a little softer.","After settling everything silently, Xia Jinyuan tidied his pants silently and walked to Ye Jian.","She was lying down while he was standing. At first, he had many things to say. However, because of his matter, the atmosphere became awkward. He didn’t know what to say!","Ye Jian didn’t know what to say either!","Her face was burning!","It was extremely awkward, and it felt like the moment lasted forever...","They were happy to see each other, but they were too embarrassed to approach. It was awkward.","How could they remain silent like this? In the end, the one who broke the silence was the thick-skinned Lieutenant Colonel Xia.","He lowered his head and looked at the figure that had merged with the ground. He said softly, “They haven’t come out. You need to wait a little longer.”","“Also, stand up. This is a blind spot. They... can’t see you.”","He could only hug her properly if she stood up.","Ye Jian knew that this was a blind spot. When she heard his voice, she chose a blind spot to hide so that she could... take a good look at him.","Xia Jinyuan, who was waiting for her to get up, looked around, especially in the direction of the wooden house. Even though both of them were in a blind spot, he needed to be careful not to be discovered.","They didn’t have much time to meet. At most... five minutes. That was all.","He still had comrades who were risking their lives. He couldn’t disregard his comrades’ lives because of his personal matters. Five minutes. He and the little fox only had five minutes.","From now on, it was a five-minute countdown.","One minute was 60 seconds. Three minutes meant 180 seconds. He was already counting down in his heart.","179 seconds, 178 seconds, 177 seconds... One second passed, and Ye Jian slowly stood up. Her gaze wasn’t entirely on Xia Jinyuan. She stood up while being vigilant.","Before she could stand up completely, her arm was grabbed by a pair of strong hands. Before she could react, she fell into the arms of the man counting down in his heart.","The familiar refreshing smell enveloped her instantly. His smell surrounded the tip of her nose. His body temperature was also transmitted over in an instant, allowing her to feel his warmth.","It was the same warmth that made her feel at ease in the past. It made her yearn for it too.","Ye Jian’s vigilant gaze was blocked by Xia Jinyuan’s broad chest. It was the first time Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan were hugging after a long time, but they didn’t share romantic words. Instead, she reminded him in a low voice, “Watch your surroundings carefully. Don’t let anyone see you.”","“I know. Don’t worry, I’m here with you,” the man who was hugging her replied to her very softly. As he spoke, he placed his hand on her face. “I’ll tell them later that Commander Minlai will arrive in about an hour. Your mission needs to be carried out before he arrives.","“My mission is easy. Your situation is more troublesome. Let’s just kill him with a shot. We have to decide according to the current situation.”"]},{"number":3949,"title":"Chapter 3949: Did You Wash Your Hands","paragraphs":["Chapter 3949: Did You Wash Your Hands","Editor: Henyee Translations","If he could, Xia Jinyuan really wanted to torture Qin Maosheng personally. He would use the same method to retaliate. He would point a gun at his head and tell him that the consequences of insulting Chinese soldiers would be tragic!","However, time was a little tight. Everything had to be completed before Commander Minlai arrived. Hence, they could only choose to end it with one shot.","Xia Jinyuan hugged the person he loved the most tightly and quickly told her what he knew. “There’s a warehouse in the village that stores drugs. I’ve confirmed it. It took them 12 minutes to get the drugs. It’s not difficult to find them using the location where you were hit as the center. If you find it, burn all of it. They shouldn’t be put out onto the market.”","He spoke quickly in a low voice. His rough and warm fingers kept touching Ye Jian’s face gently. He was very gentle. One could feel the love from his touch.","Xia Jinyuan closed his eyes gently. As her boyfriend, he was very unqualified. He couldn’t even ask her if she was alright.","At that time, her face was stepped on by Qin Maosheng... It must be very painful. When he thought of that scene, Xia Jinyuan’s fingers started trembling uncontrollably.","Ye Jian, who was hugging him, could feel his back straightening. It was as if something was pressing down on him. His back, which was originally straight like a pine tree, bent slightly.","He was such an arrogant man, a man blessed by the heavens. Because of her... even his own back was bent.","Ye Jian felt a dull pain in her heart. She closed her eyes and looked up at the man who was touching her face with trembling fingers. She pretended to ask a very serious question. “Captain Xia, do you usually use your left hand or your right hand?”","Did he usually use his left hand or right hand?","Xia Jinyuan wasn’t the only one who was stunned by Ye Jian’s question. V8, who knew that the two of them had bumped into each other, was also stunned.","Left hand? Right hand? What did that mean?","V8 lowered his head and looked at his right hand and left hand. Forgive him for not being smart enough to guess what Ye Jian meant.","Xia Jinyuan, who was also stunned by the question, understood something. No matter how big the sorrow in his heart was, he felt some relief at this moment.","“Right hand,” he answered her. His eyes were filled with love and sorrow.","His little fox was trying to make him laugh.","“And you’re touching my face with your right hand now. Captain Xia, you didn’t wash your hands just now, right?” Ye Jian said seriously again.","V8 was speechless. F*ck, he was slow-witted. He finally knew why Azure Bird asked about Captain Xia’s right hand and left hand.","As it turned out, that was what she meant.","That meant that when their captain was relieving himself, Azure Bird had been beside him... watching the entire process?","In an instant, V8 was unable to remain calm.","He knew that Azure Bird and the captain would meet, but he didn’t expect them to meet in such an ‘unconventional’ way.","It was a rare occurrence!","At this moment, no matter how calm Xia Jinyuan was, the corners of his mouth twitched when he heard his girlfriend’s words.","That was right, he didn’t wash his hands just now.","This was the first time he touched his girlfriend’s face without washing his hands after going to the toilet. And his girlfriend caught him red-handed.","“Captain Xia, remember to wash your hands next time. Fortunately, I don’t mind,” Ye Jian continued speaking seriously. After she finished speaking, she sighed faintly. “We’re already an old couple. I can accept your small problems.”"]},{"number":3950,"title":"Chapter 3950: Beast","paragraphs":["Chapter 3950: Beast","Editor: Henyee Translations","An old couple... They must’ve had sex!","V8 quickly thought of this equation and cursed ‘beast’ in his heart!","How old was Azure Bird? How could the captain do this? Also, when did they do it? Why didn’t he know anything?","He knew that the relationship between the two of them was a little ambiguous. They never announced it, and he was too embarrassed to ask. However, he didn’t know that... they were already an old couple!","What a beast!","The beast captain expressed that he was innocent. It was true that they were an old couple, but they had never had sex! This was what Xia Jinyuan told V8 when he came back and ‘questioned’ him.","Xia Jinyuan’s entire weight was on Ye Jian. He had to admit that he was really amused by her.","Then, the more he thought about it, the more his heart ached. She was the one who was humiliated. She was the one who was suffering, but in the end, she was the one who made him happy.","After a short moment of happiness, Xia Jinyuan felt that it was harder to breathe.","He was so lucky to meet her in this lifetime.","His right hand that was touching her face trembled even more. Xia Jinyuan felt that his heart was blocked and his limbs were in pain. He lowered his head and kissed her forehead with heartache.","Ye Jian felt his trembling and pursed her lips. She finally managed to make him smile but now... he felt uncomfortable again.","She raised her hand and placed it on the back of his hand. She said casually, “It’s just a scratch. It doesn’t hurt. I’m fine. I’m really fine. Don’t worry.”","Why wouldn’t it hurt? She was just comforting him.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had never cried before, felt tears searing his eyes in front of his girlfriend. Uncontrollably, tears rushed out of his eyes.","Ye Jian raised her head, and he lowered his head to look at her. Suddenly, several drops of tears flowed out and landed on Ye Jian’s face.","Warm tears were still dripping down. Ye Jian was stunned as if she had been electrocuted.","Her hand trembled as she placed it on the back of his hand. She slowly touched the tip of his nose where tears were dripping down. She touched it with her fingers. It was wet and sticky.","These were tears...","Captain Xia was like a god in her heart. He didn’t even frown when he faced huge difficulties. She never thought that he would be stumped. He never lowered his head either... But he was actually crying now.","Her slightly wet fingers felt as though they were being burned by lightning. Ye Jian’s hands started trembling even more.","Captain Xia, who was her lifelong goal, was crying because of her.","Xia Jinyuan knew that he was crying, but he didn’t feel that it was embarrassing. Men didn’t cry easily. It was just that he had never been this sad.","Tonight, she suffered so much humiliation and yet he was helpless. He wanted to cry... so he cried","“Don’t cry. It really doesn’t hurt. It doesn’t hurt at all. Look, I’m still standing in front of you. I’m really fine.”","His tears made Ye Jian’s heart ache. It was only when the king-like man who always seemed to be standing up in the clouds cried that she realized how uncomfortable it was for her. It was much worse than being stepped on by Qin Maosheng.","Look, this was the woman he loved deeply. How could he not love her even more? It was because his tears distressed her so much that she was comforting him instead.","“How can it not hurt? I can see that it’s bleeding.” Xia Jinyuan lowered his head and kissed her forehead tenderly.","His thin lips curled up slightly. His hoarse voice blew over like the wind. “Ye Jian, in my heart, you’re a qualified soldier now. You have already become a qualified soldier.”","She performed so well tonight. In his heart, she was the best and most qualified soldier!"]},{"number":3951,"title":"Chapter 3951: Lips And Teeth Together","paragraphs":["Chapter 3951: Lips And Teeth Together","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian slowly smiled and rubbed her face against his palm. “It’s not enough. I have to do better. If our roles were changed tonight, I wouldn’t be able to be as calm as you.”","Calm?","‘No, little fox, I didn’t manage to remain calm.’","Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but smile bitterly. “You told me that I needed to calm down. How could I disappoint you? You did very well. Very, very well. I haven’t seen you for a year and you’ve grown too much. I missed many of your exciting moments.”","He held her hand and placed it on his chest. “I’m a little disappointed, a little happy, and a little proud. You’ve also let me know how much blood and tears you sacrificed to be able to come to my side. It’s been hard on you, my love.”","Ye Jian felt his heart beating vigorously under her palm. It seemed to have merged with the beating heart in her chest. Ye Jian was happy because of his affirmation. She raised her head and said softly, “I need to grow faster. Only by growing faster can I catch up with you. You can’t stop at the same spot and wait for me. I can only work hard to catch up with you.","“I’m not afraid of hardships. I’m just afraid that I’ll be a little too far away from you. I’ll work harder and walk every path you walked on before until I can walk beside you one day.”","Her eyes were shining brightly because of what he said. She was so happy, like a child who had gotten candy. It was so pure that he felt suffocated.","He had always known that she treated him as her goal. She respected him even more than anyone else.","To be honest, there was no man who didn’t like to be admired by the woman he loved deeply. A man’s natural vanity was the greatest satisfaction. He was the same. He felt extremely satisfied because of her admiration.","But now, he felt fortunate.","Fortunately, he made the right choice when he was young and became the man she wanted.","If not, his woman would not admire him this much.","Xia Jinyuan’s heart was soft and sweet. He hugged his lover tightly and said in a low voice, “Look up, little fox.”","Ye Jian raised her head. The next second, a black shadow pressed down on her. His lips were already on hers. It was a very heavy kiss, and there was a hint of urgency in it. He couldn’t wait to kiss her.","At this moment, Ye Jian tiptoed and raised her head. She was about to hang onto him and let him kiss her fiercely.","He kissed her too quickly and fiercely. He bit her lips, and a faint smell of blood entered their mouths. Even though they could taste the metallic blood, they didn’t stop kissing.","The tip of his tongue entered her mouth domineeringly and forcefully. He inspected every inch of her like a king. Before she could take a breath, he started sucking again. He was like a storm, making it difficult for her to breathe.","Xia Jinyuan couldn’t control himself. When his lips touched her soft and warm lips, he was defeated. All his psychological defenses were defeated because of her sweetness. He abandoned his armor and submitted to her.","Now, he was sucking her fiercely. Deep in his heart, he really wanted to integrate her into his blood and bones so that she could become one with him. This way, no matter where they went, no matter where they were, they could be together forever.","“Hug me tightly, Ye Jian... Hug me tightly, hug me tightly...” As he sucked and kissed, a muffled but forbearing voice came softly from between his lips. No matter how excited he was, he didn’t forget where they were."]},{"number":3952,"title":"Chapter 3952: Pretending To Be Calm","paragraphs":["Chapter 3952: Pretending To Be Calm","Editor: Henyee Translations","Even the most normal kiss between lovers could only be maintained for a longer period of time under careful care.","This time, there was no gentle prelude. After being apart for so long, he could hug her and kiss her. But he wasn’t satisfied. However, he could only do these things.","He felt like a traveler who had been walking in the desert for a long time. He suddenly received rainwater that could prolong his life. He couldn’t stop this kiss that allowed him to persevere. His sexy Adam’s apple moved as he greedily absorbed the sweetness between her lips. A deep and faint voice sounded.","V8 listened to the kissing sounds. His resolute face was calm.","Yes, he was pretending to be calm!","He was a bachelor and had never had a girlfriend. But sometimes, he would watch one or two episodes of dramas where men and women made love to each other. Now, when he heard the sound of kissing which he had heard on television before, he knew what they were doing.","As expected, the two people who hadn’t seen in a year were like dry firewood and a raging fire. The dry firewood touched the raging fire... and started burning! And the fire was a little fierce.","Fortunately, it wasn’t a public channel now. Fortunately, he was the only one who heard them. Fortunately, he was the only one who bore all the ‘torture’!","However, they shouldn’t kiss for too long. This was not a place where they could kiss for a long time.","Forget it, he would give the two of them some time alone.","Things had been tough for this couple. They had it a lot tougher than T6 and his girlfriend. At least T6 didn’t have to worry about his girlfriend going on life-and-death missions. As for this couple, the man was worried about the woman and the woman was worried about the man. They couldn’t feel at ease.","Previously, he was envious that the two of them were like-minded. Now, he wasn’t envious anymore.","What kind of relationship was this?","They had to count the time when hugging each other. It couldn’t be for too long. They only had a few minutes.","Thinking about it, he felt suffocated.","V8 used the back of his hand to wipe the corner of his eyes. His actions froze. Was the water he wiped just now his tears?","Why was he crying?","Was he crying along with them?","V8 felt a little embarrassed and contacted his two comrades who were supporting Ye Jian. “E6, the two of you should keep an eye on Azure Bird for a few minutes.”","They were in charge of keeping watch so that the couple could have a good chat.","As a comrade, all he could do was to stand guard for the two of them.","E6 was a Northwestern man who had fought alongside Ye Jian before. He and another comrade with the codename M didn’t know that their captain and the female soldier, Azure Bird, were a couple.","Hearing this, they replied with an ‘OK’. The two of them hid in the dark and could see the movements around the wooden house. They were in charge of guarding it.","V8 pulled out his earpieces and temporarily blocked the kissing sounds that made him feel things in his heart.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t know that Ye Jian had been maintaining communication with V8. He tried to control himself, but he still lost his composure. He finally ended the violent kiss that lasted for less than a minute.","This kiss had exceeded his expectations for tonight. He didn’t expect that not only could he hug her, but he could also kiss her deeply.","He tilted his head and buried his head in her neck. Then, he kissed her earlobe affectionately. The light kiss was filled with love. Ye Jian hugged him tighter.","He wanted to integrate her into his flesh and blood. She... had the same thought too.","“Captain Xia... Captain Xia...” Ye Jian opened her mouth. Her tears were already rippling. She hugged the body that gave her peace of mind. It was as if large patches of flowers were blooming in her heart. It was beautiful and gorgeous like spring."]},{"number":3953,"title":"Chapter 3953: Let Me Hug You Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 3953: Let Me Hug You Again","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan held the back of Ye Jian’s head tightly with his big hand. He was tall, and his back was arched. He pulled Ye Jian into his arms, and they seemed to have become one. As he listened to her nasal murmurs, his heart turned into a pool of water. He couldn’t help but kiss her neck again.","He answered her, “I’m here, I’m here... I’m beside you now.”","He didn’t leave immediately. He was hugging her now. He was hugging her tightly and telling her... how much he missed you. He really felt the pain in his bones.","Ye Jian sniffed softly and rubbed against his chest like a puppy. She wiped her tears on his chest. “You’re wearing a dark military uniform. No one will notice if I wipe my tears on it.”","“Even if you leave a few scratch marks on my body, no one will notice it. Do you want to try?” He grabbed her hand. He really wanted her to leave some memories on his body.","Ye Jian couldn’t bear to part with him. She shook her head and rejected him. “No, I don’t want you to get hurt.”","Her words caused Xia Jinyuan to pause slightly. After a while, he said, “Silly girl, how can I avoid getting injured? Someone like me can survive even if I’m injured.”","“I don’t want you to get hurt in my hands.” She raised her head from his chest and stared at him with deep emotions in her dark eyes. The night was really dark. It was so dark that she couldn’t see his face clearly. She could only see the outline of his face clearly. Even so, she was very happy.","Xia Jinyuan felt a little guilty, so he didn’t let her look up for too long. He placed his hand on the back of her head and pressed her back into his arms domineeringly. “Let me hug you again...”","They would have to separate very soon.","Before he finished speaking, Ye Jian already understood. She buried her head in his arms again and hugged his waist tightly. She didn’t forget to remind him, “Look around. Be careful.”","They were reunited amidst so many dangers. How could they be completely immersed in this moment? Their vigilance had already become a habit.","“Don’t worry, I know.” Xia Jinyuan looked around and even paid close attention to the movements in the wooden house. He hugged his lover tightly and buried his head in her neck, breathing heavily.","Her unique aura easily drove away the pressure that had been accumulating in his heart for the past year. It filled him with endless combat power again.","Lurking beside Cobra was his most exhausting mission so far. Every time he got tired, his mind would be filled with her smile. He remembered that she was still waiting for him. He remembered the promise he made. No matter how tired he was, he would grit his teeth and persevere until the mission was completed.","Tonight was the most crucial time in his year of hiding. Whether he could gain Cobra’s trust enough to enter his study depended on this.","If he still couldn’t gain such deep trust this time, he wouldn’t delay any longer. He would find an opportunity to kill Cobra and return to his country.","There were no more crazy kisses. The two of them hugged each other quietly and enjoyed the short silence of their reunion. The entire process took, at most, three minutes.","30 seconds, 29 seconds, 28 seconds. It was getting closer and closer to three minutes. It was already the countdown.","“I...”","“I...”","He lowered his head and she raised her head. The two of them opened their mouths at the same time and pursed their lips at the same time. They both knew what the other party wanted to say, so they released each other at the same time.","They didn’t say anything else. They just looked at each other silently."]},{"number":3954,"title":"Chapter 3954: Who Dares To Trample","paragraphs":["Chapter 3954: Who Dares To Trample","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan raised his hand again and touched Ye Jian’s face gently. His tall body bent down, and his slightly warm thin lips landed on Ye Jian’s face. Who would dare to step on what he cherished?!","“Wait for me.”","He left her with these two words. Then, he turned around and walked toward the wooden house. He didn’t look back at all. He walked out of Ye Jian’s sight firmly.","Ye Jian watched him leave with a soldier’s salute.","Just now, the person who hugged her was just an ordinary man who loved her deeply. Now, the person who was walking away was a soldier who had a huge responsibility on his shoulders. When he turned around, there was a clear distinction between a lover and a soldier.","V8’s soft voice came from the earpiece. “Is it over? All the sentries and covert sentries have been taken care of.”","Ye Jian’s facial expression froze. She seemed to have forgotten to communicate with V8. What had V8 heard?","He must have heard something. That was why he asked if it was over.","Ye Jian’s face was burning. She hid behind a tree and adjusted her breathing before replying, “My target hasn’t appeared yet. I think we’ll have to wait for a while. Q King just told me that General Minlai from Myanmar will arrive in about an hour. Our mission must start before he arrives. We can’t let him see us directly.”","“There’s a warehouse in the village that stores drugs. I’m not sure where it is. If you can find it, burn it. We shouldn’t let the drugs out into the market as that’ll only hurt people.”","“Roger that. Take care of Qin Maosheng properly. Two comrades are rushing over to receive you.” V8, who could feel Ye Jian’s awkwardness through the wireless communication, chuckled. “When you see the target appear, inform us to cut off the power. You can take advantage of the chaos and take care of him. G3 and the rest are in position. The two comrades who are supporting you are near the wooden house. It’s up to you now.”","G3 and the rest finally arrived ten minutes ago. Without resting, they immediately completed their combat deployment according to the topographic map provided by V8 and the scouts from the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade.","At this moment, Zhou Yijin and Liu Le, two female soldiers, were escorted back to China by seven male soldiers from the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade.","They were safe.","“Roger that.” After answering, Ye Jian started to change her hiding spot. If she wanted to assassinate her target, she would have to get closer. She glanced at the roof of the wooden house. That would be her hiding spot.","Before ending the call, V8 smiled and said, “Azure Bird, I’m a gentleman.” Hence, he knew not to see or listen to things he shouldn’t.","...","Ye Jian’s face was a little hot. She maintained her composure and pretended that she didn’t understand. She replied, “I understand.” Then, she quickly ended the conversation.","V8, who was hiding in the dark, smiled and told his comrades that General Minlai had arrived in about an hour. As soon as he finished speaking, his footsteps were as light as a beast that could sneak attack its prey from behind. He sneaked toward the entire village’s power station with his comrades.","Qin Maosheng was very vigilant. He even arranged for people to guard the company’s power station. If there was a power outage, they could repair it immediately.","“You take the left, I’ll take the right. We’ll twist their necks.” Under the dim lights of the power station, V8, whose eyes were shifting, made a hand gesture to his comrades. Then, he went to the back of the power station to kill his way in from the right.","The two of them, one on the left and one on the right, covered the mouths of the two Myanmar men guarding the power station. They locked their elbows and twisted forcefully. The sound of bones breaking could be heard. The two Myanmar men holding guns were killed cleanly without any blood.","At this moment, the soldiers couldn’t care about whether their targets were innocent or not."]},{"number":3955,"title":"Chapter 3955: Cruelty On The Battlefield","paragraphs":["Chapter 3955: Cruelty On The Battlefield","Editor: Henyee Translations","The battlefield was cruel. They might survive, but they also might be wiped out.","Their lives would never be left to their enemies. Hence, whether these people were innocent or not was not a consideration. The most important thing was to ensure that the entire mission could be carried out smoothly.","Also, how innocent could a person with a gun be?","The firepower in the village was strong enough. T6 touched the mortars beside his feet and smiled. “There are still mortars. I’ll keep them. They might be useful.”","Almost everyone in this village with more than 200 people had guns. As for them, they had more than 20 people. They should have some heavy firepower against a village with more than 200 people.","Z7 took down a fellow who was preparing to go over to his sentry post. He said in a low voice, “Stay and prepare for the second wave of clearing. I’ll catch up with them.”","“Damn it, it was brought forward? The previous shifts were always at 12:00 am.” The scout from the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade said in a tense voice, “It’s 10:00 pm now. Why was it brought forward?”","“There’ll be the occasional exception. It’s alright even if the timing was brought forward. The sentries now are all our men.” X, who was in charge of covert sentry no. 4, smiled as he spoke. However, his gaze was cold as he looked around. It flickered with a sword-like chill.","“The three machine gunners are also in position. How’s the situation on the female soldier’s side?” The female soldier G3 was referring to was Ye Jian. They were all on the public channel. They were careful and didn’t say Ye Jian’s codename in front of the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade.","As for themselves, they all went by letters and numbers. They sounded like rough codenames.","That was right, their codenames were so crude.","“I’ll wait for her target to appear before cutting off the power and taking action. Unfortunately, we have to kill that bastard with one shot. We can’t even torture him properly.” V8, who was holed up in the power station, held his gun and said with a regretful expression. His gaze was as fierce and cold as a wild beast as he looked in front of him. “Hurry up and find the drug warehouse. Use the mortars in T6’s hand to finish it off. It’ll be cleaner.”","“We’ve probably found it...” His comrade, X, rubbed his hands that were frozen by the cold air and stared at the heavy steel door that was opened by a combination lock. He replied in a low voice, “Underground cold storage, mixed steel door. It’s about ten centimeters thick. It has bulletproof functions, a combination lock, and mortars.”","X’s hands touched the cold hybrid steel door. He used his fingers to wipe his nose that was about to freeze from the cold. His gaze landed on the password lock again.","“There’s an alarm device on the lock. If the alarm goes off, the entire village will know. I think we should settle it with mortars. This place is a little cold. I’m afraid of the cold. I’ll leave first.”","“F*ck, is your period here? Why are you afraid of the cold?” Y, who was in charge of guarding, refuted him. “Come out quickly. There’s movement outside.”","Hearing this, X hunched his back and retreated from the tunnel that was about 20 meters away. Then, he crawled out from the entrance to the tunnel and saw Y approaching the door of the room. Footsteps came from outside the door. They were getting closer and closer...","They jumped and hid. At the same time, they guarded the door. When the door was pushed open, three people entered.","The soldiers closed the door and pressed the newcomers down. They killed them with one move. They worked together to kill the three people.","Someone had to guard this place. If other people came over and saw that their companions were all gone, everyone would be exposed!","The drugs were found too. The Xueyu unit was in charge of clearing them. Now, they were just waiting for Ye Jian.","Ye Jian, who was hiding near the wooden house, saw the Western man who seemed to have a good relationship with her man walking over and standing beside him."]},{"number":3956,"title":"Chapter 3956: Too Long And Too Far","paragraphs":["Chapter 3956: Too Long And Too Far","Editor: Henyee Translations","After smoking another cigarette, Luke stood in the dark and sized up Xia Jinyuan with his grayish-green eyes.","After smoking a few cigarettes, Luke finally calmed down. He sorted out how he should face the beating of the Chinese female soldiers. Halfway through, he suddenly remembered that when he lost his composure, Cobra suddenly turned his head and looked over. It was Xia who turned his body and blocked Cobra’s vision.","Did Xia discover something and help him on purpose, or did he coincidentally block him?","Luke wasn’t sure.","Xia Jinyuan looked at Luke, who was sizing him up, and said calmly, “What do you want to tell me? I’m sorry, I just want to have a good sleep after I go back. I don’t want to go out with you to drink and find women to party with.”","It should be a coincidence. Luke hadn’t made anyone suspicious even after staying by Cobra’s side for five years. What could Xia suspect?","“Don’t worry, you boring man. I’ve already given up the thought of going out with you to drink and find a woman. You know how disappointing it is to accompany someone who doesn’t do anything at the bar? I’ve done the same thing several times. I don’t think I’m stupid enough to do it again.”","Luke shrugged. He put aside his vigilance and thought that it was just a coincidence.","If Xia Jinyuan really suspected something, based on his loyalty to Cobra, he would have told Cobra. However, he didn’t. Hence, it must be a coincidence. He was thinking too much.","Luke didn’t think too much about it. He looked at the wooden house that hadn’t moved at all. He raised his golden gray eyebrows and said worriedly, “I’m 100% sure that Mr. Cobra will cooperate with that frivolous fellow. I feel that many disasters will happen in the future.”","No, that frivolous fellow would pay the price for what he did tonight.","Xia Jinyuan said calmly, “Mr. Cobra won’t cooperate with him. I can bet a thousand dollars on this.”","“No problem. If you lose, you’ll give me a thousand bucks!” Luke raised his eyebrows and insisted on his guess.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at him and insisted on his judgment. “If you lose, you will give me two grand.”","His calm reply made Luke shrink back. A miser who saved money for fun suddenly became so generous as to take out two grand as a bet. Luke felt that he might lose.","Hence, he asked, “Are you sure that you will win?”","“What do you think?” Xia Jinyuan, who was a miser in the other party’s eyes, retracted the faint smile on his face and reminded Luke, “It’s over.”","“It’s over? Oh, God, it’s finally over! What do you think they talked about? Why did they talk for so long?” Luke put his hands behind his back and raised his chin slightly, waiting for Cobra to walk out of the wooden house.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at Luke again. This fellow was testing him just now. The more he probed, the more sure he was of his guess.","The special forces soldier from Russia’s Signal Flag Not bad. After more than a year of cooperation, he admired the strength of the other party. However, what was his motive for hiding beside Cobra for five years?","Was it the same as him? Was it to find the real power behind Cobra?","If that was the case, what about himself?","Could it be that he needed five years too?","No, five years was too long.","He gave himself at most two years of undercover work. Now, one year had passed. There was still one more year for him to complete his mission.","That was because he still had to attend his little fox’s graduation ceremony. He wanted to hand over the real military uniform that belonged to a soldier to her personally. This was their agreement."]},{"number":3957,"title":"Chapter 3957: One Shot One Kill","paragraphs":["Chapter 3957: One Shot One Kill","Editor: Henyee Translations","Cobra walked out with a smile. He was in a good mood. After chatting for almost 90 minutes, he understood the entire drug chain in Myanmar. He also saw the high-purity drugs that surprised him.","Now, he was hoping that the Chinese would take action immediately after he left. Qin Maosheng would be done for. Then, he could use General Minlai to buy the production chain that could refine high-purity drugs to achieve his greatest benefit.","Qin Maosheng received the one million USD deposit on the spot. He was in a good mood and sent a car to send Cobra out overnight.","“I’m happy that I found a good partner. Mr. Cobra, I promise that all the goods I have for you are the best. No, no, I should say that they’re the best in Myanmar.”","As he spoke, Qin Maosheng reached out his hand. “I hope we can cooperate more happily.”","The translator finished translating quickly. Cobra, who understood what he meant, held his hand and looked expectant. “Of course, our cooperation will be pleasant. It’s a pity that I don’t have much time. If not, I’d want to travel around Myanmar for a few days.”","“We still have many chances. Even if we miss it this time, we’ll definitely be able to do it next time.” After Qin Maosheng finished speaking, he instructed his subordinates to prepare the car. He needed to leave this place and wait for the good news from China.","The conversation between the two of them entered Ye Jian’s ears clearly. She was already prepared to fire the loaded bullet. She was just waiting for the other party to stand in front of her. She would kill him with one shot.","Captain Xia said that killing the other party with one shot was easy. That was right, it was too easy for her. However, there were some spots that she could aim to help vent her anger.","For instance...","Ye Jian’s gaze landed on Qin Maosheng’s throat. For instance, this spot...","As he walked down the stairs of the wooden house, Qin Maosheng suddenly felt a chill on his neck. He even said, “It seems a little cold...”","As soon as he finished speaking, a muffled sound suddenly sounded. Then, all the lights in the entire village went out at the same time. From the shooting to the darkness of the entire village, everything was completed in 0.03 seconds.","Before all the lights went off, Cobra, who was closest to Qin Maosheng, saw a bloody hole in his throat. Before he could see the man’s expression clearly, his vision turned black. Then, Cobra was thrown to the ground by his bodyguards.","The muffled sound woke everyone up. They were all too familiar with this sound, especially the bodyguards beside Cobra. Before Qin Maosheng fell, they already realized what had happened.","Carrying pistols, they immediately fired in one direction.","Gunshots were fired instantly. They weren’t concentrated in one spot. Everyone was shooting. Ye Jian, who was rolling continuously, heard someone shouting, “Protect Mr. Cobra!”","They immediately covered their backs to Cobra and used their bodies as shields to ensure the man’s safety.","Ye Jian was no longer at their firing point. After firing a shot accurately, she rolled continuously and left the wooden house according to the route she had set before.","She heard someone shouting ‘protect Mr. Cobra’. This was Captain Xia’s target. Nothing would happen for the time being. Something must have happened to Qin Maosheng.","Although Qin Maosheng’s subordinates reacted quickly and there were even three retired special forces bodyguards invited from overseas among them, it was too late.","Qin Maosheng, who got shot in the throat, felt that his throat was very cold. He swallowed something very hot along his esophagus. He even raised his hand to cover his neck. It was not until blood gushed out of his throat and intense pain hit him that he realized that he had been shot."]},{"number":3958,"title":"Chapter 3958: Life-And-Death Chase","paragraphs":["Chapter 3958: Life-And-Death Chase","Editor: Henyee Translations","However, the bullet didn’t pierce through the back of his neck. After it entered his esophagus, he swallowed it.","Bullets were magical. They were 100% accurate. Those who were hit would die, but there would always be exceptions.","Just like Major General Yang. Once, he was shot in the heart. The bullet stopped at a narrow gap between his heart and the protective film. Everyone thought that Major General Yang didn’t have any hope of survival. In the end, the surgery was successful. The bullet was taken out from the pericardium and he survived until he became a major general.","It was the same with Qin Maosheng now. Ye Jian’s accurate shooting allowed him to avoid the scythe of the Grim Reaper. Although he was shot in the throat and had difficulty breathing, if he was treated in time, the possibility of survival was high.","A foreign bodyguard beside him reacted quickly. For people like him who had walked on the battlefield, besides carrying guns at any time, he would also have bandages and other first-aid skills.","He immediately held Qin Maosheng. The other two foreign bodyguards retreated.","They were all too familiar with the village. Even though it was pitch-black in front of them, they were familiar with the village, so they knew which direction they should retreat to. They knew the safest path.","At this moment, everyone was taking care of their own business. They didn’t care about what other people were doing. The three foreign bodyguards asked Qin Maosheng’s men to cover them while they quickly retreated to the safe zone.","The entire retreat was very calm. There was no panic at all.","The most tragic person was the translator. When the gunshot sounded, his first reaction was to hug his head and squat on the ground. When he heard someone say ‘go’, he didn’t know who said it and just crawled over.","Cobra retreated quickly under his men’s protection. They didn’t go in the same direction as Qin Maosheng. Even though they knew that the other party was more familiar with the safety of the area, Cobra didn’t follow them. Instead, he retreated in the opposite direction.","At this moment, he needed to stay away from the target. If they were in the same place, he would be targeted by the Chinese too!","A few seconds ago, they were still chatting happily. Now, Cobra didn’t care about Qin Maosheng’s life at all.","Cobra, who had retreated to a safe zone, couldn’t help but curse in his heart. He knew that that frivolous fellow would get into huge trouble if he kidnapped the regular army of a peaceful country.","He knew it! He knew it!","Hence, what he was most worried about happened.","Just now, when that shot landed on Qin Maosheng, he knew that it must have been done by the Chinese.","He thought that the Chinese team wouldn’t be able to find Qin Maosheng so quickly. He was wrong!","They found Qin Maosheng and fired accurately.","“Mr. Cobra, we can’t go down the mountain. We should go up the mountain! Also, pick up the guns on the ground. We should be able to use them! Quick, let’s go to the mountain!” Luke shouted in a low voice. He fired the gun in his hand blindly. He didn’t care if it would hit Qin Maosheng’s men.","A mistake was a mistake. He couldn’t care less.","After that frivolous fellow was killed with one shot, the only name Luke could think of was China. There was no one else.","Well, he would let himself shoot randomly now.","Luke, who fired a few shots blindly, covered the back. In the chaos, he pushed Xia Jinyuan so that he could leave the shooting area. “Xia, let’s bring up the rear! Shoot directly! Damn it, this isn’t our problem. We just need to retreat!”","“Hurry up and leave. Don’t fight with them!”","Xia Jinyuan had already reminded his comrades not to shoot the fellow with him when they were completing their shooting.","At least for now, they couldn’t kill this fellow with one shot."]},{"number":3959,"title":"Chapter 3959: Life And Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 3959: Life And Death","Editor: Henyee Translations","If he really was a special forces soldier from Russia’s Signal Flag, they could take care of each other secretly.","Of course, Xia Jinyuan hoped that this fellow, who seemed to indulge in eating, drinking, prostitution, and gambling, wouldn’t play dirty tricks on him. Otherwise, even if he was a special forces soldier from Signal Flag, Xia Jinyuan would fight to the death with him.","Xia Jinyuan, who was in charge of bringing up the rear, didn’t answer Luke. He only used his actions to tell Luke that he was in charge of covering Cobra’s retreat.","At this moment, Cobra’s advantage was completely revealed. He brought a total of ten people on this trip. There was no need to mention the strength of the four bodyguards. All of them were elites, and their hands were stained with blood.","Besides Luke and Xia Jinyuan, the other four bodyguards were all tough people. One of them was comparable to many people around Qin Maosheng.","Qin Maosheng’s men had only lived in their country, while Cobra’s men were exposed to the international world. The latter could even compare with terrorists. The latter was so powerful that they were many levels ahead of the former.","Qin Maosheng’s drug village was overwhelmed by the soldiers sent by the Chinese government. Countless people were injured or dead. There was no one injured on Cobra’s side. From this, the strength of the soldiers could be seen.","This was also the reason why Xia Jinyuan didn’t dare to let his comrades participate in his plan. He only dared to let the Xueyu unit’s special forces soldiers participate directly. He was afraid that his comrades would be sacrificed during the battle.","“Go go go...” In the chaotic battle, Luke’s voice was hoarse as he shouted for the people behind him to retreat quickly. He was a subordinate that Cobra trusted more. He was also the one who would rush to the front every time there was danger.","Xia Jinyuan was the same as him. They blocked the danger first so that Cobra’s most trusted personal bodyguards could bring their boss to a safe place as soon as possible.","Cobra felt that it wasn’t safe anywhere now. As he ran into the mountains, he saw Qin Maosheng’s subordinates retreating in the same direction as him. He took out his pistol and fired a few shots at the black figures. He was able to solve the disadvantages easily.","He said sinisterly to the bodyguard beside him, “Don’t let these stupid fellows get close to me!”","Cobra knew that if the people in front of him got close, he would become a live target for the Chinese. He didn’t like to be a target.","Xia Jinyuan looked down and accurately knocked down two black figures that were running in their direction. He said coldly, “I’ll guard over them. Luke, escort Mr. Cobra to the mountain first. I’ll go back and meet you!”","The battle was too intense. Someone had to guard this place. Luke wanted to stay behind and bring up the rear. Cobra said to Xia Jinyuan, “Xia, I’ll leave this place to you. I’ll wait for you to leave with me! Luke, let’s go!”","Without giving Luke a chance to speak, Luke, who was hiding in the dark and dodging bullets, gritted his teeth. He really, really wanted to curse now!","F*ck!","He squeezed out a curse word from his mouth and rushed out. Xia Jinyuan was the only one left behind. The other nine bodyguards left with Cobra.","Cobra had gradually started to believe in Xia Jinyuan. However, among the ten bodyguards, Xia Jinyuan was the one who had stayed by his side for the shortest time. At the crucial moment, Cobra chose to let Xia Jinyuan face danger.","Xia Jinyuan, who volunteered to stay, didn’t think much of it. Of course, he had another motive for taking the initiative to stay.","The dense gunfire tore apart the silence of the village. The night wind, which was originally filled with the smell of the jungle, was filled with the smell of gunpowder now."]},{"number":3960,"title":"Chapter 3960: Battle Of The Elites","paragraphs":["Chapter 3960: Battle Of The Elites","Editor: Henyee Translations","The people under Qin Maosheng all picked up their guns and fired as they ran. They didn’t know where the lethal bullets would come from. In order to reach the mountain as soon as possible to protect Qin Maosheng, they could only shoot blindly and try to suppress the enemy with firepower.","They wanted to kill their way out, but the Xueyu unit came prepared. They had even prepared their position. Roars could be heard from all over the village. The soldiers from the Xueyu unit killed the enemy calmly.","Qin Maosheng’s subordinates never thought that they would be killed in their home. Some of them didn’t even realize that they were sneak attacked. They were stunned by the bullets and only realized that someone had sneaked into their village after they were shouted at.","How could that be?","Everyone in the village started moving. The officers who retired from General Minlai’s military unit and came here with positions reacted much faster than their ordinary subordinates. They quickly organized their subordinates and observed secretly.","Roars could be heard everywhere in the village. Those people with some status raised their guns and shouted at the people below, “They’re here! Shoot here! Hurry.”","“Machine guns, set up the machine guns! Shoot them back! Shoot them back.”","The subordinates guarding Qin Maosheng’s drugs were almost all retired soldiers from General Minlai’s side. They had undergone professional training and knew how to defend themselves.","As a few retired officers shouted at the group, they were finally not as flustered as before. They started to counter-attack, trying to take down all the firepower that was suppressing them.","If it were an ordinary military unit facing them, they might be able to retaliate successfully.","However, the people fighting with them now were all from the Xueyu unit. They were all elites among elites. They had undergone countless devilish training. Some of them had even gone overseas for training. They were kings when it came to individual combat. When it came to team combat, they were like fighter jets.","Ordinary soldiers in the military unit didn’t have the chance to use their heavy weapons against elite soldiers.","The bazooka was taken out. Before it could be loaded, the person carrying the bazooka and the person loading it fell to the ground.","The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade, who were in charge of reinforcements and hadn’t fired a shot yet, stared at the flickering flames from time to time. Those flames were caused by the bullets fired from the gun barrels. They were extremely dense.","The military said that these brothers’ company was the best when it came to combat. They weren’t lying at all.","They killed so many sentries and even found the drug warehouse. They even found the enemy’s heavy firearms without being discovered. These guys... were all the elites among the elites!","They didn’t know which military district these brothers were from, but they all wanted to learn from them.","The gunshots became more and more concentrated. This meant that the entire village had already reacted. Dozens of Burmese soldiers in charge of guarding the wooden house fell one after another. Before Ye Jian came to reinforce them, E6 and M’s comrades shot their targets one by one. In an instant, they killed several bodyguards beside Qin Maosheng.","They were all picking people to shoot at. The people they killed in advance were the people who punched and kicked the Chinese female soldiers.","They didn’t shoot anyone else. They just shot their targets in the throats.","Obviously, they were thinking the same thing as Ye Jian.","Throat explosion was the most torturous thing for the injured. There was a hole in their throat, but their central nervous system wasn’t shattered immediately. They could still raise their hands to cover their throats that had a bloody hole.","Anyone would be afraid in front of death, especially when their minds were still clear. They would be deeply frightened."]},{"number":3961,"title":"Chapter 3961: An Eye For An Eye","paragraphs":["Chapter 3961: An Eye For An Eye","Editor: Henyee Translations","Those fellows who had beaten up the Chinese female soldiers were shot in the throat. They clutched their throats and widened their eyes in fear...","The more they covered their mouths, the more blood they bled. They couldn’t cover their mouths anymore. They could even hear the sound of air escaping from their throats. They didn’t die immediately. In their fear, they clearly felt the last countdown of their lives. In the end, their faces were filled with horror.","The three foreign bodyguards beside Qin Maosheng didn’t participate in the beating of the Chinese female soldiers. Hence, when they came back to their senses, they still had time to hold Qin Maosheng up and retreat to the side.","Qin Maosheng, who was protected by his three foreign bodyguards, was shocked and frightened. He liked to shoot at other people, but he didn’t like to get shot himself.","But today, he was hit by bullets!","He wanted to speak, but his throat was too painful. It was so painful that he almost fainted when he gasped.","“You can’t speak now. We need to treat your wound immediately!” One of the foreign bodyguards was very responsible. He said in stiff Burmese language, “The bullet didn’t penetrate your throat. It might be stuck there. We don’t have the conditions to take out the bullet now. We need to send you to the hospital immediately.","“Now, we can only bandage your wound simply to prevent you from losing too much blood.”","The two foreign bodyguards were on guard. The other foreign bodyguard quickly took out some bandages and treated Qin Maosheng’s wound.","The blood flow was a little violent. The bodyguard first used several layers of gauze to block the bloody hole. Then, he wrapped the bandage around Qin Maosheng’s neck again and again.","“I think General Minlai’s helicopter will arrive soon. We can take a helicopter to the hospital. You need to persevere now.”","Qin Maosheng was the employer who paid them a huge commission. These bodyguards needed to do their part and guard against the appearance of the people who wanted to assassinate their employer.","They didn’t know if their boss could survive. Although the wound had been bandaged and it wasn’t bleeding as badly as before, they didn’t have much hope for their employer’s survival when they heard his rapid panting.","What the bodyguard said just now was to reassure his employer. If he could last a little longer, a miracle might happen.","It was a miracle that the bullet didn’t pierce through the back of his neck. When they were checking the wound just now, the three of them were shocked. Their employer encountered such a thing. Wasn’t God too good to him?","Qin Maosheng was still alive. He wasn’t like those people who were shot in the neck by E6 and M. They only breathed their last for a few seconds. His throat was bandaged, and he was still able to breathe. He could even speak intermittently.","“Female... soldiers... Kill... Kill...” His eyes were filled with viciousness. Even though his face couldn’t be seen clearly in the darkness, his voice was extremely sinister.","It must be the soldiers sent by the Chinese side. Those damned fellows were on his territory now. He wanted to kill them all!","He was too agitated. The bloody hole that the bodyguard had painstakingly bandaged started bleeding again. The foreign bodyguard immediately used the gauze to bandage it again and wrapped it around the wound a few more times. He said seriously, “If you get agitated again, you’ll never be able to speak again before General Minlai arrives.”","This sentence frightened Qin Maosheng. His vocal cords were damaged, so he couldn’t say a complete sentence. If he spoke quickly, he could feel blood flowing out again. He could only speak slowly..."]},{"number":3962,"title":"Chapter 3962: An Eye For An Eye","paragraphs":["Chapter 3962: An Eye For An Eye","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Kill... the... female... soldiers from China. Then... kill... the... guys who entered the village. None of them... can go back.”","Every word caused Qin Maosheng unbearable pain. However, in order to let his bodyguards know what he said, he used the slowest speed and the softest voice to give his order.","The three bodyguards thought that they should return to the wooden house and take the medicine box that was placed inside. People like them would prepare some medical supplies for external injuries. Qin Maosheng’s wooden house was also prepared just in case.","Qin Maosheng needed to use it now.","However, they couldn’t return to the wooden house.","The three bodyguards quickly divided the work. One was in charge of protecting their employer, one was in charge of firepower, and the other was in charge of contacting the outside world.","There were more than 200 people in the village. The Xueyu unit took care of dozens of them silently in the early stages. The night was dark, and the wind was strong. This was the best time for them to act. The special forces soldiers who were good at night combat moved through the village like ghosts and removed the enemy one by one.","All the reinforcements rushed up the mountain and fired their machine guns. No one was left alive.","Z7 and Han Zheng blocked all the signals in the village so that no one could ask for help even if they had cell phones.","The foreign bodyguard contacted the power station but failed. They contacted the sentries but there was no response. It was useless to contact the covert sentries now!","The entire village was occupied!","The foreign bodyguard who was in charge of contacting the outside world stopped wasting time with his cell phone. Since he couldn’t contact the outside world, he should retreat from the range of firepower first!","E6 stared at Qin Maosheng and saw him being dragged to the side by his bodyguards. He quickly dodged from the first shooting point. Under the cover of his comrades, he switched to the second shooting point. He raised his gun, aimed, and fired...","Bang!","The foreign bodyguard who was treating Qin Maosheng’s wound had just checked his body when a bullet passed through his brain. He stopped breathing even faster than Qin Maosheng.","As he fell, his entire body pressed onto Qin Maosheng. Qin Maosheng’s hands and legs twitched violently as he let out a series of strange sounds. “Ha... Ha...”","The bodyguard in charge of his safety fell right in front of him. The group of hateful Chinese armed police was here.","How dare they cross the border and infiltrate the borders of Myanmar? He wanted to tell General Minlai. He must tell General Minlai!","While Qin Maosheng was still thinking furiously, another foreign bodyguard got hit in the shoulder by M. He cursed and immediately shrunk back. He didn’t dare to move at all.","The other bodyguard who was in charge of guarding the area realized that China was targeting his employer. After firing a few shots outside, he gave up on the idea of guarding his employer. He fired a few shots at the pitch-black area in front of him and hurriedly ran into the mountains.","Qin Maosheng’s eyes were about to spew fire when he realized that his bodyguard had escaped. He wanted to chase after him and shoot this deserter, but he couldn’t push the dead bodyguard away immediately.","“Ah... Ah...” He started rubbing his legs that were pressed down. He didn’t dare to use too much strength and tried his best to keep his upper body still. He used a Herculean effort to move his legs out.","He couldn’t stay here for long. He had to leave immediately.","The bodyguard who got shot in the shoulder picked up the gun used by the dead bodyguard and retaliated. He didn’t have the time to care about his employer anymore. He could only shout and ask Qin Maosheng to leave quickly. He couldn’t hold on for long."]},{"number":3963,"title":"Chapter 3963: Blood Blade","paragraphs":["Chapter 3963: Blood Blade","Editor: Henyee Translations","Qin Maosheng wanted to leave as soon as possible, but he had to be fast.","He touched his body. He didn’t know where he tossed his cell phone. Then, he touched the body of the dead bodyguard. He found a cell phone and a pistol. Only then did he take the first step of escaping with much difficulty.","His neck was injured, but everything below his neck was fine. His escape was relatively smooth.","As for his foreign bodyguard who was a deserter, he didn’t manage to escape successfully. Xia Jinyuan, who said that he would bring up the rear for Cobra, took the shot dutifully and solved another problem for Cobra.","When Luke heard the gunshot, his heart skipped a beat. He turned around and looked down the mountain. It was too dark. Without night-vision equipment, he couldn’t see what was happening below.","However, he knew that his good friend, Xia, had taken care of another fellow who tried to follow them.","“Mr. Cobra, Xia is a very serious man. I’m very lucky that you let him be my partner.” This was what Luke, who was covering the retreat, said to Cobra beside him.","Cobra pursed his lips and replied after a while, “I know. Xia is a very capable subordinate by my side. He’ll continue to be with you. You should believe him.”","Yes, he felt that he should trust Xia.","This fellow was very powerful. He would definitely come back alive. At that time, he must bring him to drink the best wine and indulge in the most beautiful woman with a huge butt!","At this moment, Xia Jinyuan didn’t have the time to care about Luke. After killing the guy, he helped the Xueyu unit to get rid of the people escaping up the mountain. This made Cobra believe that he was guarding the rear and killing the people who might be fighting with the Chinese border defense soldiers.","It was killing two birds with one stone. Although it was dangerous, it was worth it!","Moreover, he could go back to look for another person. This was his main purpose.","The Burmese bodyguards who insisted on retreating to protect Qin Maosheng were also killed by E6. Qin Maosheng, who had a strong desire to live, heard his subordinates screaming and falling one by one. He knew that his current position was extremely unsafe. He needed to leave this place and find a more hidden place where the Chinese couldn’t find him.","He was leaning against the tree with both hands. He stood up slowly. He moved his feet with difficulty to find a safer and more hidden position.","It had only been three to five minutes since Ye Jian fired the shot. Qin Maosheng, who was shot in the throat, was saved by his foreign bodyguards in time and dealt with appropriately. He was still alive.","When Xia Jinyuan found him, he was struggling to take out his phone and ask for help.","E6 and M put away their guns. They saw clearly who was walking down the mountain. Qin Maosheng, who was shocked that he was still alive, turned the muzzle of E6’s gun to the side and deflected the bullets at the speed of light.","After walking for less than ten steps, Qin Maosheng couldn’t continue walking. He hid in the grass and took out his phone to call for help.","The process of asking for help was torturous. He realized that there was no one around him. Where was he? Where were his men?","Where did they go?","Where did they go?","Where was the deserter?","Where did the people patrolling the village go?","Where did they go?","Qin Maosheng, who was hiding in the bushes with his eyes wide open, heard the sound of bullets flying past. He used to be arrogant in front of the Chinese female soldiers but now, he was afraid.","“Are you all right, sir?”","A clear and cold voice came from the darkness. Qin Maosheng was shocked. He instinctively raised his hand and prepared to shoot. Before he could do that, someone fired first...","“Ah...”"]},{"number":3964,"title":"Chapter 3964: Teach You A Lesson With No Room For Discussion","paragraphs":["Chapter 3964: Teach You A Lesson With No Room For Discussion","Editor: Henyee Translations","Qin Maosheng, who was shot in the wrist, couldn’t help but scream. His scream was almost inaudible among the gunshots.","He could only blame himself for screaming. He couldn’t make any more sounds. Blood kept flowing out of the bloody hole in his throat. This time, there were no more bodyguards to bandage his wound to stop the hemostatic.","Qin Maosheng recognized who the black figure was.","It was the Asian man beside Cobra who he didn’t like. He was saved!","He was elated, but before he could show his happiness, his face was covered by greater horror.","If the other party wanted to save him, why did he shoot his wrist?","He wasn’t here to save him. He was here to kill him.","Looking at the black figure squatting in front of him, Qin Maosheng asked in pain, “Who are you?”","He used a few awkward sentences of Mandarin that he knew. This meant that he had a guess in his heart and guessed that Xia Jinyuan was Chinese.","“Cobra... Cobra...”","Qin Maosheng was wary of Cobra. He managed to think of Cobra’s name. Cobra was someone he had wanted to kill but gave up on the idea because of General Minlai.","This ambitious fellow asked him to go to the warehouse to look at the goods. He knew that this fellow was not a good partner. Cobra wanted to contact General Minlai alone and take all the profits in the European and American markets. Qin Maosheng knew that this fellow was very ambitious!","Now, Cobra even sent his subordinate to kill him.","At this moment, Qin Maosheng didn’t hide his hatred for Cobra in his eyes. If he had known... If he had known, he would have killed all of them tonight. General Minlai might punish him for it, but it was impossible for General Minlai to give up on Qin Maosheng for a fellow that he hadn’t even started working with.","Qin Maosheng, who regretted not striking first, widened his eyes. His other uninjured hand fumbled around him, trying to pick up the gun that had fallen to the ground. He said, “I... I’ll give you money, a lot... a lot of money... I’ll give you money, a... a lot... of money.","“Save me... I’ll give you... money, a lot of money...”","If money could allow this fellow to save him, Qin Maosheng was willing to use money to buy his life back. He struggled to breathe and threw out a bait that few people could reject.","In return, Xia Jinyuan smiled coldly.","No, he didn’t want money. He just wanted... Qin Maosheng’s life.","“Ah...”","Screams were heard. Xia Jinyuan got up and stepped on Qin Maosheng’s hand that could still move normally. Then, he kicked him down.","He kicked the spot where Qin Maosheng had kicked Ye Jian’s shoulder.","In the dark, someone witnessed everything. He almost screamed. He bit his arm and swallowed the words that rushed into his throat.","That man, that man... He knew who it was.","It was the subordinate who had been following Cobra. He actually came back to kill Qin Maosheng!","The frightened figure laid on the ground motionlessly. Large beads of sweat kept appearing on his forehead. He prayed that the man who came back would not see him.","No one noticed that this person never raised his gun. He was like a black shadow that was crawling like a snake. Even E6 didn’t see him.","“This bastard is lucky. Azure Bird, you didn’t kill him with one shot,” E6 said in the communication channel, and several comrades in the combat couldn’t help but curse.","Of course, they believed in Azure Bird’s shooting skills. However, they didn’t expect a miracle to happen to that bastard."]},{"number":3965,"title":"Chapter 3965: Reckon","paragraphs":["Chapter 3965: Reckon","Editor: Henyee Translations","“That’s good. We can take a few more shots at him!” V8 said in a cold voice. “We’ll let him know the consequences of insulting the Chinese soldiers.”","“Q King is taking care of him. Don’t worry, he won’t have a good time,” M added.","Ye Jian didn’t have the time to answer. She took care of the two Burmese soldiers and hid behind a tree. She adjusted her breathing and said, “Where’s Captain Xia? E6, M, keep an eye on him. Don’t let Cobra find him.”","He came back unexpectedly. Ye Jian frowned slightly.","If her one shot didn’t kill Qin Maosheng, she would continue firing a few more shots. She didn’t want Captain Xia to take the risk and come back.","E6 said, “I’ll keep an eye on him. Don’t worry. Cobra is already escaping into the mountains. We have to catch up. Azure Bird, you come and keep an eye on him. The two of us will follow Cobra.”","“Okay!”","In a short period of time, the three of them quickly changed their positions. Two of them chased after Cobra while Ye Jian stood guard for Xia Jinyuan.","The bodyguard beside Qin Maosheng who was shot in the shoulder ran out of bullets. Panting heavily, he found another position and took out his phone to call for help again. He realized that there was no signal at all.","The village he was in was already under the control of another party.","In that case...","The injured foreign bodyguard, who had planned to look for his employer, gritted his teeth and held his bleeding shoulder. He wanted to leave alone.","It was impossible to guard this place!","There was no need to stay in this place. He couldn’t bring his employer along too. He was injured too. If he brought his injured employer along, the two of them wouldn’t be able to leave.","Also, his employer was shot in the throat. There was no way he could be saved!","The foreign bodyguard stopped resisting and quickly left this dangerous place where he could lose his life at any moment.","At this moment, Qin Maosheng’s face was stepped on by Xia Jinyuan’s combat boots. He stepped on it very hard. It was even harder for him to breathe. All the oxygen was taken from him. He couldn’t breathe anymore.","There were so many gunshots in his ears, but they seemed far away in his ears.","“Heh... Heh...” He opened his mouth wide. He didn’t want to die, so he wanted to breathe harder. In exchange, blood flowed out of his throat that was temporarily blocked by gauze.","“You like to step on other people’s faces. In that case, you must like other people stepping on your face too. Isn’t this comfortable?”","Xia Jinyuan, who was wearing combat boots, dragged Qin Maosheng to a blind spot before taking revenge. Ye Jian didn’t know where he was.","Qin Maosheng was in despair. He seemed to have understood something. He grabbed the corner of Xia Jinyuan’s pants tightly and let out a broken scream. He wanted to speak loudly, but he couldn’t say a word.","“Why did Mr. Cobra leave overnight? He knew that you wouldn’t be able to live for long. You kidnapped Chinese soldiers? Did you hear the gunshots? Did you hear the screams of your subordinates? These sounds are telling you what happens if you kidnap Chinese soldiers!”","Xia Jinyuan’s eyes were cold and ruthless as he stared at Qin Maosheng, whose facial features were deformed. He used his combat boots to crush Qin Maosheng’s face. He hated Qin Maosheng so much that he wanted to use his dagger to cut his flesh. The soles of Xia Jinyuan’s boots rubbed against Qin Maosheng’s face that was no longer as arrogant as before. Xia Jinyuan moved toward his neck slowly.","He only moved slightly, but Qin Maosheng knew what he wanted to do. He was even more panicked and desperate. His grip on Xia Jinyuan’s calf tightened."]},{"number":3966,"title":"Chapter 3966: No Way Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 3966: No Way Out","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Urgh... Urgh... Urgh...” He made a low sound of despair. His grip was so tight that Xia Jinyuan’s calves seemed to be bruised.","There was a rustling sound nearby. It sounded like someone was crawling slowly in the bushes. Xia Jinyuan raised his head abruptly with a cold gaze. At the same time, he raised the gun in his hand.","Bang... Bang...","Two shots were fired. The first shot was followed by a scream. The second shot was silent.","The translator, who was so frightened that he wanted to leave secretly, was killed just like that.","The thick and sturdy soles of his shoes stepped on Qin Maosheng’s injured neck. Blood instantly soaked through the bandages. Qin Maosheng’s short but sturdy body started twitching violently from the pain.","It was too painful. It was even more painful than being dismembered. The more he knew that his life was coming to an end, the more his mind collapsed. He didn’t want to die, but the person who wanted him to die wouldn’t stop.","Qin Maosheng, who was arrogant in front of the Chinese female soldiers previously, widened his eyes. His eyes were so wide that his eyeballs were bulging out. If he exerted any more force, his eyeballs would pop out.","His facial features could no longer be seen clearly. His face was stained with blood, and there was a deep shoe and teeth mark on it. The current Qin Maosheng no longer had his usual arrogant appearance. He had become a ball of dough that could be flattened by anyone. Xia Jinyuan could do anything to him.","His breathing got weaker and weaker. His painful struggles got weaker too. His cramping fingers started trembling violently. Qin Maosheng heard a cold voice from hell. “You stepped on my woman. You should know what the price is. Do you understand?”","Qin Maosheng was in a daze. He seemed to have heard it clearly but he didn’t.","“But it’s not enough to use your life to repay for your action of stepping on my woman. You need the entire village to accompany you...”","The cold voice from hell was still speaking. Qin Maosheng raised his heavy eyes with difficulty and used the last of his strength. He let out a last muffled roar from his throat and struggled unwillingly.","He had to use his life to compensate for stepping on Xia Jinyuan’s woman’s face...","The woman whose face he stepped on...","Qin Maosheng blinked. He remembered that he stepped on the face of a Chinese female soldier tonight.","His woman... The Asian man said that he stepped on his woman’s face...","Her eyes turned darker and darker. In the end, even the tinge of gloominess in them disappeared.","This Asian man... wasn’t Cobra’s man. He was a... soldier from China.","Even the gloominess in his eyes had faded. Only the fear on his disheveled face was still present. Qin Maosheng only understood why he didn’t like this Asian man. As it turned out, he was... a soldier from China.","He kidnapped the Chinese soldiers, and the Chinese side secretly sent people to destroy his entire village.","The gunshots seemed to be right beside his ears, but they also seemed to be very far away from him. It seemed quiet around him, but it also seemed very noisy. It was as if countless screams were lingering in the air. He seemed to smell a strong smell of blood. It was his and his subordinate’s...","He raised his heavy eyes again. Unwilling to give up, Qin Maosheng used his last breath to support his life. He let out a last muffled roar from the depths of his throat. He grabbed Xia Jinyuan’s leg with both hands and stared at him with his eyes. His eyes were so wide that it made people’s feet feel cold. He was unwilling to give up."]},{"number":3967,"title":"Chapter 3967: Danger","paragraphs":["Chapter 3967: Danger","Editor: Henyee Translations","He didn’t hear wrong. The entire village was indeed filled with gunshots. He didn’t know where they came from. He only knew that people were shooting.","The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit, who had taken over the open and covert sentries, retreated quickly. There was no need to guard anymore.","Once the other party informed the sentry post that there was no response, they would definitely understand what was going on. Then, the sentry post would become their firing point.","That was true. When they realized that there was a problem with the covert sentries and the open sentries, Qin Maosheng’s subordinates, who were shooting randomly, started shooting at the sentry posts that belonged to them.","The moment they moved, another machine gun that was occupied spat out flames.","Bang, bang, bang...","The machine guns and bullets were fired continuously. The sound was different from the point-blank shots. Even though they were far away from the firing point, the sound was enough to make people not dare to approach.","“Hide! Hide! Don’t come out! They have machine guns!”","“Hurry up and retreat! Retreat! Danger! Danger!”","Amidst the sound of machine guns, Qin Maosheng’s subordinates shouted at the top of their lungs. Their faces and bodies were stained with someone’s blood. Bullets flew past them like shooting stars and hit someone beside them in the next second.","“Retreat. Retreat.”","No one dared to rush into the mountain anymore. Someone stared at the position where their machine guns were supposed to be. He raised the gun in his hand and fired continuously.","However, there were still people who rushed into the mountain. They needed to let some people into the mountain. If not, they wouldn’t have an excuse to attack Cobra and cooperate with Xia Jinyuan’s plan.","They mustn’t let Cobra know the true motive of the Xueyu unit. That way, they would be able to confuse Cora.","Hearing the sound of machine guns firing, Cobra’s thin face turned dark. The entire village was filled with the sound of bullets. He couldn’t leave by car even if he wanted to. He could only escape into the mountains.","He was forced to make the decision to escape into the mountains.","Cobra, who always forced others to make choices, was very unhappy. He was unhappy that there were people still rushing toward him. He took the rifle he picked up and fired at them as if he was venting his anger.","The bodyguard beside him saw this and allowed his boss to release the anger in his heart.","K7, who was guarding the muzzle of the machine gun, was scratched by the cement fragments that flew out from the wall. Blood seeped out of the shallow wound. He set up the machine gun and started firing blindly in the direction where the bullets came from.","Screams sounded. Countless people fell to the ground and wailed.","This was a war. Whoever had the initiative would be the one plundering lives.","The village was about to be razed to the ground, but Xia Jinyuan needed to escape with Cobra first. He couldn’t kill the fellow that couldn’t be killed.","Ye Jian, who was sneaking toward the wooden house again, picked up a rifle and laid down. She used the night-vision equipment provided by the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade and stared intently at the figure retreating into the mountain.","“Cobra has already retreated into the mountains. It’s about time. The number of people who escaped into the mountains is about the same. There can’t be more. After all, they were all carrying weapons when they escaped. They’re familiar with the mountains. We have to be wary of them placing guns behind our backs,” Ye Jian told her comrades.","“Roger that.”","“Roger that.”","“Entering the finishing line.”","“Okay, we’ve already started retreating into the mountains.”","An unfamiliar voice was heard. The scout from the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade said in a low voice, “If we force them into the mountain, we can force them to the top of the mountain. There’s a rock there. Below the rock is a cliff. We came from the side of the mountain.","“If they’re forced to the edge of the cliff, they can’t escape even if they want to.”"]},{"number":3968,"title":"Chapter 3968: Bloody Combat","paragraphs":["Chapter 3968: Bloody Combat","Editor: Henyee Translations","The scout who didn’t know Xia Jinyuan’s plan said in a low voice. The comrades from the Xueyu unit thanked him and started clearing the path.","“K7 and I will bring up the rear. You guys go first.” T6, who was loading mortars, said coldly. He aimed his mortars and cannons at the yellow dirt road.","They needed to prevent reinforcements from coming and bombard the only road in the mountain.","Mortars were a type of weapon with a short cannon body, a large shooting angle, and a high trajectory arc. They could withstand the recoil with a seat plate. It was easy to choose a shooting position with a small blind spot. T6 was the most suitable person to use mortars to blow up the road.","It was much louder than the sound of bullets. Once the mortars were fired, the ground shook. They landed accurately on the target T6 had locked onto and exploded instantly.","The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade, who were hiding in the dark, saw a village that looked like a blood prison. The village was filled with people lying on the ground. There were many people. There were even a few people stacked together. They were shot by machine guns.","Even though they often fought on the frontlines and fought with criminals, when they saw this scene, their scalps turned numb. They didn’t even dare to look.","The scout’s position was the best. Hence, he saw the most comprehensive view.","He put down the binoculars in his hand. As his stomach churned, his face turned pale. Broken limbs and blood was flowing out in the village... He wanted to vomit.","“Mmm...”","Someone had a stomach ache. He suppressed it forcefully and breathed heavily, trying to forget about the bloody scene he saw just now.","“Which military district are they from?”","Another team member asked softly, “Which military district are these soldiers from? Why are they so ruthless? I know that the military ordered Qin Maosheng, who kidnapped and humiliated the Chinese female soldiers, to pay with his blood. Today, I’ve seen it with my own eyes... It’s really the price of blood.”","They were certain that after this battle, no one would dare to kidnap or threaten the Chinese soldiers anymore.","“Don’t ask what you shouldn’t ask. Let’s lie down and watch your mouth.” The leader of the operations team pressed down on his churning stomach. He already had gastric problems. These few days, he had only been having compressed biscuits and cold water. After being stimulated by the sight of the bloody village, his gastric problem acted up.","No one spoke anymore. They were all silent.","Which military district would have such a terrifying company?","There shouldn’t be any scary military districts.","As special forces soldiers in the Yun Province military district, they more or less knew that there were a few mysterious special forces units in their country. They had guessed this before, but they had never seen them before. Sometimes, they even thought that it was a rumor.","Now, they felt that it wasn’t a rumor.","The company that was cooperating with them tonight might be one of the mysterious special forces units that they had always thought was a rumor.","As it turned out, they really existed, and they were lucky enough to meet them.","“Although they’re scary, we’re very lucky.” The scout finally suppressed his nausea and wiped the corner of his mouth. He said very softly, “They’re of the mysterious special forces military units. How impressive.”","Wasn’t the Xueyu unit amazing? Weren’t the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade members lucky?","“They’re finishing up. We probably won’t have a chance to act tonight. When they enter the mountain, we should be able to leave.”","The scout raised his binoculars again and looked at the village. He knew that the mysterious members of the special forces unit were finishing up, but he didn’t see them at all."]},{"number":3969,"title":"Chapter 3969: Hero","paragraphs":["Chapter 3969: Hero","Editor: Henyee Translations","“End it. Retreat!”","“End it. Retreat!”","In the smoke, the mysterious special forces unit that the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade were talking about... The special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit were wearing different military uniforms. They quickly retreated into the mountains. In the face of the smoke and flames of war, they heard the sound of bullets passing through their ears from time to time. Everyone had only one expression, and that was fearless determination.","Their gazes were cold and sharp as they looked in front of them with a calm gaze. Even their conversation was calm. It was a calmness that disregarded life and death.","Every time Ye Jian fought with them, it was a form of learning.","E6 had already entered the mountain. He held his rifle tightly and chased after Cobra and his men. He asked Ye Jian, “M and I have already caught up. Have you seen Q King?”","They had already killed all the people who beat up the Chinese female soldiers. Next, they had to complete Q King’s plan as soon as possible. There was also General Minlai.","When he realized that something had happened, he would definitely send soldiers to reinforce Qin Maosheng.","At that time, they would be facing the army of a country. It was easy to cause huge diplomatic trouble.","Ye Jian observed the darkness in front of her. She still couldn’t find her man. “No, I’ll look for him again.”","The range was too wide. Everyone was trying their best to hide themselves, including their men. It was impossible to find him immediately.","“Be careful. Don’t shoot by mistake,” reminded M. “Q King doesn’t have any night combat equipment. Find him first before stepping out. Don’t fight with him.”","Z7’s eyes turned red. He held his gun and squatted down to change the magazine. He panted heavily and said, “No, they won’t make a mistake in recognizing each other even if it’s pitch-black.”","E6 and M couldn’t help but laugh. That was right. They were all comrades fighting together. Accidental shootings shouldn’t happen to them.","“The people around Cobra are all tough people. M and I aren’t following them too closely. After clearing the area, we need to hurry up and take care of the other people who escaped into the mountains.” E6 heard the rustling of leaves in front of him. He hid behind the leaves with M and maintained a certain distance carefully.","“The main event is starting. Brothers, let’s start retreating! Don’t fight anymore. Let’s retreat after we’re done.” T6’s clean and vicious voice entered the ears of his comrades. He loaded a second mortar. This was a cannonball that was fired at the location of the drug warehouse.","The comrades near the drug warehouse had already evacuated. As the shells were fired with a loud bang and a huge explosion sounded, layers of mushroom-like fire clouds rose into the sky.","As he ran into the mountains, Cobra heard two loud bangs behind him. He seemed to have thought of something and suddenly retracted his feet. He looked behind him. The bodyguard who followed him knew where the drug warehouse was. After taking a look, he told Cobra that the drug warehouse might have been blown up.","The drug warehouse... was blown up!","Cobra’s face twisted instantly.","Just now, when he was retreating, he was still thinking that after this ended, he would think of a way to take all the drugs that hadn’t been transported out. Now, there was nothing!","The Chinese side completely destroyed the drug chain that Qin Maosheng established that was maintained by the Myanmar military unit!","It wasn’t that there was no movement from China. China had just been waiting for an opportunity to appear.","Cobra’s eyes turned dark as he watched the drugs he wanted disappear amidst the gunfire.","The gunshots in the village weren’t as loud as before. None of the bodyguards dared to urge Cobra to keep running.","After dealing with Qin Maosheng, Xia Jinyuan turned around and looked behind him. A faint smile appeared on his handsome face. Very good. After tonight, this village would no longer exist."]},{"number":3970,"title":"Chapter 3970: Beheading","paragraphs":["Chapter 3970: Beheading","Editor: Henyee Translations","Qin Maosheng’s remaining subordinates started to panic. They stopped guarding and scattered. The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit didn’t show any mercy.","Xia Jinyuan, who was bringing up the rear, killed a figure that was rushing toward them and increased his speed to catch up with Cobra.","In the monotonous green world, Ye Jian only saw his figure flashing past her eyes. In the blink of an eye, he rushed out of her vision and disappeared.","Ye Jian looked at the direction where he rushed out from and pursed her lips.","Just now, E6 told her where Qin Maosheng was hiding, and his figure rushed out from that position. Since it was impossible for him to save Qin Maosheng, he must have helped her deal with him.","In the end, at a blind spot, she saw Qin Maosheng, whose eyes were bulging. She saw a very obvious footprint on his bloodstained face. Ye Jian couldn’t help but laugh.","E6 said that Qin Maosheng didn’t die immediately after getting shot in the throat. At that time, she was also shocked. This was the first time she encountered someone who was still alive after getting shot in the throat.","It had to be said that Qin Maosheng was quite lucky to be able to survive a fatal shot.","As for her Captain Xia... he came back to do this. He did what she wanted to do.","She had to admit that her thoughts were very similar to Captain Xia’s.","She half-squatted and stretched her hand out to probe Qin Maosheng’s neck. His pupils were dilated, and his aorta was empty.","Her clear voice entered the ears of her comrades, including the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade. “The number one target, Qin Maosheng, is dead. The decapitation mission is over.” She reported what she saw word by word and asked the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade to bring the news back to the country.","Her mission was completed.","E6 and M saw and caught up with Xia Jinyuan. The two of them didn’t say anything and watched him pass under their eyes. At the same time, they fired their guns and killed a figure that was running toward the mountain.","Their shot caused Xia Jinyuan, who was running, to stop in his tracks. He slowly hid behind a tree.","“Let’s go.”","E6 and M instantly understood what he meant when he dodged. They had fought together for many years, so they knew what each other’s gaze and actions meant.","Q King’s dodging action just now clearly told them to go over for a moment.","M was in charge of guarding while E6 approached Xia Jinyuan.","“Force the people you forced into the mountain halfway up the mountain and let them lure Cobra out. Make some feints appropriately. Don’t let everyone enter the mountain and surround Cobra. When it’s time to sacrifice, you have to sacrifice a little.","“I’ll definitely do it for real. Do as you see fit. Bullets don’t have eyes. I can’t figure out the direction in the dark. Be vigilant. Don’t let me kill you guys for real.”","When E6 approached, Xia Jinyuan pulled his earpiece over. Hence, everyone heard their leader’s voice through their earpieces.","Ye Jian’s voice sounded. “The scout from the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade said that we can force them to the top of the mountain. There’s a rock at the top of the mountain, and behind the rock is a cliff. Q King, I wonder if it’ll help your plan.”","After all, she didn’t know what the main point of his entire plan was. Leaving Cobra alive and forcing the other party step by step, was it really just to let Captain Xia gain Cobra’s trust?"]},{"number":3971,"title":"Chapter 3971: Uneasy","paragraphs":["Chapter 3971: Uneasy","Editor: Henyee Translations","For some reason, Ye Jian felt a little uneasy. She felt that it was impossible for things to be so simple. However, all her comrades insisted that they were.","Xia Jinyuan raised his head and looked at the mountaintop that he couldn’t see now. He smiled and said, “It’s very helpful for me if they’re forced up the mountain, but it’s also a huge risk. Once General Minlai is informed that something has happened here, he might take a helicopter to the village I stayed in before. It’s very likely that he’ll send people from the village. From there to here, it’ll take two hours by car.","“It will probably take us two hours to force them up the mountain. At that time, we will still be moving and their men will have already arrived. If they hear any movements at the top of the mountain, they will definitely search the mountain. If the mission isn’t over, you don’t have to use your guns if you don’t have to. Do you understand?”","“Understood!”","“Understood!”","“Understood!”","...","Voices came from the earpieces, indicating that they had received everything.","They had entered their own combat communication channel, so the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade couldn’t hear their conversation.","G3 lay on the edge of the field with his gun and killed three people who were trying to retaliate. He said in a low voice, “We’ll do it for real too. Q King, be careful. Once we concentrate our firepower, lie low and let the people around Cobra do the suicidal things.","“Don’t worry. I haven’t married a wife. I don’t want to die so early.” Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows and pointed at Ye Jian. “Azure Bird, don’t you think so?”","His wife was watching him. He wouldn’t dare to court death.","Although... the entire plan was a little suicidal. Old Xia was probably so angry that his chest hurt. However, he had no choice. He knew that it was dangerous, but he still nodded and agreed. He even sent Xia Jinyuan’s brothers from the Xueyu unit to help him.","Old Xia was afraid that he would really die here.","Ye Jian felt a lump in her throat. Why did she feel that she couldn’t understand the main point of this plan?","Since he only mentioned her name, she should answer him properly.","Thus, the male soldiers heard the only female soldier in their team reply, “That’s right. You’re not young anymore. If you don’t marry a wife, the other male soldiers in our team won’t dare to get a wife for themselves either. They’ll be afraid that you’ll be jealous and kill them.”","T6 couldn’t help but smile. His face was covered in paint. He chuckled. “That’s right. That’s what my wife said too. Q King, hurry up and act. My child is about to be born, but you haven’t even gotten a wife yet.”","“Azure Bird, don’t you think this is a little inhumane?”","...","Azure Bird took a deep breath. These two people thought that their words were smart. But their comrades who did not know the truth were listening as well!","With a straight face, she said coldly, “You can discuss the problem of finding a wife yourselves. I don’t need a wife.”","X, Y, M, E6, and the rest were dumbfounded. Could they say that... their captain was teasing the female soldier, Azure Bird, just now?","The comrades were very smart, but they would never think that their captain and Azure Bird were in that sort of relationship.","Rabbits didn’t eat the grass beside their nest. Their captain was so strict with himself. How could he date a female soldier in the team? That was against the rules.","They didn’t know that there were some rules that couldn’t restrain their captain.","“Alright, when you go back this time, your first mission isn’t training. You should hurry up and get a wife. Damn it, I can count the number of guys in the entire team who have a girlfriend with my fingers. I’ll give you your next mission now. Go home and find a partner!”"]},{"number":3972,"title":"Chapter 3972: Go Home And Find A Wife","paragraphs":["Chapter 3972: Go Home And Find A Wife","Editor: Henyee Translations","After a short conversation with his comrades, Xia Jinyuan passed the earpiece in his hand to E6 and patted E6’s shoulder. “Fight well. After you’re done, go back and find a wife.”","“Yes!” E6 nodded and passed over the rifle he picked up. “Here, Captain. Take this to protect yourself.”","The moment he passed the rifle over, Xia Jinyuan was elated.","Now, they were enemies. There was still a fierce battle between the two sides. His opponent even handed his gun to the enemy. Wasn’t this equivalent to courting death?","He was happy, but he still took the gun.","It couldn’t be helped. Before they came out, they had pistols. Later on, they had to pick up guns while shooting.","Fortunately, Qin Maosheng’s subordinates each had a gun. If not, they wouldn’t be able to pick up guns.","“Tavor 21. It’s produced by the Israeli military factory. It’s based on the design of assault rifles from various countries. It gathers the advantages of famous rifles. It’s a standard red dot sight that’s suitable for your night combat.”","E6 also talked about the model and characteristics of the rifle.","Hence, Z7’s voice came from the earpieces. “F*ck, you’re giving him such a high-level rifle. E6, Q King is our enemy now. Are you going to equip our enemy with a good weapon so that he can kill us?”","The Tavor 21 was also known as a reflective sight. It used a translucent reflector to project the red dot. It was indeed very suitable for night combat.","E6 didn’t expect to pick up such a good rifle so casually. No wonder the person he killed had two lackeys protecting him. It looked like he had some status seeing as he could use a good gun.","“Take care, Brother.” Xia Jinyuan took the rifle and glanced in a certain direction. He turned to follow Cobra.","As soon as he left, gunshots were heard. It sounded like they were chasing after him.","When Luke heard the gunshots behind him, his heart tightened.","More and more of Qin Maosheng’s subordinates fled into the mountains. It was very disadvantageous for them. The Chinese side wouldn’t care that they were just here to discuss business and they didn’t participate in what Qin Maosheng did. The Chinese would only treat everyone as people they needed to destroy.","Once they were discovered by the Chinese, they would be included in the list of enemies the Chinese needed to kill.","How long could Xia last?","Luke was a little anxious. He even deliberately slowed down his footsteps and waited for Xia Jinyuan to catch up with them. They had already escaped into the mountains. Xia should be chasing after them.","Cobra didn’t care about Luke slowing down. To him, he could give up and sacrifice everyone around him as long as he was alive.","However, the bodyguards beside him felt that what Luke did was wrong. They should be protecting Mr. Cobra now. If Mr. Cobra was alive, Xia’s life wouldn’t matter.","Hence, they kept urging Luke to catch up quickly and not drag them down.","Luke didn’t listen to them. He could faintly hear the hurried ‘go, go, go,’ sounds. He gritted his teeth until his cheeks were as stiff as stones.","He knew why the bodyguards around Cobra were in such a hurry to retreat. No one was willing to fight with the Chinese at a time like this.","The Chinese had easily destroyed a village. They didn’t have much confidence in destroying the elites sent by the Chinese.","Hearing the urging from the front, Luke took a deep breath and looked behind him. In the end, he quickened his pace and chased after the group. He gritted his teeth so tightly that they were about to shatter.","‘Sorry, mate. I can’t wait for you any longer.’","He had more important things to do. He couldn’t abandon his responsibility because of his selfishness."]},{"number":3973,"title":"Chapter 3973: Bloody Strike","paragraphs":["Chapter 3973: Bloody Strike","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan didn’t know that he had already received countless apologies. He was still a distance away from the sound of leaves rustling.","The forest was too dark. If he wasn’t careful, he might end up far away from the retreat route of Cobra and the team. Xia Jinyuan didn’t have night-vision equipment, so he relied on the noises in front to catch up.","Luke, who was feeling extremely guilty, heard footsteps chasing after him. He was elated. The bodyguard beside Cobra raised his gun and shot behind him. Luke reacted quickly and nudged his arm. He said coldly, “Do you want to kill Xia?”","The bodyguard whose arm was nudged said coldly, “Maybe it’s not Xia.”","“I’m telling you that it’s Xia!” This time, Luke insisted.","Cobra, who was in front, stopped in his tracks and said to Luke, “You and Xia will bring up the rear.”","“Yes!” Luke immediately agreed. He was afraid that Cobra would change his words. Cobra nodded slightly.","He needed loyal subordinates and subordinates who wouldn’t give up their partners so easily. Obviously, this was what Luke always did.","Xia Jinyuan, who was chasing after them, heard a familiar voice from behind a rock. He looked around vigilantly and stepped on soft leaves. Then, he pushed aside the branches that blocked his path and walked to Luke’s side.","Cobra was not nearby. It seemed like this fellow was waiting for him.","As he walked over, he quickly said, “They should have night-vision equipment. Retreat to the mountain as soon as possible and avoid them.”","When Luke heard that there was night-vision equipment, he cursed and said to Xia Jinyuan, “Don’t fight with them head-on. I bet that they must be sent by the Chinese to take care of that arrogant fellow. And we’ve been implicated by him!","“None of us can rest tonight. Let’s escape quickly.”","There were no more gunshots coming from the villages in the mountains. Everything seemed so quiet. Cobra didn’t know if he had already escaped from the Chinese’s search. After resting for a while and adjusting his breathing, he saw Luke and Xia.","Luke repeated what Xia Jinyuan said before and said, “If they’re really people sent by the Chinese, there must be a time limit. So, Mr. Cobra, I think we should be safe by dawn.”","After hearing this, the gloominess in Cobra’s eyes subsided a little. His thin face, which had a gloomy expression, was not so tense anymore.","Luke’s analysis was correct. If they were really sent by the Chinese, they must have a time limit for the mission. Waiting until dawn was a good idea.","However, he hoped that he would be able to contact General Minlai when he was farther away.","He didn’t want his men to be targeted by the regular army sent by China to clear Qin Maosheng’s nest. He didn’t want to have any misunderstandings with General Minlai, who was rushing over in a helicopter.","Qin Maosheng was gone, but his deal with General Minlai still needed to continue.","Myanmar was a drug-making country. He didn’t want to give up this piece of meat. He didn’t want to lose the secret protection of the Burmese army either. Before leaving Myanmar, he needed to tell General Minlai who might have destroyed Qin Maosheng.","If a country’s and another country’s military units faced each other and both sides were afraid, he would be safe.","Cobra had already thought of what he should do next. It was precisely because he could think of what might happen in advance that he was able to control everything. That was why he was able to get to where he was today."]},{"number":3974,"title":"Chapter 3974: Respectable And Cute","paragraphs":["Chapter 3974: Respectable And Cute","Editor: Henyee Translations","Cobra didn’t stay for a second longer. He brought his men and retreated into the mountain faster. The elites of the Xueyu unit retreated into the mountain.","From the start to the end, the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade didn’t use a single bullet. Even when they were finishing up, the Xueyu unit didn’t let them do it. In G3’s words, they had all left. They should leave too.","The members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade, who were in charge of reconnaissance, slipped down from the rocks. They threw the tree branches that were wrapped around their heads to the side and contacted their leader. “They’ve already finished their mission. The entire village has almost been wiped out. Just now, I saw them blowing up the fuel tanks without even letting go of the cars. Those who didn’t die can’t reload their ammunition. The phone signal is blocked. As long as no one comes in, they’ll die from the pain.”","The scene was cleaned up very cleanly. No traces were left behind. The 200 people in the village were wiped out in less than an hour.","After the scout finished speaking, another member of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade touched the rifle he brought and smiled. “This is our first cross-border combat. We have as many bullets as we brought out. This matter... How should we write the report when we go back?”","The other six members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade fell silent. The report... was indeed difficult to write.","Before they left, they had already written their wills. In the end, not a single bullet was fired. If they really returned to the country like this, it would be a little... embarrassing.","However, the soldiers from the brother company were too strong. They didn’t even give them a chance to reinforce them. They didn’t even have a chance to fire their bullets.","They could only go back like this.","The seven members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade retreated with regret. Their mission was completed. The rest was up to their comrades.","“Brothers from the other company, I’m waiting for you to come back victorious.” The leader of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade said goodbye respectfully in the public channel and brought his soldiers back to the territory of their country.","Just now, the female soldier had already said that their number one target, Qin Maosheng, was dead. The mission of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade had ended. Now, they had to catch up with their comrades who left and return to their country with the female soldiers.","Behind them, several loud explosions were heard from the village. Entering the dense forest, they looked behind them. While hidden among the dense leaves, they could see flames soaring into the sky. Their brothers had leveled the entire village.","The explosion was too loud. The flames that rushed out lit up the mountain. The pilot in charge of piloting the helicopter saw this and immediately reported the situation to General Minlai.","When General Minlai heard this, he leaned forward and reached out his hand. Someone beside him immediately understood and passed him the binoculars.","The helicopter was pulled horizontally so that General Minlai could observe it better.","That was where he hid the drugs. There were almost 200 people guarding the village. Why would there be an explosion?","“Contact Qin Maosheng.” His skin was dark, and his eyes were filled with ruthlessness. He asked his trusted aide to contact Qin Maosheng. “Ask him what happened.”","His trusted aide contacted him immediately. He only heard the busy tone from the phone.","His expression changed a few times as he passed the phone to General Minlai.","Hearing the sound on the phone, General Minlai knew that there was a problem. He gritted his teeth that had turned black from the smoke. He touched the pistol on his belt and ordered coldly, “Contact the others!”","Since General Minlai sent so many retired soldiers over, he naturally had his spies. There was not just one but several of them."]},{"number":3975,"title":"Chapter 3975: Support","paragraphs":["Chapter 3975: Support","Editor: Henyee Translations","When he called again, he still heard the busy tone. When he dialed another number, it was the same. He dialed five numbers in a row but only heard the busy tone.","The signal was blocked...","General Minlai’s gaze was so cold that it could kill someone. The people he brought were all on the helicopter. There were only four trusted aides including the pilot. There was a huge explosion in front. If he flew over like this, they might be knocked down.","He wanted to go but couldn’t!","“Send me two platoons!”","Since General Minlai couldn’t go, he would send soldiers over!","“Yes, General!”","His trusted aide knew how serious this matter was and hurriedly called the regimental commander of the military unit.","The village where the fire happened was where many of General Minlai’s soldiers were stationed. The situation in Myanmar was complicated, and General Minlai had always wanted to control himself. He didn’t even hesitate to cooperate with the Kachin Independence Army in an attempt to control the entire country.","Now, something had happened to this village that could provide a huge amount of money for the entire military unit. How could General Minlai sit still?","Tonight, he suddenly wanted to come over and meet that Westerner. It was all because General Minlai wanted to earn enough money to buy a bomber from a powerful Western country as soon as possible. Something happened to the village that could bring the general his money. That idiot, Qin Maosheng, didn’t manage to guard the village. The general must want to kill him.","Soon, General Minlai’s military unit sent out two platoons. They quickly gathered and drove to the village.","The reason why they sent their troops was that they discovered an explosive event somewhere and needed to go over and take a look immediately.","General Minlai, who was on the helicopter, didn’t go to the village. He ordered the pilot to turn around and go to a village near his military unit. It was another village managed by Qin Maosheng. He would wait for news there and ask the people in the village if they knew what happened.","Also...","“If you see any Westerners, bring them back.”","Qin Maosheng had done something stupid. General Minlai needed to find another person who could bring him more wealth. The Westerner from the West who had some ability was a good candidate.","He could hand over the drug chain on the premise that he would get the majority of the profits.","If the Westerner didn’t agree to his request... General Minlai snorted coldly. If he didn’t agree to his request, he wouldn’t be able to leave Myanmar alive.","General Minlai was looking for Cobra. Cobra was also waiting for General Minlai’s helicopter to arrive so that he could take him away.","However, Xia Jinyuan cruelly shattered his hope. He said calmly, “According to the time, General Minlai’s helicopter should’ve appeared above the village. However, we didn’t see it.”","“I suspect that when General Minlai saw the explosion here and the flames, he chose to retreat.","“Ordinary helicopters can only carry seven people at most. General Minlai brought too few people. As a general, he needs to think about his safety. Mr. Cobra, I need to tell you my guess...”","Xia Jinyuan’s chest heaved up and down. This was the first time he spoke so much in front of Cobra. He paused for a moment and swallowed his saliva as if he was not used to it. He continued, “I’m guessing that General Minlai flew back.”","His guess made Cobra’s gaze even more sinister.","That was right. Xia was right.","Based on the time, General Minlai’s helicopter should have arrived by now. But, damn it, General Minlai was the one who asked him to wait for him. In the end, that damned general broke his promise. He didn’t plan to rush over!"]},{"number":3976,"title":"Chapter 3976: Capture Everyone","paragraphs":["Chapter 3976: Capture Everyone","Editor: Henyee Translations","Cobra’s expression was extremely ugly. He suspected that the government forces sent by the Chinese government were targeting them. If he didn’t receive support, he might lose his life. Damn it, General Minlai!","If it wasn’t for him, he would have left this village long ago!","He really, really hated Myanmar now.","There were mountains everywhere. He didn’t know where to run to.","A few gunshots came from the forest. Cobra’s gaze turned even colder. The people sent by the Chinese didn’t plan to let anyone off. They had already chased them into the mountain.","If he were in Molaban, he’d be confident that he could fight with the Chinese. But here, he wasn’t confident.","Cobra’s expression was dark as he looked at the blazing mountain. He heard a bodyguard panting. “We can’t keep running around. We need a car. Mr. Cobra, we need a car to leave this place.”","Where was he supposed to find a car?","“The road we took was blown up, and the entire village was cleaned up. It’s impossible for us to find cars and other means of transportation that can allow people to escape.”","It had to be said that Xia Jinyuan knew his comrades very well. That was right. How could they spare a means of escape for their enemy?","The vehicles that Xia Jinyuan and the rest had taken had exploded. The vehicles that were used to transport drugs were also shot by the soldiers of the Xueyu unit. The fire was still burning.","Cobra was more inclined to believe Xia Jinyuan’s analysis. That was right. If it were him, he wouldn’t leave behind a vehicle for the enemy to escape in. Since he wanted to do something like this, he had to clean up the scene well. He couldn’t leave any future troubles.","China... He didn’t expect them to have such a tough attitude!","“Walk into the mountains until we get a signal on our phones.” Cobra chose to continue walking into the mountains. He didn’t know where he was going. What about the Chinese? Did they know?","The jungle was complicated. Although the gunshots he heard just now were not far away from him, he didn’t believe that the Chinese would be able to find him.","After a short rest, Cobra continued on his journey. E6 adjusted his night-vision binoculars. In the monotonous green world, he saw his captain walking at the back, guarding the most dangerous position.","Gritting his teeth, E6 made a hand gesture and followed M closely. Ye Jian, who was beside them, had just finished off one of the people who escaped into the mountains.","The soldiers had already entered the forest. The mountain was a sharp mountain, and they were searching from the bottom up.","They didn’t lower their guard after letting a group of small fries escape into the mountains. There were many trees and leaves, and there were many blind spots. The entire mountain was uneven, and it was the most suitable place to hide. They didn’t dare to be too careless.","“One o’clock. There are two of them...”","“There’s more than two of them. There’s another person at 11 o’clock. He’s very smart. He’s hiding behind a rock and is planning to give us a surprise shot.”","“I’ll go toward my 11 o’clock and you go toward one o’clock. One, two, three... Fire.”","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Three gunshots were heard. The three hidden figures fell heavily in their hiding spot. Blood flowed onto the withered black leaves and slowly seeped into the soil.","The faster they cleared the area, the more Cobra, who was escaping into the mountains, locked his eyes on them. He knew that the Chinese had no intention of leaving.","If the Chinese people didn’t leave, there would always be danger around him.","Everyone’s expression was very serious, including Luke’s. He was also very worried that the Chinese would chase after them and wipe them out."]},{"number":3977,"title":"Chapter 3977: Chain Combat","paragraphs":["Chapter 3977: Chain Combat","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan was the least worried. He knew that the people behind him were all his comrades and hoped that they could rush over as soon as possible.","Time passed slowly. Cobra took out his phone again and looked at it. He still couldn’t contact the outside world. They were still under signal blockage. Cobra almost crushed his phone.","It was already 10:00 pm. They had been running in the mountains for almost an hour.","The gunshots in the mountains were getting weaker and weaker. This meant that Qin Maosheng’s subordinates were almost finished off by the Chinese. This meant that his defenses were getting weaker and weaker. Maybe... the Chinese would be able to find them soon.","Luke, who was bringing up the rear, shouted, “Go!”","Someone was coming!","F*ck!","Damn it, someone is running toward them.","“This way, hurry up and chase!”","Right on the heels of that, everyone around Cobra heard a voice as cold and hard as a knife. Amazingly... the voice wasn’t speaking Chinese at all. It was speaking English!","What?","These people weren’t sent by the Chinese?","A huge black question mark appeared in Luke’s mind. Did he hear wrongly? Were they not from China?","Now was not the time to clear their doubts. They heard the unlucky fellow running toward them. God, if it was possible, they could help to take care of that fellow!","“Luke, Xia, attract their attention. The two of you run this way while the other two run this way! Hurry.”","The danger was getting closer and closer. It was already beside him. Cobra immediately made his arrangements. Besides the four bodyguards following him, the rest of the people split up to attract his attention.","“Split into three groups and chase them upward...”","Ye Jian held her breath and told her comrades about her observations in time. After entering the mountain, Ye Jian’s speed didn’t decrease. Instead, it increased.","The four years of hellish training wasn’t for nothing. They didn’t walk around in the forest. The Xueyu unit was used to jungle combat, and Ye Jian was the same.","As a sniper, she was able to find an advantageous observation position quickly. It was also because she surpassed E6 and M and kept an eye on Cobra and his men.","This way, she could get closer to the man she loved.","Xia Jinyuan knew that his comrades had been beside him. The gazes that landed on him were so familiar. He and Luke quickly hid and raised the guns in their hands.","Now, he wasn’t their captain or their comrade. He was their enemy.","“There’s more here. Catch up, catch up!”","“Damn it, there’s more here!”","“You guys go up. We’ll chase this way!”","They were conversing in fluent English. When Xia Jinyuan heard Luke tighten his grip on the gun, he stared ahead... Even if he couldn’t see anything, he widened his eyes and stared...","Bang, bang, bang...","Gunshots were heard again. This time, the gunshots were heard beside Cobra. The bullets hit the trees, and the wood shavings even splattered on Cobra’s face.","The atmosphere suddenly became tense as the two sides confronted each other.","The bodyguards beside him started to retaliate. They had already been targeted. They had to retaliate!","Luke fired too. He fired at the spot where the leaves swayed. He wasn’t sure if he hit his target.","“We lack a set of night-vision equipment now. Xia, we need a set of night-vision equipment!” said Luke in a low voice, panting heavily. He quickly hid after firing two shots."]},{"number":3978,"title":"Chapter 3978: Blood Mission","paragraphs":["Chapter 3978: Blood Mission","Editor: Henyee Translations","Xia Jinyuan glanced at it. He didn’t think that Luke would be able to snatch a set of night-vision equipment from his comrades, especially since their whereabouts were all known by them.","Gunshots were fired continuously from the west side. Luke heard two familiar screams. Those were... the bodyguards beside Cobra. They split up to attract the attention of the people speaking English. He didn’t know which country they came from.","It was very tragic. They were killed before they could escape far.","“I think we should leave first...” As Luke spoke, he stood up and moved toward Cobra.","The three subordinates of Qin Maosheng, who were chased to the mountainside by the Xueyu unit, continued to run away with pale faces as they fired their guns. They didn’t have many bullets left. If they didn’t get rid of these leeches, they wouldn’t be able to see the sun tomorrow.","They still wanted to escape further. Cobra, who was in front of them, was already filled with hatred. The four bodyguards kept moving forward, afraid that they would be found.","The four bodyguards that were distracted had already been killed by the soldiers from the Xueyu unit. Everyone started to surround the mountain. Gunshots sounded continuously. Two of Qin Maosheng’s three subordinates were crippled, and one was killed.","The two people who were crippled hugged their legs and screamed. Cobra, who was running in front, didn’t dare to stop and ran on all fours.","He would not let his life end here. Never!","Listening to the rustling sounds of the search nearby, Cobra asked two bodyguards to bring up the rear. The gunshots in the middle of the mountain shocked the small movements in the mountain and made them shiver.","Xia Jinyuan and Luke had a hard time retreating. The bullets were about to pierce through the rocks they were hiding in. The sharp stones that were splattered by the bullets brushed past their cheeks, leaving several bloody wounds.","“I’ll shoot back now. Leave immediately!” Xia Jinyuan couldn’t stand up because of the suppression of firepower. He said to Luke, “You need to protect Mr. Cobra and leave this place. I’ll block him! Hurry! You will meet me in front. Do you understand?”","“One, two, three... run!” Xia Jinyuan fired to suppress them. He didn’t know if the bullets would hit his comrades who had been fighting alongside him, but he needed to bring up the rear. He needed Luke to return to Cobra first!","When the gunshots were heard, Luke, who was bleeding from the corner of his mouth, rushed out. He needed to pick up his good friend in front!","He used his arm to brush past the leaves and stepped on the rocks with moss growing on them. The agile Luke instantly rushed out a few meters. He was in front to help Xia Jinyuan retreat.","In front of them, E6 touched his head. Just now, he almost got shot in the head!","“My head almost exploded just now. Brothers, I’ll ‘hang’ first. You can continue...” E6 lay on the loose and soft withered leaves. His chest heaved up and down. Sweat kept appearing on his forehead. His tense nerves relaxed bit by bit as he panted.","According to the plan, once the bodyguards beside Cobra were killed, someone on their side would have to be ‘killed’. Who would believe that they wouldn’t have casualties?","Luke heard the sound of something being dragged. Someone had been shot, and his companions were dragging him away.","It was Xia who hit the person chasing them. At the same time, he angered them.","“They’re still running forward. Don’t let them leave alive!”","“They’re right in front. Hurry!”","He could understand everything he heard, but he didn’t know which country the people speaking were from. He fired continuously in the direction where the voice came from.","He heard a muffled sound and the sound of his body hitting the ground. He hit his target!","“Xia, retreat!”"]},{"number":3979,"title":"Chapter 3979: Fatal","paragraphs":["Chapter 3979: Fatal","Editor: Henyee Translations","Luke, who was still shooting, shouted so loudly that Cobra, who was above, could hear him. Knowing that his two capable subordinates were still holding up, Cobra heaved a sigh of relief.","The bodyguard that was protecting him sent another person to shoot and bring up the rear. Now, there were only three people beside him. Cobra’s expression wasn’t as calm as before.","Bang!","A bodyguard was hit in the waist. The huge contusion caused him to fall backward. Blood instantly flowed out from his waist. The bodyguard didn’t fall completely. He leaned against the tree and continued to raise his rifle and shoot forward.","He couldn’t see where his target was and could only shoot in the direction where the bullets came from.","X’s face was a little pale as he covered his injured arm and cursed in a low voice. He said through his earpiece, “I’m hanging up too. I got shot in the hand.”","“The people around him have fast reactions. Don’t shoot continuously. Once you finish shooting, dodge immediately and fill in the gaps from the other side.”","Fortunately, the shooting range was long, so the threat of bullets was much lower. The bullet pierced through his arm muscles directly, saving him the trouble of taking the bullet.","Y took out a sanitary pack and bandaged his wound. When he heard that, he said in a low voice, “That person should be injured too. Find him and shoot him again. Leaving him alive is a disaster. Kill him if you can.”","He used a knife to cut open the camouflage uniform. First, he gave X an injection to ease the pain. Then, he treated the wound and bandaged it.","The tear was a little big and needed to be sutured with a needle. Y didn’t do that and only bandaged it. If X still needed to move forward, he would definitely suture it. Now that he could rest, there was no need for that. Otherwise, it was troublesome to take out the suture again when he entered the hospital.","Xia Jinyuan had already told his comrades that the four bodyguards beside Cobra were quite powerful. They were not inferior to the special forces. They rarely acted, but once they did, they could kill their opponents.","To ensure that his comrades wouldn’t be harmed by these four people, Xia Jinyuan decided to settle the entire combat in the forest.","With the cover of leaves and night, as well as the help of night-vision combat equipment, Xia Jinyuan tried his best to minimize the casualty rate.","He could only lower the sacrifice rate. He couldn’t guarantee that the sacrifice rate would be zero.","On the battlefield, no one could guarantee zero sacrifices. They could only try their best to reduce the casualty rate.","Cobra knew that one of his personal bodyguards was injured, but fortunately, Luke and Xia had already walked to his side. The two of them brought up the rear again so that he could have more chances to escape.","However, the people chasing after them weren’t just coming from one direction. They were surrounding the group from all directions.","Cobra’s pale face turned even paler. The bullets came from below. They didn’t even have the chance to raise their heads.","They kept running up the mountain. They had no other choice but to go up.","Halfway up the mountain, E6, X, and Y stayed behind to guard the mountain. Now, the three of them were already ‘killed’. The chance to force Cobra up the mountain would be left to their comrades.","Luke rubbed away the grass and wood shavings in his eyes. His voice was tense as he said, “Let’s see if there’s any signal. We need General Minlai’s support.”","This was the first time he was in such a sorry state. The viciousness in his eyes surged like dark clouds. To prevent the light source of his cell phone from revealing his location, he covered his upper body with his clothes before taking out his cell phone.","Even when a weak signal appeared on the screen, the call couldn’t be completed successfully.","He couldn’t complete the call, but he could send a message!","Cobra, who had no choice but to retaliate, quickly pressed the button. He wasn’t excited because there was a signal. He didn’t know if General Minlai would help him or not when he received his message."]},{"number":3980,"title":"Chapter 3980: Bullets Flying","paragraphs":["Chapter 3980: Bullets Flying","Editor: Henyee Translations","One should never place one’s hopes on other people. Even though Cobra was being protected by his bodyguards, he didn’t think that the opponents would let him leave safely.","He could only say that with the protection of these people, the danger around him was reduced.","Unfortunately, he wasn’t even able to send a message. Looking at the English message that indicated that he had sent a failed message, Cobra cursed in a low voice and rushed out again to escape toward the peak of the mountain.","Time passed very slowly. It was so slow that one minute was equivalent to an hour. The people around Cobra were unable to shake off their pursuers. They were forced to retaliate several times.","His survival skills were amazing. It only took one hour to rush from the mountainside to the top of the mountain. In this hour, General Minlai, who arrived at the village, sent his subordinate to drive over. They were already very close to the village.","When they were about to reach the peak of the mountain, Cobra sent the message again. Finally, he saw the successful notification and immediately turned off the screen. The bodyguard beside him retaliated fiercely and asked him to retreat quickly.","“Let’s go!” A metallic voice was heard. Cobra saw Xia, whom he had begun to trust recently, helping him to retreat while Luke suppressed the opponents with firepower.","The three bodyguards that he trusted the most were being shot at. They were pressed against the mountain and couldn’t take a step forward.","Cobra didn’t really want to follow the two of them. However, at a time like this, he couldn’t delay. If he didn’t want to follow them, he would have to stay and get shot.","He could only leave!","There were a total of eight bodyguards beside Cobra. All of them had entered the borders of Myanmar, but four of them stayed outside to prevent any accidents from happening.","One of the bodyguards had already lost his combat ability. He was shot in the waist until his intestines were bleeding. The remaining three bodyguards retaliated fiercely.","They shot in the same direction at the same time. This direction was where T6 was shooting at one of the bodyguards. Then, they deviated from this position and fired their bullets simultaneously.","“Back down!” K7 shouted coldly and reminded T6.","The bullets suddenly shot over and splattered the grass and mud around them. T6 was just a little bit away from dying.","T6, who was pounced on by K7, took a bite of dirt. He pounced over a little hurriedly and pressed T6’s arm on a sharp stone hidden under the withered leaves. It was so painful that T6 gasped and swallowed the dirt that he didn’t spit out.","The two of them waited until no bullets flew over before moving their bodies.","“Are you alright? Are you alright?” His comrades’ voices came from the earpieces. V8 looked at the two people who were motionless and quickly approached them with his gun.","He hoped that the two of them would be lucky and God would reject them!","K7’s ears were buzzing. He spat out the dirt in his mouth and said in a dry voice, “We didn’t get shot. We’re alive.”","“You’re f*cking fine, but I’m not. My arm is going to be crippled.” T6, who was lying on the ground, swallowed all the saliva in his mouth. It was so bitter that his throat hurt.","The two of them replied at the same time, making their anxious comrades heave a sigh of relief. Ye Jian, T6, and K7, who went around to the top, realized that they could hear each other panting.","Being injured was fine, but no sacrifices were allowed!","“Brothers, we might have to make sacrifices this time.” G3’s voice was sharp. “But I don’t want to send any of my comrades off again.”","“Who the f*ck wants to send their comrades off? Damn it, these people are crossing the line! Surround and clear them! Sweep them all to one place!” Z7 used his rifle to sweep the three bodyguards. They got up again and quickly split up, leaving where they were."]},{"number":3981,"title":"Chapter 3981: Heavy Losses","paragraphs":["Chapter 3981: Heavy Losses","Editor: Henyee Translations","They had been working together for a long time and had already established a deep tacit understanding. The three bodyguards exchanged a few words in a low voice and dispersed. They planned to attack secretly.","General Minlai, who was waiting for his two platoons in the village, received a message. His English was average, and he could speak a few sentences. It was a little difficult for him to read the message.","General Minlai’s face turned dark when he heard the words of the translator who had been helping him communicate with Cobra.","Cobra had sent him a message, telling him that Qin Maosheng kidnapped Chinese soldiers. Now, the entire village had been destroyed. Even the warehouse where the drugs were kept had been destroyed by artillery shells. He suspected that it was the doing of soldiers sent by China.","Now, he was also targeted by the Chinese soldiers. It was very dangerous, and he needed support. He promised that he would split the profits of the drugs 40-60. He would only take 40%.","General Minlai was not worried about Cobra’s promise. The most important thing now was that the entire drug warehouse had been blown up!","There were all the goods that needed to be shipped out this year. Once the goods were sent out, it would be money. It was the money he needed to buy the bombers!","Now, the warehouse had been bombed!","It had been blown up by the Chinese soldiers!","Chinese soldiers?","Illegal border crossing?","Was it possible?","Based on China’s prudence, it was impossible for them to do such a thing.","“Contact Cobra. I’ll ask him personally.” Thinking about his heavy losses, General Minlai was so angry his liver hurt. He needed to ask Cobra what was going on.","He didn’t receive any news that Qin Maosheng kidnapped female soldiers from China!","Kidnapping Chinese female soldiers. How stupid!","If Qin Maosheng was with Cobra now, he would ask Cobra to help him get rid of this idiot who dared to disobey his orders!","Cobra’s bodyguards were almost out of bullets. They threw their guns on the ground and tried to fight with their fists.","General Minlai’s call caused some color to appear in Cobra’s gloomy eyes. Now, it was time to see if he would help.","Could he wait for the other party’s reinforcements?","Cobra, who didn’t look too haggard during his escape, felt the phone in his pocket vibrating. It should be General Minlai.","But he couldn’t answer it now.","“Step on my shoulder and climb up forcefully. Hurry!”","Luke was shouting below. He was stepping on his shoulder and preparing to climb up a rock that blocked his path. He needed to climb up quickly because the bodyguards in front couldn’t hold on for long without bullets!","After he climbed up, Xia Jinyuan said to Luke coldly, “Go up now and cover Cobra’s escape. I’ll guard this place.”","“You can’t hold on. Xia, we must leave together!”","“If I leave, they’ll know that some of us have escaped. They’ll continue to chase us! Mr. Cobra and we won’t be able to wait for General Minlai’s reinforcements. So, Luke, listen to me. You must escort Mr. Cobra away!”","“Xia, we’ve walked to a cliff. You, me, and Luke can’t leave.” Cobra climbed up and looked below the rock. He was very unlucky tonight and thought that he could escape. He didn’t expect to climb to a cliff.","His cell phone was still vibrating. He pressed the speaker button and quickly wrapped his cell phone with his clothes. Bang! Bang! The sound of gunshots reached General Minlai’s ears.","Cobra kept his clothes wrapped around him. His entire body was against the cliff, so he couldn’t speak loudly. This was the first time he was speaking softly. “General Minlai, these are all gunshots. The people behind these gunshots killed Qin Maosheng and burned the entire village. Even the drug warehouse was blown up by them.”"]},{"number":3982,"title":"Chapter 3982: Sadness In The Wind","paragraphs":["Chapter 3982: Sadness In The Wind","Editor: Henyee Translations","“I’m not sure if they’re from China because they speak English and are very skilled. There are machine guns in the village, sentry posts, and so many people. But the enemy razed everything down. You need to determine if they’re Chinese soldiers.”","Cobra’s voice was soft but cold.","The wind on the cliff was a little strong. It caused Cobra’s limbs to feel cold. Even the hand that was holding the cell phone was a little stiff. “After all, Qin Maosheng captured a few Chinese soldiers and sent a photo of him forcing the Chinese female soldiers to kneel. He used the worst method to get back the drugs that were taken by the border defense police. The situation is really, really bad!”","Cobra was angry. The angrier he got, the calmer his expression became. His voice was cold and suppressed.","General Minlai had already kicked several chairs away. His voice, which was even colder than Cobra’s, was heard. “Two platoons of soldiers are rushing over now. They’re rushing over from my unit. I’ll find out if the enemy are Chinese soldiers.","“I’m very satisfied with the conditions of your cooperation. The premise is that you have to be alive to fulfill the conditions. Mr. Cobra, if you’re not alive, everything you say is nonsense. It’s useless to me.”","“General Minlai, you need the military expenses, and I need to earn more money too. As long as I’m alive, your losses tonight can be compensated quickly. I can tell you with certainty that only I can recover your losses in the shortest time possible and let you earn a huge sum of money.","“You need money and a sufficient supply of goods. I need money and have enough outlets. General Minlai, we’ll have a pleasant cooperation. General Minlai, you must know about the Songshan family in Japan, right? I’ve been working with them for many years. I believe that I’ll definitely become a good partner of yours, General Minlai.”","After a short conversation, they reached a verbal agreement. Cobra heard the sounds of fighting in front of him and frowned. He said to Luke, who was determined not to climb up the cliff, “Xia has already given you a chance. Luke, if you really don’t want to come up, give the chance to Xia!”","He couldn’t have no one around him. At critical moments, he could push whoever it was out. As for Luke, he was a Westerner. He would be of more use to him than the Asian Xia.","If the Chinese soldiers discovered him, he could push Luke out.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t expect Cobra to ask Luke to go up and make such arrangements. Luke looked at his partner who was waiting for him to go up. At that moment, there was a sorrow in Luke’s chest that he hadn’t felt in a long time.","It was the sorrow of seeing his comrade fall in front of him and him not being able to do anything.","For some reason, Xia, who had only worked with him for a year, gave him the illusion that they were comrades. In the past, he had partners. When they fell in front of him, he never felt sad. Instead, he would heave a sigh of relief.","Now, he felt as though something was pressing down on his chest. He couldn’t breathe properly.","The sounds of fighting in front were very loud. It seemed that a few people had joined in. Xia Jinyuan shouted in a low voice, “Step on my shoulder. Go up!”","Damn it, if this fellow didn’t go up, who would save him if he got injured?","Rely on Cobra? One shouldn’t even think about that!","Luke stepped on Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder and finally climbed onto the cliff. He heard his partner say in a low voice, “Protect Mr. Cobra. I’ll lure them away.”","“Take this. You’ll need it!” Luke threw his pistol down. There were still bushes and rocks on the ground. “I’ll come back for you. I’ll definitely come back for you!”","When Cobra heard that Xia Jinyuan wanted to lure the enemy away, he heaved a sigh of relief."]},{"number":3983,"title":"Chapter 3983: Terrifying Them","paragraphs":["Chapter 3983: Terrifying Them","Editor: Henyee Translations","To ensure that Xia Jinyuan would remain loyal to him, he said in a low voice, “Xia, hold on. There’s still an hour before General Minlai comes. I’ll leave this place. We’ll all leave this place!”","A soft ‘okay’ was heard. The black shadow that was supposed to be standing under the rock left. Luke’s eyes were bloodshot.","Chinese... soldiers!","He really regretted not killing a few when he was in the village! If he had killed a few, Xia wouldn’t have to face so many enemies.","“We’ve climbed onto the rock. Let’s go!”","In the dark, G3 shouted in a low voice. Several people rushed toward the direction of the rock. At that moment, all the muscles in Luke’s body tensed up until they were about to explode.","Cobra held onto the uneven surface of the rock tightly. When he heard the sound, he restrained his breathing and warned Luke, “If you don’t want to be discovered, stop panting.”","The rock was slanted, and there was a cliff below. If they slipped a little, they might fall off the rock. Cobra only looked down at the pitch-black cliff once and didn’t look at it again. He didn’t dare to move anymore and stuck close to the rock like a gecko.","The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit teamed up and killed two bodyguards. They also suffered some light and heavy knife wounds. Just like what Cobra said, these burly bodyguards were really amazing!","V8 covered his right eyelid. Just now, a small piece of flesh was dug out of his eyelid. It was bleeding so much that his vision was blurred.","Damn it, they were still using sneak attacks!","This was the Xueyu unit’s old profession. Was the enemy going to play the same game?","They even played it well and he almost fell for it!","Four out of 14 comrades stopped at the foot of the mountain. Ten of them went to catch up. Now, three of them were injured. Would there be more?","“There’s one more person. Be careful. He doesn’t have any bullets on him. He can only attack secretly.”","“Search from the left and right. Don’t be alone.”","In front, G3 and the rest surrounded Xia Jinyuan. On the other side, T6 and K7 were vigilantly searching for the bodyguard that had disappeared. There were a total of four personal bodyguards. They had killed three, so only one was left.","There was one more person...","The tall figure that was even taller than the Chinese soldiers carefully hid. He heard a very soft sound coming from above him. It was so soft that if one didn’t pay attention, one wouldn’t be able to notice it.","But he heard it.","He quietly held the dagger in his hand and waited.","V8 walked in front. Ye Jian searched left and right carefully. They all knew that there was still one target that they had not cleared. They needed to be very careful.","V8 made a hand gesture, and the three of them slowly passed through the sparse forest at the top of the mountain. Their bodies gently passed through the bushes and leaves. A soft rustling sound could be heard.","The well-hidden black figure noticed the footsteps of a second person. He heaved a sigh of relief and slowly squatted down. In the dark, his eyes were different from the black eyes of the Chinese soldiers. His grayish-brown eyes flickered with viciousness. He was preparing to kill the last person who was alone.","Holding his dagger tightly, the black shadow, who had seen extreme combat power before, tensed up his muscles. He didn’t know if his companions were still alive. He had to fight for his life.","The bodyguard, who had been through many battlefields with Cobra, wasn’t afraid. It was useless to be afraid. It was useful to kill his targets one by one.","V8 continued moving forward. The moment he took a step forward, he immediately retracted his steps. At the same time, he raised his hand and asked Ye Jian to hide. It seemed like someone was hiding a little below them."]},{"number":3984,"title":"Chapter 3984: Strike First","paragraphs":["Chapter 3984: Strike First","Editor: Henyee Translations","“I’ll go ahead. You flank them from the back, okay?”","“Okay!”","Through the night-vision goggles, Ye Jian understood the meaning of V8’s hand signals and replied with an ‘OK’ hand signal. She held her loaded rifle and split up.","She didn’t know where the other party was earlier. Now that she knew, they had to surround him.","It was very likely that the other party had discovered them and was waiting for an opportunity to strike. In that case, they needed to strike first.","She didn’t tell her comrades that they were too close to each other. If she spoke, she might be discovered. She walked very softly and didn’t make any more noise.","Hiding in the dark, the black figure was very good at keeping calm. When he heard the subtle footsteps again, he frowned slightly. It seemed like... there was only one person’s footsteps left.","He might have been discovered!","Ye Jian, who came from the back, saw a figure hiding in the bushes. She raised her gun and aimed at the back of the person’s head.","Bang!","A gunshot was fired. Cobra’s heart sank. His subordinates had run out of bullets. The person who fired the shot must be a Chinese soldier.","Was it Xia who got shot, or was it another bodyguard?","Ye Jian didn’t manage to hit her target. Her opponent had already realized that something was wrong. The moment the bullet was fired, he rolled and dodged the first shot.","She continued to load the gun and fired continuously.","Bang, bang, bang...","Gunshots sounded from the top of the mountain. The three comrades with codenames E6, X, and Y were gathered at the foot of the mountain. Their facial expressions were very tense. They wondered how the situation was up there!","In order to let the suspicious and unconvinced Cobra know of Q King’s loyalty, they even performed the fake sacrificial performance tonight. Nothing could happen!","At the foot of the mountain, Qin Maosheng’s subordinates, who had rushed over, were stunned by the scene in front of them.","A man kept dialing on his phone. The dial tone sounded, but no one answered. Z7 and Han Zheng were halfway up the mountain. The previously blocked signal turned into a weak signal. Qin Maosheng’s subordinate rushed over, but no one picked up the call. He was already standing at the entrance to the village, but no one was picking up the call.","“Hurry up and go in! Hurry up and go in! Find someone!”","A Burmese man who was deeply trusted by Qin Maosheng and had a high position in this huge mafia corporation roared furiously. He was the first to jump into the pit caused by the shells and rush toward the village that was on fire.","There were more than 30 of them. They had submachine guns and light machine guns as their main weapons. They needed to fight with the other party, so they specially chose their weapons before coming.","Just like what Xia Jinyuan said, their mission wasn’t over. General Minlai had sent people over from the village where Qin Maosheng usually hid. While his two platoons were still on the way, these people had already rushed over.","Very soon, they entered the village and saw the tragic scene. They felt as if their blood vessels were about to burst. They all fell to the ground. Some of the corpses had even bled dry.","“Search the place, hurry!”","Their throats seemed to be about to burst. Anger, sorrow, and hatred intertwined. They couldn’t calm down because of the tragic scene in front of them.","Soon, all the bad news was reported to the Burmese man who was leading the team. Every time he heard a piece of news, the man would roar angrily. After a few times, his voice became hoarse.","“There’s no one in the dungeon. The Chinese female soldiers killed that woman. They’ve escaped!”","“Find them. We must find them no matter what. I want to kill them! I want to kill them!” The leader shouted furiously. His face was flushed red. The blood vessels on his temples looked like they were about to burst out of his skin. “Find them alive. Find all of them alive!”","“Hurry up and find them. Hurry! Hurry!”"]},{"number":3985,"title":"Chapter 3985: Bloody Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 3985: Bloody Battle","Editor: Henyee Translations","He shouted furiously. The entire village was filled with his voice. As he shouted, he held his cell phone tightly and kept calling Qin Maosheng’s cell phone. No one answered. After waiting for a long time, it became a busy tone.","The ‘Wu Sheng’ the man was referring to was Qin Maosheng. In Myanmar, if a man had a certain social status, he would be addressed with the prefix ‘Wu’.","There were survivors. Their breathing was weak. It was obvious that they wouldn’t be able to survive. The rest continued searching. Finally, someone found their boss, Qin Maosheng.","Halfway up the mountain, E6, X, and Y heard gunshots being fired into the sky. They were so densely packed that the three of them jumped up in shock. Their expressions turned serious instantly.","Q King was right!","“What’s the situation above? Damn it, there are people below! All of them are firing at the sky!” Y immediately contacted the higher-ups. They were a little far away. To maintain wireless communication, they walked a little halfway up the mountain to maintain normal communication.","The Xueyu unit comrades on the mountaintop heard the gunshots clearly. Everyone’s expression was the same.","These people were either from General Minlai’s military unit or Qin Maosheng’s subordinates from another village.","Qin Maosheng and his subordinates, who guarded the forest at the borders of several countries, were all people who had fought with the regular army of various countries. They had always been mainly involved in jungle combat. If they really fought with them, they didn’t have much chance of winning as they didn’t have much ammunition left.","Cobra’s and Luke’s tense expressions relaxed, especially when they heard those people shouting, “Don’t shoot.” He whispered to Cobra, “Mr. Cobra, General Minlai has already sent people over. I have to go down and help Xia. There are still a few people. It’s difficult for Xia to win against them.”","His wrist was held by Cobra’s cold hand. Cobra used his actions to tell Luke that he was not allowed to go down.","Before General Minlai’s men came up, he and Luke had to stay here. Even if Qin Maosheng’s subordinates came up, they couldn’t come out.","Qin Maosheng was killed, but he and Luke were still alive. What would those guys who were filled with anger do?","They would kill him and Luke!","A cold look flashed past Luke’s eyes when his wrist was grabbed. It was still not enough for Cobra!","F*ck him!","He lowered his head and tried to reject the sounds of intense fighting below. There were still two people alive. They might even be able to survive this. Xia had to rely on his ability. He had to survive!","They even sent a woman out for combat. Who was this person who wanted to take care of Qin Maosheng?","Xia Jinyuan and another bodyguard cooperated. They raised the daggers in their hands and fought with the Chinese soldiers.","T6’s arm was stabbed. Blood drenched his entire sleeve. G3 was injured too. There was a cut on his chest. Fortunately, his combat uniform blocked it. The wound was long, but it wasn’t deep.","Ye Jian became the target of another bodyguard’s attack. He heard the woman’s low shout and kept biting Ye Jian.","On the peak of the mountain, the branches kept breaking because of the shaking. It could be seen how fierce this bare-handed fight was.","They had to be vicious. If not, they would be the one to die.","No one wanted to collapse. Since they didn’t want to, they would do their best!","Ye Jian, who was being attacked by the bodyguard, stepped into the thorny bushes. The sharp and thorny thorns pierced through her pants and into her flesh. Ye Jian, who was on defense mode, didn’t notice her feet at all. She stepped back. There were too many thorns in her feet, and she used too much strength. She actually uprooted the entire thorny bush. Her feet were also stabbed by the sharp and hard thorns until they were dripping with blood."]},{"number":3986,"title":"Chapter 3986: Tragic","paragraphs":["Chapter 3986: Tragic","Editor: Henyee Translations","The lower part of her calves were burning with pain. Ye Jian grabbed a branch that was slapped on the back of her head with one hand. She jumped into the air and kicked the chest of the bodyguard who was pestering her.","She had been training for many years, so she had quite a lot of strength in her legs. When she kicked Cobra’s bodyguard, he fell backward. He lost his balance and fell to the ground. He rolled a few times and finally stopped when he hit a tree.","Ye Jian didn’t give him any time to catch his breath. The silver wire in her hand was tangled up, and she pulled out a thorn from the bush. She jumped over and brought the thorn down onto the other party’s head.","“Ah...”","The power of the thorn was not inferior to the power of a combat dagger. It was even more ferocious. The sharp thorn pierced through the bodyguard’s eyelid. Ye Jian pulled the thorn down and tore through the other party’s eyelid with extreme sharpness and ferocity. When she slashed through the eyelid, even his eyeball was pierced with a line.","“Ah!”","Another scream was heard. Ye Jian wrapped the silver wire and thorn around the bodyguard. As the bodyguard’s hands and feet were tied up, he screamed and staggered back...","As he heard the sounds of fighting getting closer and closer to the rock, Luke clenched his fists tighter. He didn’t kill women, but he really wanted to kill that woman now.","Comrade M rushed out. Ye Jian worked together with him and they forced the tenacious bodyguard between two trees. The two of them grabbed a wrist each and bent it forcefully behind the tree.","“Ah!”","The bodyguard screamed in pain. His arms were broken! His arms were broken! Broken!","His arms hung weakly in a weird posture. The bodyguard, who was screaming in pain, was stuck in the corner of two trees. M rushed forward and clamped his head with his hand. Then, he twisted it forcefully. Just like that, the screams ended.","A black shadow pounced on Ye Jian. Both of them lost their balance and fell together. They slammed into a bush that was about the size of a sugarcane. Ye Jian screamed in pain when she hit her throat. Her back hurt so much that she started cramping.","A familiar aura surrounded her. The person attacking her was none other than the man she loved deeply.","At this moment, he was holding a dagger in his hand and stabbing it toward her face.","The aura was familiar, but the identity was wrong.","He wasn’t her lover, and she wasn’t the woman he loved deeply. Now, they were enemies!","Enemies that would fight to the death!","Luke’s entire body froze. It was as hard as a rock. The last bodyguard beside Cobra had been killed. Next... it was Xia’s turn.","“Mr. Cobra...”","He opened his mouth with much difficulty. He still wanted to do his best to convince Cobra.","“No.”","There was no room for discussion. Cobra only replied to Luke with a ‘no’.","Xia Jinyuan was flipped over by his comrades. Fists rained down on him. All of them were using their maximum strength.","“Don’t shoot. Just kill him with your knife!”","The sound of sand scraping against the ground came from less than three meters away from the bottom of the rock. Luke heard a few people sliding down the mountain and rushing toward a certain place.","“It’s the last one. Take care of him and leave immediately.”","They were still conversing in English. This time, their voices were loud, and they weren’t afraid of being heard.","That was right. Of course, they weren’t afraid of being overheard.","They had never thought that someone was hiding on the rock!","When Cobra heard them say ‘last’, he knew that he was safe."]},{"number":3987,"title":"Chapter 3987: The Hardest Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 3987: The Hardest Battle","Editor: Henyee Translations","As for Xia, he was not bad. He was a good subordinate. However, he failed to hold out.","The low growls of struggling could be heard. Xia Jinyuan was pressed down by his comrades. He didn’t say anything and kicked with his slender legs. Finally, he stepped on the tree and used the force of the backlash to raise his right leg and kick the person who was pressing on him.","The members of the Xueyu unit had fought with Xia Jinyuan before, but they had never had a life-or-death battle like this.","When the real battle started, they were immediately overcome by their captain, Q King. How terrifying was his strength?","Ye Jian was pulled over by him. Her body, which was dozens of kilograms lighter than the male soldiers, slammed into a tree. She tasted something in her throat. She fell to the ground and spat out a mouthful of blood.","G3’s thigh was in so much pain that he almost couldn’t hold on to it. M was even worse. His breathing was stuck in his chest as he rolled down the mountain.","K7 didn’t break free. He grabbed Xia Jinyuan’s wrist tightly and asked in an extremely soft voice, “It’s about time. If you continue hitting Azure Bird, I’m afraid her bones will be injured. I’m already prepared...”","Just now, their captain suddenly picked up Azure Bird and threw her into a tree. At that moment, they really felt his killing intent.","Hearing Azure Bird’s muffled scream, K7’s heart jumped into his throat.","‘Captain, are you planning to send Azure Bird to the hospital again?’","Xia Jinyuan didn’t want to send his woman to the hospital. He... threw his lover aside just now. It would be best if she fainted. That way, she wouldn’t be able to see what was going to happen.","Hence, he laid his hands on his woman again.","K7’s words made Xia Jinyuan look in a certain direction. He couldn’t see her figure clearly. He only saw a black ball lying on the ground. Ye Jian hadn’t gotten up yet.","‘Little fox, I’m sorry. I attacked you again.’","Now that it was the end, she could go to the hospital for a check-up. Just now, he used a lot of strength. He didn’t know if something would happen to her.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t struggle anymore. After his outburst just now, the energy in his body was quickly drained. He couldn’t last much longer.","“The last strike.” He whispered to K7, “Do it immediately. Don’t let Azure Bird see it.”","“Okay.” K7 nodded.","Hiding on a rock, Luke and Cobra heard Xia Jinyuan making sounds like a trapped beast. He seemed to have been exhausted by the people surrounding him. They heard the sound of large patches of trees being knocked down. Those fellows didn’t plan to leave anyone alive. They chased after him angrily.","Xia Jinyuan rushed down the mountain crazily. He gave Luke and Cobra the feeling that he wanted to break out of the encirclement.","Luke stuffed a mouthful of weeds into his mouth. He tried his best to stuff them into his mouth. Finally, he pressed down the words he wanted to say.","‘Run, hurry up and run down. Someone is coming down. Lure everyone into the village. Xia, hurry up and run!’","“Don’t let him run down. Hurry! Chase him!”","The people above were shouting. Their killing intent made Luke’s forehead, which was pressed against the rock, bleed.","Xia Jinyuan ran away, but after a few steps, someone hugged his waist and pounced on him. Xia Jinyuan was pressed down by his comrades. Z7 heard his good friend say in a low voice, “Kick me further away. Don’t let Azure Bird see...”"]},{"number":3988,"title":"Chapter 3988: Cruel Protection","paragraphs":["Chapter 3988: Cruel Protection","Editor: Henyee Translations","Z7’s eyes turned red from all the beating. His nose immediately turned stuffy. At this moment, Q King was still afraid that Azure Bird would worry.","He couldn’t kick Q King anymore. If he did... Z7 grabbed Xia Jinyuan’s collar tightly. He knew what was going to happen next, so his neck became red. The veins on his neck were all bulging. He leaned over and whispered in his ear word by word, suppressing his sorrow and anger, “If you get beaten up by us again, you’ll really be crippled. This... is it! Ah, this is it! Don’t f*cking waste time with me.”","Z7 released his grip, and K7 rushed over to replace him. Now, it was the last step. Their last step was... to really kill... their captain.","Everyone knew this, but Ye Jian didn’t.","Ye Jian, who was smashed into a tree by Xia Jinyuan, wiped the blood from the corner of her mouth. She got up again and turned her head to look at the sky. Her gaze landed on the towering rock, and the coldness in her eyes surged.","Captain Xia was punished today all because of that fellow called Cobra!","She didn’t know how long the man she loved would continue to torture himself. If this continued... he would really be seriously injured. All her comrades didn’t show any mercy, including her. Every time they fought, they used her full strength.","It was because he had said, “Azure Bird, I’m your enemy now. Showing mercy to your enemy is the biggest mistake.”","She didn’t show any mercy and hit him forcefully...","Now, she could still hear her comrades pouncing on their captain again. She, who was also rushing down despite the pain in her back, suddenly heard G3’s low growl. He spoke in English to hide their identities, “Do it, hurry!”","Do it?","Hadn’t they already made their move?","Ye Jian seemed to sense something. Suddenly, she felt that all the blood in her body was frozen. Her heart dropped suddenly. It was as if it had fallen into a cold lake. An uncontrollable chill surged from her heart.","Something was wrong. Something was wrong. There was something very wrong with them.","What were they trying to do?","What did they want to do to Captain Xia?","Panic swept over her like a tsunami. She raised her head and saw a few figures twisting and tearing the bushes in front of her. Ye Jian didn’t know what was going on. There was only one thought in her mind. She must rush over and stop them.","Ye Jian rushed over very quickly. Just as she was about to throw herself over, she saw K7 raise his dagger and stab it into her man’s chest.","Ye Jian bit her tongue until it was about to be cut in half. She suppressed the word ‘no’. In the next second, her mouth was full of blood.","A second ago, she had grabbed K7’s wrist and stabbed the dagger into her man’s chest with him.","Just now, she and... K7 stabbed the dagger into her... man’s heart.","The glint in her eyes turned into ashes in an instant. Her eyes were no longer full of energy. There was only grayness. She lowered her gaze slightly and saw the sharp dagger stabbing into her man’s chest.","She even saw the dagger moving along with his chest.","It was a dagger... A dagger...","The dagger stabbed into Captain Xia’s chest.","It was a real dagger!","A real dagger stabbed into Captain Xia’s chest.","She was so close... to stopping him...","She was so close!","“Pfft...”","A mouthful of blood rushed out of Xia Jinyuan’s throat.","Xia Jinyuan wanted to raise his hand to touch his lover’s hand. However, blood and tears came spilling out. Warm blood sprayed all over, making his pale face turn even paler."]},{"number":3989,"title":"Chapter 3989: Ye Jian’s Despair","paragraphs":["Chapter 3989: Ye Jian’s Despair","Editor: Henyee Translations","He vomited blood. His little fox vomited blood.","Blood spurted out of her mouth. Ye Jian didn’t feel anything. Her entire body froze. Her gaze suddenly focused before slowly diffusing. There was no color in her eyes anymore. There was only endless gray.","Xia Jinyuan couldn’t see her expression. He raised his hand with much effort and placed it on her knees as she knelt in front of him. He didn’t dare to move too much, afraid that Cobra, who was hiding on the rock, would discover him.","He was so cautious that even though he would lose his life at any moment, he didn’t forget to be wary of Cobra.","His hand was still very warm. When he touched her knee, Ye Jian’s right knee moved slightly. Her entire body was cold. She felt that there was a trace of warmth on her knee.","The residual warmth caused Ye Jian to slowly retract her blurry vision.","Her gaze landed on his chest and slowly moved to his face. She saw him blinking lightly and whispering to her in a very soft voice, “Don’t cry. Wait for me.”","Xia Jinyuan, who didn’t even blink when he was stabbed in the chest, was shocked. He was frightened by the blood his lover spat out. He was afraid that she would be afraid, and he was afraid that she would panic. He was afraid that she would suffer before he came back. Thus, he made a promise to her again.","‘Wait for me. I will not leave you. I will definitely come back.’","He had never lied to her.","Ye Jian nodded when she heard him. Okay, she wouldn’t cry. She would wait for him. But... why did he have to do this?","The blood in her chest kept churning. She blinked lightly. She wanted to ask him... why he was doing this.","Why did he have to be so cruel to himself? What kind of bastard was Cobra? Why did he have to use his life to exchange for his trust?","Why...","Why...","Why!","Why did he have to hide it from her? Why did he have to be so cruel to himself? Didn’t he know how much her heart ached? This dagger was stabbed into his chest. It really hurt.","K7 released his grip. It was not until then did he realize how badly his wrist was shaking.","As a forensic expert, he used his fastest and fiercest speed to stab into the captain’s heart in the non-lethal pericardium.","Looking at Ye Jian beside him, K7 couldn’t help but want to comfort her. Ye Jian opened her mouth and wanted to ask him why, but a bloody mass dripped onto K7’s outstretched hand.","K7 raised his head abruptly and stared at Ye Jian’s mouth.","The sight of blood caused K7’s hand to tremble. It was shaking so much that he almost couldn’t hold the mass of blood. He raised his other hand and moved it lightly to the mass of blood...","She didn’t bite off her tongue. It was... a mass of blood!","K7’s back suddenly relaxed.","He didn’t want to participate in such a mission anymore. It was too cruel to everyone!","“K7, you’re a forensic doctor. Your captain and I believe in your professionalism. This mission is the most important and most crucial part of the mission. We’ll pass it to you.","“You’re the only person in the entire team who can stab your captain’s pericardium with the dagger in your hand.”","Major General Yang had given him this order over the phone. After a minute of silence, he said, “I refuse.”","“No, you don’t have the right to refuse. K7, this is a military order. It’s a soldier’s duty to obey orders. You don’t have the right to refuse.”","K7 had no choice but to accept the order and follow it. He stabbed the non-military dagger into his captain’s heart."]},{"number":3990,"title":"Chapter 3990: Real Terror","paragraphs":["Chapter 3990: Real Terror","Editor: Henyee Translations","At this moment, he suddenly felt that he had not only stabbed Captain Xia’s heart but also Azure Bird’s.","Now, he was still holding the mass of blood that had fallen out of Azure Bird’s mouth...","She had bitten her tongue, and the injury was very serious. The flesh on the side of her tongue had rolled. If the cut had been a little deeper, she would have bitten her tongue off.","She couldn’t ask anything, and blood was dripping from the corner of her mouth. It dripped down until K7’s hand trembled even more when he caught the mass of blood.","The hand on her knee was withdrawn. The only warmth disappeared with his hand. Xia Jinyuan looked up at the night sky that was covered by leaves. There were no stars in the dark sky. It was so dark that his lover couldn’t see his face clearly even if she was in front of him.","He moved his hand away from her knee and touched Ye Jian’s arm gently. Then, he moved his hand up slowly and touched Ye Jian’s arm. Finally, his hand stopped there. He said softly, “Leave.”","“It’s over! Retreat!”","G3 finished speaking in a low voice. Then, he lowered his head and leaned over to Xia Jinyuan. He paused slightly and said word by word, “We... will wait for you... to come back! You have to hold on for us!”","“Take care of her.” Xia Jinyuan only said these four words. He knew that she sprayed blood on his face just now. In the end... she saw the entire process and knew why he hid it from all his comrades who were carrying out the mission.","He still hurt her. He even let her see it with her own eyes. It was different from his previous plan.","No matter how he thought about it, he didn’t expect her to appear in this deep mountain forest to save Yijin. He never thought that he would see her.","He had wanted to hide it from her, but in the end, she actually witnessed it with her own eyes.","Xia Jinyuan blinked. Slowly, he closed his eyes.","He was a little tired. He wanted to rest for a while, but he couldn’t fall asleep. If he really fell asleep now... he would fall asleep forever.","Ye Jian left. She was dragged away by Z7 and G3. Everyone retreated. E6, X, and Y were retreating from halfway up the mountain.","They left very quickly. Even though they were injured, they didn’t stop for a moment.","Ye Jian, who was dragged away from Xia Jinyuan, looked at the figure that had fallen into the bushes and was gradually blocked by the leaves. The sorrow in her eyes spread like water. Her heart was so cold that there was no warmth.","All the warmth in her body disappeared when he quietly lay down with the dagger in his chest. As she retreated quickly, she got further and further away from him. Gradually, she couldn’t even see where he was lying.","Ye Jian opened her mouth, and another mass of blood fell out. She said in a muffled voice to Z7 and G3, who were dragging her, “I can walk on my own. We’ll delay time if you help me to walk. Let’s leave this place first before we talk.”","Since her mad had asked her to leave quickly, she would definitely leave this place as soon as possible.","She also heard the gunshots at the foot of the mountain. Qin Maosheng’s subordinates had already arrived. Captain Xia was injured, and her comrades were injured too. She had to survive this and not implicate her comrades.","If she had anything to say, she could say it when they reached a safe place.","Ye Jian’s words made G3 and the other 14 people feel relieved. G3 said in a low voice, “Okay, we’ll talk when we can rest.”","If Azure Bird wasn’t around, they could have kept this matter a secret. However, Azure Bird was here. Now, they felt uncomfortable because they had been exposed for hiding this matter from her.","Anyway, they would retreat first. They could talk later."]},{"number":3991,"title":"Chapter 3991: Is He Still Alive","paragraphs":["Chapter 3991: Is He Still Alive","Editor: Henyee Translations","At the foot of the mountain, half of Qin Maosheng’s subordinates rushed into the mountain. Cobra contacted General Minlai and told him their location. At this moment, besides half of them who were continuing to search for Qin Maosheng in the village, the rest went into the mountain.","The top of the mountain was very quiet. The wind blew on the leaves and made people feel relaxed. Luke, who spat out weeds, finally came down from the rock.","“Xia, Xia!” He growled in a low voice and looked down. He was too flustered. When he took out his cell phone, it slipped out of his hand and fell into the fallen leaves.","“Shit!”","He scolded himself and touched the area by his feet hurriedly. He found his cell phone and turned on the screen with trembling fingers. He used the weak light to look for his partner.","Cobra hadn’t come down. He was still watching. He was worried that the group of people who left would come back.","After waiting for about three minutes and confirming that it was really safe, Cobra finally came down from the rock with stiff hands and feet.","“Mr. Cobra! Xia is not dead. Xia is not dead!”","Luke’s voice came from below. Cobra, who had just stabilized himself, blinked slightly. He had been surrounded... but he wasn’t dead?","The mountaintop was tilted. Cobra, who was wearing leather shoes, slipped. He fell and slid out instantly.","Xia Jinyuan heard Luke’s voice and said weakly, “Shut up, idiot.”","After getting a response, Luke suddenly held Xia Jinyuan’s face and kissed him fiercely on his sweaty and bloodstained face. “Buddy, you should thank God! You’re still alive.”","Cobra called General Minlai and was rescued by a helicopter.","Before the reinforcements arrived, Cobra half-squatted and looked down at his subordinate who used his life to protect him. He said calmly, “Xia, you’ve always been my most admired subordinate.”","Xia Jinyuan didn’t reply. His chest was hurting too much. Every time he spoke, it became torture. Now, he needed to be more cautious. If he really lost his life, his little fox would be sad.","For the sake of the woman who was waiting for him, as well as his comrades, he had to protect his life.","Half an hour later, General Minlai’s helicopter arrived. Luke supported Xia Jinyuan’s back to prevent him from arching his back and deepening the wound in his chest. Then, he tied Xia Jinyuan to his back and brought him to the helicopter bit by bit.","Cobra felt that it was a miracle that Xia Jinyuan was able to survive until now.","Qin Maosheng’s subordinates searched from the foot of the mountain to the top of the mountain. They didn’t find the people who destroyed their entire village and even killed their boss.","Even when they were chasing in the forest, they couldn’t find the group of people responsible.","They suddenly appeared and disappeared into thin air without leaving any traces. No one knew their identities or where they came from. No one knew, including the last three people who were alive.","Cobra said to General Minlai, “I’m very sorry! General, I was in a sorry state at that time too. I didn’t see any of them clearly. I only knew that there was a woman among them. Everyone spoke very fluent English. I can’t confirm if they’re soldiers sent by the Chinese.","“However, General, I think that the possibility of them being Chinese soldiers is very high. They’re very organized, and their strength is very strong. Only professional soldiers could’ve done what they did.”","Xia Jinyuan was still undergoing surgery. Cobra was telling General Minlai about what happened tonight."]},{"number":3992,"title":"Chapter 3992: Hateful","paragraphs":["Chapter 3992: Hateful","Editor: Henyee Translations","His guess caused General Minlai to remain silent for a while before replying, “I’ve been in contact with China for 15 years. What I know is that China is very cautious. You’re saying that they sent professional soldiers with weapons into our country illegally. China has never done such a thing.”","General Minlai had thought through every sentence carefully. Every sentence had a deeper meaning. He just didn’t know if Cobra had thought of it.","“Also, I’ve had a phone conversation with the Chinese border defense. They said that they haven’t received news of Chinese female soldiers being kidnapped. They also didn’t receive the so-called photos you mentioned.","“Mr. Cobra, are you sure that you saw Chinese female soldiers... Were they really Chinese female soldiers? We didn’t find any cameras or film at the event location.”","Since the other party thought that everything he said was impossible, Cobra didn’t have to help General Minlai analyze it anymore. Cobra raised his hand and rubbed his temples. He replied tiredly, “I don’t know if they’re Chinese female soldiers anymore. I only know that the three women spoke Chinese.”","“A female soldier who can speak Chinese might not be Chinese. A female soldier wearing a Chinese military uniform might not be a Chinese female soldier. If the Chinese said that no female soldier was kidnapped, everything will remain as a guess.”","General Minlai’s expression was very serious. He knew that Cobra’s analysis was not impossible. However, if he admitted that Qin Maosheng really kidnapped Chinese female soldiers in front of Cobra, Cobra would have something on him.","He knew that Qin Maosheng kidnapped a few Chinese female soldiers, but he couldn’t admit it.","If the Chinese side didn’t mention it, he couldn’t mention it either. Otherwise, the Chinese side might have a conversation with Myanmar. At that time, the political enemies in China who wanted to pull him down would know that he was cooperating with the Burmese mafia, Qin Maosheng. In the end, he would be the one at a disadvantage.","Now that he had lost a huge amount of money, he was heartbroken. However, there was still Cobra. The drug chain under Qin Maosheng was still there. If he controlled the entire chain and cooperated with Cobra, he would be able to get his military expenses very quickly.","Thinking about this, General Minlai immediately gave up the thought of secretly investigating if it was done by the Chinese. Whether it was or not had nothing to do with it.","Cobra didn’t think about this. Kidnapping government soldiers wasn’t a big deal to him. He had done it many times.","Since General Minlai didn’t think that the kidnapped female soldiers came from China, there was no need to be stubborn about something that had nothing to do with him.","Thus, Cobra stopped talking about the Chinese female soldiers and cleverly mentioned their future cooperation. “I urgently need a batch of goods now. I wonder if you have the time to sit down and talk to me about it?”","General Minlai, who wanted to make up for his losses as soon as possible, smiled after listening to the translation. He stretched out his hand and pointed at the couch in the room, indicating for them to sit down and have a good talk.","He asked the personal guard beside him to pour two glasses of red wine. They clinked glasses before starting to talk.","One needed to leave Myanmar safely while the other needed to make up for their losses. Neither side mentioned Qin Maosheng again. Why waste everyone’s time on a fellow that no longer existed?","The entire cooperation process was very pleasant. At the end, Cobra made a small request. He took out a photo from his pocket and placed it on the coffee table. “General, this is a very good partner of mine. He’s also an old friend of mine. He’s Chinese. I lost contact with him when he returned to China a year ago. I want to ask you to help me investigate and see where my old friend went. I know that he’s from the Chinese capital. His Chinese surname is...”"]},{"number":3993,"title":"Chapter 3993: Live Well","paragraphs":["Chapter 3993: Live Well","Editor: Henyee Translations","Cobra tried to recall his old friend’s Chinese name. He wanted to say the complete Chinese name, but after thinking for a while, he realized that he only remembered his old friend’s surname.","“Li, it seems to be... Li. Chinese is too complicated. I’m sorry, I forgot my old friend’s Chinese name.” Cobra felt a little helpless. He didn’t expect to have to look for his old friend one day. If he had known, he would have remembered his old friend’s Chinese name.","General Minlai picked up the photo on the coffee table and smiled. “It’s enough if you have the photo. I’ll check it carefully and inform you immediately if there’s any news.”","“I’m very grateful to you for that, General. Here’s a toast to you.” Cobra picked up his crystal glass and clinked glasses with General Minlai. It was a happy collaboration.","They were currently in the capital city of Myanmar while Xia Jinyuan was undergoing surgery in the best hospital in Myanmar.","Now, Cobra and General Minlai were staying at a hotel not far from the hospital. They were waiting for news from Luke.","There were two tall and strong Western men guarding the door. When the two of them saw Cobra coming out of the room, they bowed slightly and followed him back to the room.","There were two other people sitting on the couch in the room. When they heard the sound of the door opening, they stood up respectfully.","“I’m very satisfied with Xia’s performance tonight. Now, I need you to investigate Xia’s identity again immediately. I want more detailed information, including where he was born.”","“Yes, sir.” A bodyguard in charge of the investigation nodded and made a call in his room. He started to investigate Xia Jinyuan’s identity again.","Cobra also sent bodyguards to investigate Xia Jinyuan once more. He poured a glass of red wine for himself and took a few sips. He wasn’t sleepy, so he instructed, “Prepare dollar bills for me. Give them to me before dawn.”","“Yes, sir.”","In the room, Cobra finished handling these two matters before entering the bathroom to change.","In the hospital, Xia Jinyuan, who was under general anesthesia, was undergoing surgery. Outside the operating room, Luke was waiting anxiously. From time to time, he would look at the light at the entrance of the operating room. He scratched his head and sat down anxiously.","Three hours had passed since the successful rescue. It had been half an hour since Xia Jinyuan entered the operating room. Luke didn’t know when the operation would end. He didn’t know if the surgery would succeed.","Luke was uneasy. He was physically and mentally exhausted, but he couldn’t sleep. Now, as long as he closed his eyes, his mind would be filled with the low growls of his partner.","There were also the words Xia said to him, “Step on my shoulder! Go up!”","Luke came up, and he wasn’t hurt.","But what about Xia? He might not be able to survive the surgery.","Would he be able to survive?","Ye Jian was unaware of what was happening on Xia Jinyuan’s side. She was squatting under a tree motionlessly with pursed lips as she looked ahead. She didn’t want to say a word.","No one disturbed her.","Even Z7 and T6 didn’t dare to disturb her.","K7, who had bandaged X’s wound, stood up and looked around. When he saw Ye Jian, he walked over.","Ye Jian’s vision was blocked. She slowly raised her head and looked at K7, who was blocking her vision. When she saw him, the scene that happened three hours ago returned to her mind. It was sharp and prickly. It stabbed her head until it hurt.","K7 looked into Ye Jian’s eyes and half-squatted down. He looked her in the eye and said seriously, “Azure Bird, I know what you’re worried about. He can come back to life. As long as he’s saved in time, he will definitely come back to life! I won’t do anything that I’m not confident in.”"]},{"number":3994,"title":"Chapter 3994: It Really Hurts","paragraphs":["Chapter 3994: It Really Hurts","Editor: Henyee Translations","Yes, he wouldn’t do something he wasn’t confident in. But... could Captain Xia really be saved in time?","He wasn’t sure himself, so he didn’t dare to say it out loud.","Ye Jian’s brain was still in a mess. She sniffed her blocked nose and raised her hand. She used her palm to press her throbbing forehead. Her tongue was bitten, so she bit the cotton ball that was mixed with saliva and blood. Her hoarse voice was unclear as she asked, “Why must he do this?”","K7 couldn’t answer Ye Jian’s question. He looked at G3.","It was better to let Vice-Captain G3 answer.","The team members, who had been marching for more than three hours, were taking a break to bandage their wounds. It was time for them to rest.","However, no one spoke. They silently bandaged each other’s wounds. Even when they were disinfecting their wounds, they didn’t make a sound.","They all bore with it, fiercely and forcefully.","The injuries on their bodies were nothing!","They were all f*cking minor injuries.","The person who was really seriously injured was... Q King. They didn’t know if he was saved in time. The dagger was stabbed into his chest. It hurt. It really hurt.","Compared to Q King’s wound, their injuries were nothing.","Azure Bird asked, “Why must he do this?” In the past, when they received the mission and knew the last step, they had also asked, “Why must he do this?”","They all asked the same question. In the end, they still completed the captain’s deployment plan.","K7 looked at G3, who was bandaging V8’s wound. Hearing that, his gravel voice became a little tense as he replied to Ye Jian, “Wait. Let me treat V8 first...”","“No need, I...” V8 rejected him subconsciously. He wanted to say that he could do it himself, but G3 glared at him. He swallowed his words obediently.","Ye Jian was waiting. Unintentionally, she moved her waist slightly. A dull pain suddenly came like an ax hitting her waist. She slowly placed her hand on the back of her waist and pressed it tightly.","The dull pain in her waist was caused by Xia Jinyuan slamming her into a tree. After more than three hours of rapid marching, her heart was numb, so she didn’t feel much pain.","She was only focused on walking quickly. She only knew that she wanted to leave this place. She wanted to go far away from this place.","She didn’t want to smell the blood on his body. She didn’t want to see his pale face. It seemed like this was the only way to comfort herself that nothing had happened. Everything was fake.","It was not fake. It was not fake.","It was all true!","The dull pain in her waist continued. She couldn’t lie to herself that everything that happened just now was fake.","G3, who was bandaging V8’s wound and thinking about what to say, squatted beside the female soldier. He raised his hand and patted the female soldier’s thin shoulder. He sat beside Ye Jian and looked at the distant sky.","He said slowly, “Before I tell you why, I need to tell you... what mission our captain is carrying out.”","It had to do with national security, spies, and the country’s secrets being stolen by other countries. It was a very important mission.","Ye Jian clenched her fists tightly.","“Now, let’s talk about today’s plan. We found out about this plan a few days ago. He has always been undercover beside Cobra. He needs an opportunity to gain the other party’s trust.","“After more than half a year of observation, he realized that the bodyguards around Cobra had all almost lost their lives protecting him and came back to life.”"]},{"number":3995,"title":"Chapter 3995: A Heavy Price","paragraphs":["Chapter 3995: A Heavy Price","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ye Jian tilted her head and glanced at him. Did G3 want to say that stabbing Captain Xia’s chest with a dagger was the opportunity to gain Cobra’s trust?","“There’s a man called Luke beside him. He’s a subordinate that Cobra trusts. He might be from the Russian Signal Flag military unit and has been lurking for five years. Luke’s motive might be the same as our captain’s, but he failed to gain Cobra’s trust even after five years. Although the other party saved Cobra many times, he lived well each time and never came close to death.”","G3 spoke slowly. Ye Jian listened to him quietly. She knew the answer to her own question. She understood how ruthless her man was to himself.","“Azure Bird, in order to complete his mission as soon as possible and return to our side, our captain used the most dangerous plan.","“You have to believe that he will definitely come back. All of us believe in him, including K7. He stabbed his dagger into the captain’s chest because he knew that the captain wouldn’t let anything happen to himself.”","Ye Jian also understood how much the man she loved and respected loved their country. He loved it so much that he was willing to use his blood to find the power that was harmful to the country’s defense.","“Luke is the captain’s hope. That’s why we didn’t kill him. The captain asked him to climb up the rock so that he could be saved. All of us worked hard so that the captain could complete his mission and come back.","“We’re very sorry about what happened tonight. We hid the last step of the entire combat plan from you. I’m sorry, Azure Bird.”","G3 spoke in a low voice. He told her why Xia Jinyuan did this and why they cooperated with him. He also told her that when they knew the last step and rejected it, Commander Xia said to them, “This is an order from your captain. This order is to hand his ‘life’ to you. You can choose whether you want to obey or reject it.”","Their captain had placed his ‘life’ in their hands. How could they reject him?","They couldn’t.","Hence, they all accepted it.","In order to accurately stab Captain Xia’s chest, K7 was the one who did it..","As it turned out, there was another step in the plan, which was to let K7 meet the captain in advance and practice first. That step was skipped because Azure Bird was around. The captain was afraid that she would discover the plan.","Ye Jian’s heart hurt even more when she heard that. This time, she didn’t let herself cry. There were no tears in her eyes, but her heart was bleeding.","The more her heart hurt, the more she bled. There was so much blood that the taste of blood rose in her throat.","This was his mission. He needed to investigate the power behind Cobra. He needed to have more evidence. Her Captain Xia would use his ‘life’ to complete this mission.","He was risking his life for his mission while she waited for his return.","She spat out the bloody cotton ball in her mouth and stuffed a new one into her mouth. She bit into it. Ye Jian looked at G3 and tried her best to smile. “I believe that he’ll definitely come back. He’ll never do something he’s not confident in.”","She was too calm. Besides the time when she spat blood on Q King, Azure Bird had always been calm. She calmly said that she would walk on her own. She was so calm that she kept walking quickly without ever falling behind. Now, she was looking at G3 so calmly and saying something with a faint smile.","G3 wasn’t happy because of this. He was a little flustered.","“Azure Bird, cry if you want to. You don’t have to bear with it in front of us.”"]},{"number":3996,"title":"Chapter 3996: Don’t Cry","paragraphs":["Chapter 3996: Don’t Cry","Editor: Henyee Translations","She would not cry.","G3 said, “Don’t cry, wait for him.” Ye jian nodded and agreed.","She wouldn’t cry.","What was the use of crying now?","Ye Jian touched her face that was wet with sweat. Her tongue was injured. She said in a soft voice with difficulty, “I don’t want to cry. I just want to wait. I want to wait for our captain to come back.” She wanted to wait for her lover to come back.","Her lover meant what he said. Once he made a promise, he would definitely do it.","G3 was right. Her lover wouldn’t do something he wasn’t confident in. He knew that he was waiting for her to come back, so how could he go back on his word?","Her words made G3 purse his lips. After a long time, he heaved a sigh of relief. His throat wasn’t as tense as before. “Don’t worry, Azure Bird. He will definitely come back.”","Yes, Captain Xia, who never did anything he wasn’t sure of, would definitely come back.","As a father, Commander Xia also believed that his son would come back.","After receiving the latest news from the Xueyu unit, Commander Xia, who was in the Yun Province Military District, stood in front of the window quietly and looked ahead.","In front of him was Myanmar. He could still see the mountains in Myanmar.","On the other side of the mountains, his only son, whom he was so proud of, let his comrade stab his dagger into his chest for his mission...","His future daughter-in-law had watched on helplessly. In the end, she vomited blood twice and was dragged away by her comrades. Her comrades said that it was as if her soul was gone.","How could this child not be agitated when she saw her comrade stabbing a knife into Little Six’s chest?","He just hoped that the child would be able to survive this.","They were not a group of ordinary soldiers. They would face things that they didn’t want to at all times. They wouldn’t want to face them, but they had no choice but to face them. Hence, Ye Jian had to survive.","Commander Xia sighed heavily. He had just smoked, and his hand was in his pocket. He couldn’t sleep for the entire night, so he smoked and stood alone until dawn broke.","The sky was bright. The sunshine landed on the mountains.","After walking for an entire night, the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade continued walking with the female soldier. They had to walk to the Mekong River. There, a disguised assignments boat would pick them up and they would take the assignments boat to sneak back to the country.","Their return wasn’t smooth. Although General Minlai said that he didn’t think that the people who destroyed the entire village were soldiers sent by the Chinese, he believed it.","He believed that Qin Maosheng kidnapped the Chinese female soldiers. He also believed that the photos of him forcing the female soldiers to kneel would be sent to the Chinese border defense.","Since the Chinese side didn’t admit that their female soldiers were kidnapped and brought to Myanmar, what would happen if he sent people to kill the Chinese female soldiers?","Hahaha, China wouldn’t do anything. They would just accept it.","It was their fault for saying that no female soldier was kidnapped by the Burmese army!","Starting in the early morning, General Minlai started to set up a checkpoint to strictly check all the vehicles that entered China’s territory. He also carried out strict checks on all the ports in an attempt to stop the Chinese female soldiers from going back.","Zhou Yijin and Liu Le had been following the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade. Now, there were 14 male soldiers beside them who were part of the rescue operation. Hence, after walking for the entire night, they went from fear to calmness. Now, when they saw the Burmese soldiers patrolling the mountain path ahead, they could calmly follow the male soldiers back to the forest.","The Chinese side had been paying attention to the movements of the two female soldiers and knew what General Minlai was planning. Before, they were happy that the village controlled by Qin Maosheng was destroyed. Now, no one was happy.","Major General Yang also reminded them not to appear too happy in front of Commander Xia. It wouldn’t be too late to be happy when the soldiers from the other military unit returned to the country."]},{"number":3997,"title":"Chapter 3997: Duty","paragraphs":["Chapter 3997: Duty","Editor: Henyee Translations","All the people they sent out were illegal infiltrators. If they were caught by General Minlai’s men, the Chinese would not be able to negotiate with them. Everything depended on their soldiers avoiding danger and reaching the port of the Mekong River.","“The distance is far. Even if the journey is smooth, we need to walk in the forest for around three days. Now, because of Minlai’s obstruction, the entire journey back to the country will be dragged out.”","The Xueyu unit, which was much faster than the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade, received the news that General Minlai was stopping the Chinese female soldiers from returning to China.","The members of the Xueyu unit felt that what General Minlai did was correct. If it were them, they would do the same.","They won a battle in other people’s territory last night. It was normal for the loser to want to take revenge secretly.","“We’ll catch up with the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade as soon as possible. We’ll definitely reach the port within 75 hours!” G3, who was talking through the domestic satellite, said calmly and informed the time they would arrive at the port.","Minlai wanted to find the Chinese female soldiers. If he gave the order directly and surrounded the Chinese female soldiers openly, the Xueyu unit and the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade would face a dangerous journey back to their country.","However, he didn’t. He only set up his cards secretly. From this, it could be seen that he was worried. That meant that if they avoided his checkpoint, they could avoid danger.","At 1:00 pm the next day, Zhou Yijin, who had been walking since last night, sat under a tree and took out the cell phone she had obtained not long ago. After looking at it for a while, she turned on her cell phone and saw the unread message she had received in China a few days ago.","She entered the message box and scrolled to the bottom of the unread message. She saw an unread message from ‘Sixth Cousin-in-law’.","Sixth Cousin-in-law... There was still no news of her sixth cousin-in-law. She wondered how she was doing. Did she meet her cousin? Did her sixth cousin come back with her sixth cousin-in-law? Were the two of them alright? Were they hurt?","Thinking about it brought tears to her eyes again. Zhou Yijin sniffed hard and opened the unread message.","[I’ll come and find you.]","Ye Jian didn’t say anything else. Her words were concise and powerful.","When Zhou Yijin saw these five words, the tears that she wanted to hold back flowed out. It caught the attention of the male soldiers of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade who were on guard at the side. They looked at each other and secretly glanced at the other female soldier who wasn’t crying for the time being.","They wanted Liu Le to coax Zhou Yijin, but who knew that... when Liu Le saw Zhou Yijin crying, her nose started tingling. She couldn’t help but cry too.","The male soldiers were speechless.","Forget it. There was no need to coax them. They just needed to cry. They had been crying all the way here. There was no need for the male soldiers to comfort them. They would stop their tears voluntarily.","Zhou Yijin buried her head in her arms and cried until she couldn’t breathe. She sent a distress message and her sixth cousin-in-law replied, “I’ll come and find you.” Her sixth cousin-in-law really did as she said.","She risked her life to get her back!","Now, she was out of danger. What about her sixth cousin-in-law?","Was she okay?","Burying her head, Zhou Yijin cried until her eyes were swollen again. Then, she recovered.","The male soldiers heaved a sigh of relief. It was good that she was no longer crying.","After contacting their superiors again, the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade soldiers quickly learned that after a night of intense fighting, their mysterious comrades, who had a zero casualty rate, were rushing back to their country. At the same time, they encountered the checkpoint set up by General Minlai and were also detouring into the Mekong River.","They would take a boat back to their country at the same port. Thus, the two military units that had lost contact with each other contacted each other again and agreed on a place to meet. Then, they would take a disguised assignments boat back to their country."]},{"number":3998,"title":"Chapter 3998: Good Times","paragraphs":["Chapter 3998: Good Times","Editor: Henyee Translations","When Zhou Yijin knew that she would be able to see Ye Jian soon, her mood was so good that her delicate face was glowing. Her gloominess was gone. She hugged Liu Le and almost jumped with joy.","The male soldiers were in a good mood too. The unit with a sacrifice rate of zero was coming back. This was good news.","Looking at the time, they estimated that they should be here by 9:00 pm.","The group continued to move toward the place where they had agreed to meet. This time, the members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade could close their eyes and rest.","The two teams needed to meet up. They had to walk on mountain roads. The other military unit would reach the Mekong River in about 48 hours, which was two days later. Then, they would leave by boat.","They could arrive in 48 hours without any rest. If they rested during the journey, they would have to postpone the plan.","The Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade could rest now. They wondered if the mysterious company would rest too.","The members of the Xueyu unit didn’t rest for a long time. The Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade had the female soldiers with them and were waiting for them to meet up. They couldn’t rest for too long so that they wouldn’t waste time.","The members of the Xueyu unit had been traveling since last night. The 15 special forces soldiers, including Ye Jian, didn’t rest. Ye Jian didn’t even deal with the hard thorns in her calves.","K7 looked at Ye Jian’s legs. He could only remove the thorns that were easy to deal with. He couldn’t deal with the rest of the broken thorns.","First, there were too many broken thorns. Second, it would take too much time. Third, picking thorns was a delicate job. They couldn’t stop to pick out the broken thorns in Ye Jian’s legs.","The thorns had to be left in. They could only be dealt with once they returned.","As for her tongue... it was even more difficult to deal with it. One side of her tongue had been bitten badly. She needed stitches.","“Disinfect it with iodine. Disinfect it immediately after you return to the country. Don’t talk so much.” K7 lowered his head and sprayed the iodine on Ye Jian’s slender calves.","Fortunately, Ye Jian’s physique was strong. She only had a few inflammations after being pricked by so many broken thorns. K7 felt more at ease.","The iodine was a little stimulating, and Ye Jian was stabbed on a large scale. Her calves and stomach trembled when she was sprayed with it.","The sky had just turned hazy, so K7 could see her trembling calves. K7’s thin but cold face turned colder. After he finished spraying, he pursed his pale lips and stared at Ye Jian with frightening eyes for a long time.","When he saw that Ye Jian was starting to get frightened, K7, who was a man of few words, said coldly, “Enduring for a long time is self-torture.”","In other words, she was asking for trouble. No one would feel sorry for her.","Only their comrades could understand his concise sentence.","Ye Jian pulled down the rolled-up edge of her pants and swallowed a mouthful of blood. She explained vaguely, “I’m not torturing myself. There are too many thorns. It’s not easy to pick them out. I can only wait to go back to China to deal with it. Look at our situation now. There’s nothing I can do, right?”","The corners of K7’s mouth twitched. In the end, he didn’t say anything.","He was bad at speaking. He didn’t know how to phrase his words correctly.","He didn’t mean it that way, but she seemed to have misunderstood him. Forget it, he wouldn’t explain anymore.","K7 felt that he might have said something wrong, so he pursed his lips tighter. He kept the iodine... and left.","Should he really consider buying a few books that could help him communicate with other people? He didn’t feel that there was a problem when he was communicating with male soldiers, but he was always worried that he would say the wrong things when communicating with Azure Bird."]},{"number":3999,"title":"Chapter 3999: Deep Yearning","paragraphs":["Chapter 3999: Deep Yearning","Editor: Henyee Translations","K7 wanted to ask Z7 about it when he went back. This fellow should be able to recommend a book to him.","The five-minute break was over. G3 shouted, “Let’s go!” The group of 15 people walked quickly in the dense forest.","They were all used to such high-intensity marches, so they didn’t feel that their bodies were tired even when their stamina was indeed severely depleted. They would get a few wild rabbits in the forest and catch a few poisonous snakes. They would skin them and eat them. Then, they would replenish their nutrition and continue moving forward.","They were already used to eating raw food. They took in their calories and rested for a while before continuing.","They were tired now, but it was all so that they could return to their country as soon as possible. Hence, it was not a big deal to be tired.","When the 14 male soldiers of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade saw their comrades, who set off six hours later than them, gathering with them at 8:40 pm the next night, they were dumbfounded.","They had guessed that these brothers from the mysterious special forces would arrive at around 11:00 pm at the earliest. And that was if they didn’t have any rest along the way.","Now, they arrived several hours earlier than they expected!","This speed was extraordinarily fast.","Their speed shocked them. What shocked them even more was their perseverance!","After a high-intensity combat, they took a long journey while injured. They didn’t rest at all and gathered with them in advance. As special forces soldiers from the Yun Province Military District, they were really impressed by this mysterious special forces unit!","They were convinced!","If it were them, it would be very difficult for them to do it. No, it should be said that it was impossible!","Ye Jian was already holding hands with Zhou Yijin and Liu Le. The three of them held each other’s hands and looked at each other. Then, they hugged each other. It was unknown if they were crying or laughing.","Ye Jian didn’t know what to say, so she pursed her lips and smiled.","The 14 members of the Cloud Leopard Commando Brigade and the 14 members of the Xueyu unit punched each other. This was a meeting between men. It was much cooler than the female soldiers.","Zhou Yijin, who was crying and laughing at the same time, wiped the tears off her face and stared intently at her sixth cousin-in-law. She wanted to laugh and cry at the same time. “Six...”","She wanted to say ‘Sixth Cousin-in-law’ but Ye Jian ignored the pain in her tongue and coughed lightly. Zhou Yijin immediately reacted. “Liu Le and I kept thinking about when you could return to the country. We wondered if you would encounter any danger if you stayed here alone. What if you got caught by those people? What would they do to you? The two of us cried as we thought about it. The male soldiers didn’t know how to comfort us.”","“This is good. We’re together again. Quick, let me see if you’re hurt.”","This was great! Her sixth cousin-in-law was fine. They had met up with each other!","“When the male soldiers told me you were coming, I really thought that they were saying it to coax me. Now... Sob...” Zhou Yijin finally stopped crying. She hugged Ye Jian and cried again.","Coincidentally, she was hugging Ye Jian’s waist. Ye Jian’s waist had been hurting all this while, and Zhou Yijin hugged Ye Jian forcefully. Ye Jian’s body was already very tired so she couldn’t help but gasp.","Although Zhou Yijin was crying, she heard it. She gasped and asked nervously, “You’re injured. I know you’re injured. I heard you gasping in pain just now.”","Her voice was loud, so the soldiers from the Xueyu unit heard it.","G3 and K7 strode over and stared at Ye Jian. “Where’s the injury? Why didn’t you tell us?”","The wound was on her waist, and there was no blood, so she didn’t say anything.","G3’s and K7’s faces turned gloomy when they heard her explanation to her comrades."]},{"number":4000,"title":"Chapter 4000: Heartache","paragraphs":["Chapter 4000: Heartache","Editor: Henyee Translations","The place they agreed to wait at was a small flat piece of land in the mountains. There were trees around it to protect them from being discovered easily. Ye Jian sat down under the gazes of her comrades and lifted her clothes so that Zhou Yijin could see how injured she was.","When the clothes were lifted, Zhou Yijin saw that Ye Jian’s waist was swollen and purple. Her hands were shaking as she looked up at K7.","K7’s expression wasn’t as serious as before. He reached out his hand and pressed on the bruise that formed a horizontal line. He asked Ye Jian how painful it was.","It didn’t hurt much. K7 was relieved by her reply.","It looked scary, but it was alright.","Zhou Yijin didn’t hear K7’s reply, so she got anxious. “Is your injury very serious? Did you hurt your bones? This is your lumbar spine. Did you hurt your lumbar spine? It should be so painful that you can’t even speak properly. Why are you saying that you’re fine?”","She didn’t notice that Ye Jian’s tongue was injured.","K7 glanced at the anxious female soldier and said coldly, “It’s alright. You shouldn’t talk so much.” Could one walk when one’s back was injured? Where was her common sense?","“It’s alright? Are you sure you know how to analyze injuries? You even asked me to speak less!” Ye Jian was injured to this extent, but he still said that she was alright. Zhou Yijin was furious. “I know why she didn’t tell you. It’s because it’s useless. As long as she doesn’t have broken bones or gunshot wounds, she won’t die, right? And you’ll say that she’s alright.”","“It’s the truth.” K7 was a man of few words. He didn’t feel that he was wrong, so he replied to Ye Jian, “It’s not a big problem. You can walk.”","“You don’t even know how to examine her correctly!” Zhou Yijin growled.","Ye Jian put down her clothes and opened her mouth to let Zhou Yijin see her injured tongue. Then, she explained in a low voice, “I know that I’m fine. Don’t worry. I’m really fine. My injuries just look scary.”","K7 knew that the rescued female soldier was angry, but as a male soldier, he wasn’t bothered by it. He nodded slightly and walked toward his comrades who were waiting for the news.","If Ye Jian didn’t hold Zhou Yijin back, she would’ve jumped up and created trouble for K7.","How could he say that she was fine when she was so badly injured? Was he blind?","Ye Jian’s tongue was injured so badly that Zhou Yijin could see that it was about to break.","Zhou Yijin was so anxious that she started crying. What should she do? What should she do? If Sixth Cousin knew that Sixth Cousin-in-law was injured like this, he would go crazy. That was right. Where was Sixth Cousin? Why didn’t she see him?","Zhou Yijin was so anxious that her eyes turned red. She wanted to look for Xia Jinyuan. Ye Jian pulled her hand and said slowly, “Didn’t you say that what I do is similar to what your sixth cousin does? So, Yijin, these injuries aren’t a problem. It’s not a problem as long as I don’t break my bones or get shot.","“Look at those few injured people. Their bandages are soaked in blood, but they still look fine. I just fell once. There’s nothing wrong. Your cousin isn’t here. He will be back later. Don’t look for him.”","Zhou Yijin didn’t want Ye Jian to waste her energy because of her. Her tongue was hurt, so she couldn’t let her sixth cousin-in-law speak too much. She gritted her teeth and nodded to show that she understood. However, her heart was bitter, and she wanted to cry again.","No, Ye Jian’s tongue was already injured. She had to treat it properly. Zhou Yijin would look for the male soldiers who were responsible for sending her and Liu Le back to the country!","K7 went back and told the others about Ye Jian’s situation. Frowning, he added, “This is the second time she was beaten up till she has to be sent to the hospital.”","It wasn’t a big problem, but she still needed to go to the hospital. Her back was swollen and purple. She might need an anti-inflammatory shot and stay in the hospital for a few more days for observation."]}]);
